  "21-25 Animal Parade: Successful pairs rotate the survivors and reward attention to motion.": "21-25 动物游行：成功的配对轮换幸存者并奖励对运动的关注。",
  "21-25 Harvest Routes makes fruit mandatory while mixing mud, gates, and fragile choices.": "21-25 收获路线强制要求水果，同时混合泥土、门和易碎的选择。",
