  "Aim {angle}° from center. Left/Right adjust; Space or Enter fires.": "瞄准距中心 {angle}°。左/右调节；空间或进入火灾。",
  "Aim {value}%": "目标 {value}%",
  "Aim against wind drift and re-read moving rows after every shot.": "瞄准风漂移并在每次射击后重新读取移动的行。",
  "Aim ahead of a quick basket": "瞄准前方快速投篮",
  "Aim and ricochet: drag from the launcher to see the initial path, then release. The main orb and one weaker echo orb travel at related angles. Wall banks can cross multiple lanes or reach a target hidden behind another formation. Split Orb can add a third projectile, while Piercing Shine shortens the delay before one orb can hit the same target again.": "瞄准和跳弹：从发射器中拖动以查看初始路径，然后释放。主球和一个较弱的回声球以相关角度行进。墙岸可以跨越多条车道或到达隐藏在另一个编队后面的目标。分裂球可以添加第三个射弹，而穿透光芒可以缩短一个球再次击中同一目标之前的延迟。",
  "Aim animal orbs through crystal fortress rooms, plan bounce routes, grow your base, and prepare for boss waves.": "通过水晶堡垒房间瞄准动物球，规划弹跳路线，扩大你的基地，并为 Boss 浪潮做好准备。",
  "Aim at a side wall to bank the shot": "瞄准侧壁进行射击",
  "Aim at matching bubbles to form a group": "瞄准匹配气泡以形成一组",
  "Aim Fia's prism stream through multiplier gates, grow a spirit battalion, and break 30 evolving shadow fortresses.": "瞄准 Fia 的棱镜流穿过倍增门，培养一支精神军团，并打破 30 个不断演变的暗影堡垒。",
  "Aim near another {name} to merge.": "瞄准另一个 {name} 附近进行合并。",
  "Aim spirit orbs through 30 ricochet-defense routes with special enemies, moving mirror pylons, six unique Bosses, and local fortress growth.": "瞄准精神球穿过 30 条跳弹防御路线，其中包括特殊的敌人、移动镜塔、六个独特的 Boss 和当地的要塞增长。",
  "Aim the spirit orb through the crystal fortress.": "将灵魂球瞄准水晶堡垒。",
  "Aim through 30 rescue levels with reactive blockers, wind, moving rows, and four power bubbles.": "利用反应性阻挡物、风、移动行和四个能量泡泡，瞄准 30 个救援关卡。",
  "Aim through a moving moon gate that changes the bank corridor.": "瞄准改变银行走廊的移动月门。",
  "Aim through moving pylons while chargers mark lanes.": "瞄准移动的塔架，同时充电器标记车道。",
  "Aim with touch, pointer movement, or Left and Right, then drop with touch, Space, or Enter.": "通过触摸、指针移动或左右瞄准，然后通过触摸、空格键或 Enter 落下。",
