  "An Abyss Guard, Prism Basilisk, or Emperor guard may be active. Skills remove guard faster than automatic attacks.": "深渊守卫、棱镜蛇怪或帝皇守卫可能处于活动状态。技能消除防御的速度比自动攻击更快。",
  "An exact Sonar scan reveals the real outcome on both sides, but Sonar, the one-hit Shock Shield, and fish-combat pulse tools draw from the same four-point battery. Some routes alter those costs, jam Sonar in specified zones, or restore power through air pockets, relics, currents, or defeated guardians. Information and protection therefore compete with later combat readiness.": "精确的声纳扫描揭示了双方的真实结果，但声纳、一击冲击盾和鱼战脉冲工具均使用相同的四点电池。有些路线会改变这些成本，在指定区域干扰声纳，或通过气穴、遗迹、水流或击败的守护者恢复电力。因此，信息和保护与后期战备相竞争。",
  "An expedition starts with 90 seconds. Boat Range adds five seconds per level above Level 1. Hold the water or Space to charge, then release. A stronger cast shortens the wait before the bite, so a quick full cast leaves more expedition time for line control.": "探险从 90 秒开始。船靶场在 1 级以上每级增加 5 秒。按住水或空间进行充电，然后释放。更强的抛投可以缩短咬合前的等待时间，因此快速的完整抛投可以为线路控制留下更多的探险时间。",
  "An opening preview is followed by shuffles after mistakes.": "开场预览之后是错误后的洗牌。",
