  "Animal Skyport Dispatch is a five-shift route-management strategy game set at Cloudline Skyport. Read each arriving animal airship, draw a safe approach to a compatible dock, assign limited service resources, and finish the shift before congestion or missed flights reach the failure limit.": "Animal Skyport Dispatch 是一款以 Cloudline Skyport 为背景的五班路线管理策略游戏。阅读每艘到达的动物飞艇，制定到达兼容码头的安全方法，分配有限的服务资源，并在拥堵或错过航班达到故障极限之前完成轮班。",
