  "Animal Spectrum Pulse": "动物频谱脉冲",
  "Animal Spectrum Pulse | WeightPlay": "动物频谱脉冲| WeightPlay",
  "Animal Spectrum Pulse is a 30-tower one-touch precision arcade adventure. Guide Panko's spectrum spirit upward, read the emblem segment nearest the spirit at the bottom scan marker, and pulse only when the current wave, sun, diamond, or paw identity is aligned.": "Animal Spectrum Pulse 是一款 30 座塔的一键式精准街机冒险游戏。将 Panko 的光谱精神向上引导，读取底部扫描标记处最接近精神的徽章部分，并且仅在当前波浪、太阳、钻石或爪子身份对齐时发出脉冲。",
  "Animal Star Memory": "动物星星记忆",
  "Animal Star Memory - How to Play": "动物星星记忆 - 怎么玩",
  "Animal Star Memory - Memory Matching Game": "动物明星记忆 - 记忆配对游戏",
  "Animal Star Memory - WeightPlay": "动物星星记忆 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Star Memory game guide": "动物星星记忆游戏指南",
  "Animal Star Memory is a 30-stage picture-matching journey through the night sky. Players help six friendly Star Keepers reconnect animal constellations by finding matching cards. The campaign begins with classic pairs, then changes how memory works through opening previews, moon shuffles after mistakes, required animal order, and constellation shifts after successful matches. Every fifth stage is a Keeper Check, and Stage 30 combines all four advanced rules on a full twelve-pair board.": "《动物之星记忆》是一场穿越夜空的 30 个阶段的图片匹配之旅。玩家通过找到匹配的卡片来帮助六名友好的星星守护者重新连接动物星座。战役从经典配对开始，然后通过开场预览、错误后的月亮洗牌、所需的动物顺序以及成功比赛后的星座变化来改变记忆的运作方式。每第五个阶段都是一次守护者检查，第 30 阶段将所有四个高级规则结合在一个完整的 12 对棋盘上。",
  "Animal Star Memory may support visual recall, attention, flexible updating, and following a short sequence. Adults can ask which locations are still reliable after a shuffle or why an ordered pair should be found first. The game has no combat, account requirement, public ranking, or advertising request on this Kids page. Stars and the Skill Report are encouraging local game feedback, not an intelligence, school, health, or developmental assessment.": "动物明星记忆可以支持视觉回忆、注意力、灵活更新和遵循短序列。成年人可以询问哪些位置在洗牌后仍然可靠，或者为什么应该首先找到有序的对。该游戏在此儿童页面上没有战斗、帐户要求、公开排名或广告请求。明星和技能报告鼓励本地游戏反馈，而不是智力、学校、健康或发展评估。",
  "Animal Starlight Trails": "动物星光轨迹",
  "Animal Sunbeam Garden": "动物阳光花园",
  "Animal Training": "动物训练",
  "Animal Triple Match": "动物三连赛",
