  "Animal Vine Rescue": "动物藤救援",
  "Animal Vine Rescue - Complete Game Guide": "Animal Vine Rescue - 完整游戏指南",
  "Animal Vine Rescue - WeightPlay": "动物藤救援 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Vine Rescue game guide": "动物藤救援游戏指南",
  "Animal Vine Rescue is a 30-stage animal physics puzzle about cutting a hanging fruit free, steering a leaf trampoline, and landing the fruit in a waiting animal's basket. The campaign is divided into six five-stage rescue lessons. Later routes add moving baskets, upper and lower wind layers, wind that reverses after a bounce, two-bounce deliveries, narrower catch zones, and two- or three-fruit picnic orders. Every fifth stage is a friendly Panko Check that combines the current lesson without adding combat or time pressure.": "《Animal Vine Rescue》是一款包含 30 个阶段的动物物理谜题，内容包括砍掉悬挂的水果、操纵树叶蹦床以及将水果放入等待的动物篮子中。此次活动共分为六节、五阶段的救援课。后来的路线增加了移动篮子、上下风层、弹跳后反转的风、两次弹跳交付、更窄的捕获区域以及两到三个水果野餐订单。每第五个阶段都是一次友好的 Panko Check，它结合了当前的课程，而不增加战斗或时间压力。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue is a 30-stage physics puzzle about cutting a hanging fruit free, steering a leaf trampoline, and landing the fruit in an animal's basket. Six five-stage lessons add moving baskets, wind layers, reversing wind, two-bounce deliveries, narrow catches, soft leaves, and multi-fruit picnic orders. Every fifth stage is a friendly Panko Check without combat or time pressure. The leaf remains movable after Cut, so success depends on continuous guidance.": "《Animal Vine Rescue》是一个 30 个阶段的物理谜题，涉及砍掉悬挂的水果、操纵树叶蹦床以及将水果落入动物的篮子中。六个五阶段课程增加了移动篮子、风层、反向风、两次弹跳交付、狭窄捕获、柔软叶子和多水果野餐订单。每第五阶段都是一次友好的 Panko Check，没有战斗或时间压力。叶子在切割后仍保持活动状态，因此成功取决于持续的引导。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue may support timing, visual prediction, hand-eye coordination, focus, and simple problem solving. Adults can ask where the basket will move or why the second bounce needs a different leaf position. There is no timer, advertising, account requirement, ranking pressure, or hostile combat. Stars and saved progress are playful local feedback, not a formal ability test, diagnosis, or school assessment.": "Animal Vine Rescue 可以支持计时、视觉预测、手眼协调、专注和简单的问题解决。成人可以询问篮子将移动到哪里，或者为什么第二次弹跳需要不同的叶子位置。没有计时器、广告、帐户要求、排名压力或敌对战斗。星星和保存的进度是有趣的本地反馈，而不是正式的能力测试、诊断或学校评估。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue may support timing, visual prediction, hand-eye coordination, focus, and simple problem solving. An adult can ask where a moving basket will be when the fruit returns or why a second bounce needs a different leaf position. There is no timer, advertising, account requirement, ranking pressure, or hostile combat. Stars and saved progress are playful local feedback, not a formal ability test, diagnosis, or school assessment.": "Animal Vine Rescue 可以支持计时、视觉预测、手眼协调、专注和简单的问题解决。成年人可以询问当水果返回时移动的篮子将在哪里，或者为什么第二次弹跳需要不同的叶子位置。没有计时器、广告、帐户要求、排名压力或敌对战斗。星星和保存的进度是有趣的本地反馈，而不是正式的能力测试、诊断或学校评估。",
