  "Animal Word Trails": "动物文字踪迹",
  "Animal Word Trails - WeightPlay": "动物文字踪迹 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Word Trails is a calm 30-stage reading puzzle about following animal clues and connecting adjacent letters or characters into a complete word path.": "Animal Word Trails 是一款平静的 30 阶段阅读谜题，旨在追踪动物线索并将相邻字母或字符连接成完整的单词路径。",
  "Animal Word Trails is a ten-trail reading puzzle. Connect adjacent letter or character tiles to find four animal or habitat words, reveal clue cards, and complete the local-language album.": "Animal Word Trails 是一款包含十条线索的阅读谜题。连接相邻的字母或字符图块，找到四个动物或栖息地单词，揭示线索卡，并完成当地语言相册。",
  "Animal Zoo Idle": "动物动物园放置",
  "Animal Zoo Idle - How to Play": "动物动物园放置 - 如何玩",
  "Animal Zoo Idle - WeightPlay": "动物动物园空闲 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Zoo Idle game guide": "动物动物园放置游戏指南",
  "Animal Zoo Idle is a gentle continuous park-management game with 30 persistent milestones. Visitors enter the meadow, buy tickets, and gradually fill a ticket box while the player cares for animals, improves three facilities, expands the gate, and arranges habitats. Lions, giraffes, elephants, pandas, penguins, rabbits, foxes, koalas, tigers, rhinos, crocodiles, and bears can eventually join the same saved park. Milestones track all progress at once, so children can choose what to improve without entering or unlocking numbered levels.": "Animal Zoo Idle 是一款温和的连续公园管理游戏，具有 30 个持久的里程碑。游客进入草地，购买门票，逐渐填满一个票箱，同时玩家照顾动物，完善三项设施，扩建大门，布置栖息地。狮子、长颈鹿、大象、熊猫、企鹅、兔子、狐狸、考拉、老虎、犀牛、鳄鱼和熊最终都可以加入同一个受保护的公园。里程碑会立即跟踪所有进度，因此孩子们可以选择要改进的内容，而无需进入或解锁编号级别。",
  "Animal Zoo Idle is a gentle park-management game built around 30 saved challenges. Visitors enter the meadow, buy tickets, and fill a ticket box while the player cares for animals, improves the Snack Stand, View Deck, and Keeper Post, expands the gate, and arranges habitats. Twelve animals can eventually live in the park. Every fifth challenge is a friendly review, giving the continuing economy a clear six-part journey from the first ticket collection to the Grand Safari Festival.": "Animal Zoo Idle 是一款温和的公园管理游戏，围绕 30 个已保存的挑战构建。游客进入草地，购买门票并填满票箱，而玩家则照顾动物，改善小吃摊、观景台和饲养员柱，扩大大门并布置栖息地。十二只动物最终可以在公园里生活。每五个挑战都是一次友好的评论，为持续的经济提供了从第一次取票到大狩猎节的清晰的六部分旅程。",
