  "Barriers belong to the route rather than an enemy army. Every fifth level is a Safari Check that recombines the region’s skills. Grand Safari Reunion frees the final three animals and ends the authored campaign.": "障碍属于路线而不是敌军。每第五级就是一次 Safari 检查，重新组合该地区的技能。 Grand Safari Reunion 释放了最后三只动物并结束了策划的活动。",
