  "Basic play does not require an account. Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best encounter progress are stored in this browser; clearing site storage or changing devices may remove that profile. Gold and the current loadout are temporary. Diamonds are optional and require confirmation at Orla's refresh.": "基本游戏不需要帐户。已解锁和已完成的阶段、创意工坊 XP、发现和最佳遭遇进度都存储在此浏览器中；清除站点存储或更改设备可能会删除该配置文件。黄金和当前的负载是暂时的。钻石是可选的，需要在奥拉刷新时确认。",
  "Basic wolves test the first bend.": "基本狼测试第一弯。",
  "Basilisk controls ground with venom, Guardian drops its guard after slams, Colossus exposes a core, Wyvern alternates flight and landing, Stag breaks its shield on a failed dash, and Behemoth combines phase-based crystal and root pressure.": "蛇怪用毒液控制地面，守护者在猛击后放弃防御，巨像暴露核心，飞龙交替飞行和着陆，雄鹿在冲刺失败时打破盾牌，巨兽结合了基于相位的水晶和根压力。",
  "Basilisk controls ground with venom, Stone Guardian drops its guard after slams, Thorn Colossus exposes a core, Cinder Wyvern alternates flight and landing, Eclipse Stag breaks its shield on a failed dash, and Behemoth combines phase-based crystal and root pressure.": "蛇怪用毒液控制地面，石像守护者在猛击后失去防御，荆棘巨像暴露核心，灰烬双足飞龙交替飞行和着陆，日蚀雄鹿在冲刺失败时打破其护盾，而巨兽则结合了基于相位的水晶和根部压力。",
