  "Beast Deck: El Bosque de Niebla": "野兽套牌：El Bosque de Niebla",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest": "野兽套牌：迷雾森林",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest - Game Guide": "野兽套牌：迷雾森林 - 游戏指南",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest - WeightPlay": "野兽套牌：迷雾森林 - WeightPlay",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest game guide": "野兽甲板：迷雾森林游戏指南",
  "Beast Deck: The Mist Forest is a 30-mission turn-based deckbuilding campaign built around visible enemy intent and animal-power card combos. Each mission contains three battles and two temporary drafts. Six five-mission regions introduce armor, riposte, Exhaust, marks, regeneration, cleanse, Weak, seals, curses and triad wards. Missions 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30 end with different phase-changing Bosses.": "野兽套牌：迷雾森林是一款包含 30 个任务的回合制牌组构建战役，围绕明显的敌人意图和动物力量卡牌组合而构建。每个任务包含三场战斗和两次临时草案。六个五任务区域引入了护甲、还击、耗尽、标记、再生、净化、虚弱、封印、诅咒和三合会守卫。任务 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 以不同的阶段变化 Boss 结束。",
  "Beast Guardian": "野兽守护者",
  "Beast Guardian - Free Hero Tower Defense | WeightPlay": "野兽守护者-免费英雄塔防| WeightPlay",
  "Beast Guardian - Game Guide": "野兽守护者 - 游戏指南",
  "Beast Guardian cover": "野兽守护者封面",
  "Beast Guardian game guide": "野兽守护者游戏指南",
  "Beast Guardian is a 30-stage hero tower-defense campaign built around route construction rather than fixed tower pads. Each stage changes both the enemy entry and crystal position, so the same wall pattern cannot solve every map. Build from eight clear animal roles, keep at least one route open, and protect the crystal through six five-stage regions. Wolves, armored boars, flying bats, regenerating packs, wounded sprinters, and eclipse formations ask for different defenses. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 end with rule-changing Bosses instead of ordinary enemies with larger health bars.": "《野兽守护者》是一款 30 阶段的英雄塔防战役，围绕路线建设而不是固定的塔楼进行。每个阶段都会改变敌人的进入和水晶位置，因此相同的墙图案无法解决所有地图。由八个明确的动物角色构建，保持至少一条路线畅通，并通过六个五阶段区域保护水晶。狼、装甲野猪、飞行蝙蝠、再生群体、受伤的短跑运动员和日食队形需要不同的防御。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 阶段以改变规则的 Boss 结束，而不是具有较大生命值的普通敌人。",
  "Beast Guardian is a 30-stage hero tower-defense campaign built around route construction rather than fixed tower pads. Place four ordinary animal soldier roles and seven WeightPlay heroes on a forest grid, keep at least one route open, and protect the crystal core through six five-stage regions. Wolves, armored boars, flying bats, regenerating packs, wounded sprinters, and eclipse formations ask for different defenses. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 end with rule-changing Bosses instead of ordinary enemies with larger health bars.": "《野兽守护者》是一款 30 阶段的英雄塔防战役，围绕路线建设而不是固定的塔楼进行。将四个普通动物士兵角色和七个WeightPlay英雄放置在森林网格上，保持至少一条路线畅通，并通过六个五级区域保护水晶核心。狼、装甲野猪、飞行蝙蝠、再生群体、受伤的短跑运动员和日食队形需要不同的防御。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 阶段以改变规则的 Boss 结束，而不是具有较大生命值的普通敌人。",
  "Beast Guardian tower defense board": "野兽守护者塔防板",
  "Beast guide": "野兽向导",
  "Beast Guide": "野兽指南",
