  "Better gates bring more visitors and raise ticket income.": "更好的登机口可以带来更多的游客并提高门票收入。",
  "Better snacks raise ticket income.": "更好的小吃可以提高门票收入。",
  "Between rooms, three free blessings are always available. Spending three Diamonds replaces all three with stronger versions once during that run. The action shows the exact balance change and requires a second confirmation.": "房间之间，常备三件免费祝福。在此轮运行中，花费三颗钻石即可将所有三颗钻石替换为更强的版本。该操作显示了确切的余额变化，并且需要第二次确认。",
  "Bevorzuge einen Schatz, dessen Entfernung mehrere verdeckte Objekte freilegt.": "Bevorzuge einen Schatz, dessen Entfernung mehrere verdeckte Objekte freilegt.",
  "Bewegliche Galerie": "贝韦利切画廊",
  "Beyond the vegetable beds of Clover Yard lies a chain of six garden regions that once shared sunlight, seeds, and water. A confused parade of wild beasts has begun crossing those paths at the busiest time of the season. The animals are not villains: healers are trying to keep their herd moving, burrowers follow underground roots, and sun thieves collect any bright energy they find. If too many reach the cottage gate, the young plants will be trampled. The player becomes the yard keeper and organizes four trained animal guards to hold five lanes without hurting the garden itself.": "在 Clover Yard 的菜床之外，是一连串的六个花园区域，它们曾经共享阳光、种子和水。在这个季节最繁忙的时候，一群混乱的野兽开始穿过这些小路。这些动物不是恶棍：治疗者试图让他们的兽群保持移动，穴居者追随地下树根，而太阳窃贼则收集他们发现的任何明亮能量。如果太多到达了小屋门口，幼苗就会被践踏。玩家扮演庭院管理员，组织四名训练有素的动物守卫守卫五个车道，同时不伤害花园本身。",
  "Biblioteca Estelar": "埃斯特拉图书馆",
