  "Blocks": "积木",
  "Blocks never rotate, jump, or leave the board. The challenge is deciding which temporary moves create room for the decisive final slide.": "方块永远不会旋转、跳跃或离开棋盘。挑战在于决定哪些临时举措为决定性的最后幻灯片创造空间。",
  "Blocks the lane and briefly slows bites.": "阻挡车道并短暂减慢咬合速度。",
  "Bloquea el carril y sus mordiscos ralentizan brevemente.": "Bloquea el carril y sus mordiscos ralentizan brevemente。",
