  "Boar Ring": "野猪戒指",
  "Boar Warning": "野猪警告",
  "Board every listed passenger to save stars and unlock exactly the next route.": "登上每位列出的乘客以保存星星并准确解锁下一条路线。",
  "Board every listed passenger to save stars and unlock the next route.": "登上每位列出的乘客以保存星星并解锁下一条路线。",
  "Board six shape friends across 30 routes with outline, moving, memory, and Boarding Pass rules.": "通过轮廓、移动、记忆和登机牌规则，登上 30 条航线的 6 位形状朋友。",
  "Board states are part of each authored mission. Rubble cannot be occupied. Root Snare prevents the affected hero's next movement choice. Tide moves a unit one legal cell after the enemy turn. Burn damages a hero standing on it, while a one-use Cooling Rune restores Energy and clears active burn tiles. Orbit Runes rotate units around the outer ring. In Six-Rune Locks, three heroes must occupy linked Seal cells to remove the enemy ward; attacking through the ward loses one damage.": "董事会状态是每个授权任务的一部分。瓦砾不能被占用。根网会阻止受影响英雄的下一个动作选择。潮汐在敌人回合后将单位移动一个合法单元。燃烧会对站在其上的英雄造成伤害，而一次性冷却符文可以恢复能量并清除活跃的燃烧瓷砖。轨道符文围绕外环旋转单位。在六符锁中，三名英雄必须占领相连的封印单元才能移除敌方守卫；穿过守卫进行攻击会损失 1 点伤害。",
  "Board states belong to missions. Rubble blocks occupation; Root Snare prevents the next move; Tide shifts a unit after the enemy turn; Burn hurts heroes; Cooling Rune restores Energy and clears fire; Orbit rotates the outer ring. In Six-Rune Locks, three heroes must occupy linked Seals to remove a damage-reducing ward.": "董事会状态属于任务。瓦砾块占领；根部圈套阻止下一步行动；敌人回合后，部队的潮汐会发生变化；烧伤伤害英雄；冷却符文恢复能量并清除火焰；轨道使外环旋转。在六符锁中，三名英雄必须占领相连的封印才能移除一个减伤结界。",
  "Boarded passengers, retries, and progress in this run will reset.": "本次运行的登机乘客、重试和进度将重置。",
  "Boarding Pass": "登机牌",
  "Boarding Pass routes require the passenger to be selected before choosing a car.": "登机牌路线要求乘客在选择车辆之前进行选择。",
  "Boards 1-5 teach standard access through grid, diamond, terrace, bridge, and stacked layouts.": "板 1-5 教授通过网格、菱形、露台、桥梁和堆叠布局的标准访问。",
  "Boards 1-5: Open Path.": "板 1-5：开放路径。",
  "Boards 11-15 add two starred family rescues; Board 15 begins with a deliberate no-move Shuffle lesson.": "第 11-15 版添加了两项明星家庭救援；第 15 盘以刻意的不动洗牌课程开始。",
  "Boards 11-15: Family Rescue.": "第 11-15 版：家庭救援。",
  "Boards 16-20 alternate available A/B patrol routes through Arctic pyramid and sanctuary layouts.": "16-20 号板交替使用 A/B 巡逻路线穿过北极金字塔和保护区布局。",
  "Boards 16-20: Patrol Trail.": "第 16-20 板：巡逻路线。",
  "Boards 21-25 combine trail seals and family rescues.": "第 21 至 25 块板结合了小道海豹救援和家庭救援。",
  "Boards 21-25: Ranger Trial.": "第 21-25 局：游骑兵审判。",
  "Boards 26-30 combine seals, rescues, and alternating patrol routes; Board 30 uses twelve pairs over three layers.": "26-30 号板结合了海豹突击、救援和交替巡逻路线；板 30 在三层上使用十二对。",
  "Boards 26-30: Grand Reserve.": "第 26-30 板：Grand Reserve。",
  "Boards 6-10 introduce diamond keys and sealed inner pairs.": "第 6-10 板介绍了菱形键和密封内部对。",
  "Boards 6-10: Trail Seal.": "第 6-10 板：踪迹密封。",
  "Boards contain eight to twelve true pairs over one, two, or three layers. Pictures remain visible, so the challenge is access planning rather than memory.": "电路板在一层、两层或三层上包含八到十二对真值对。图片仍然可见，因此挑战在于访问规划而不是内存。",
  "Boars accelerate after losing armor.": "野猪失去护甲后会加速。",
  "Boars pause under a yellow warning, then cross the arena quickly. Magma Tusk Colossus resists damage until its charge creates a short opening.": "野猪队在黄色警告下暂停，然后快速穿过竞技场。岩浆獠牙巨像可以抵抗伤害，直到它的冲锋形成一个短暂的开口。",
  "Boars pause, flash, then charge instead of walking steadily.": "野猪会停下来、闪现，然后冲锋，而不是平稳行走。",
  "Boars strain a single blocker.": "公猪拉伤了一个阻滞剂。",
