  "Bombs always deal their remaining value. A monster in your lane deals its remaining health; an avoided monster still deals 1.": "炸弹总是会发挥其剩余价值。你车道上的怪物会处理其剩余生命值；被躲避的怪物仍会造成 1 点伤害。",
