  "Bookstack Gates": "书库门",
  "Boom Mane Leo": "博姆·马内·利奥",
  "Boom Mane Leo guards the wall outside WeightPlay's enchanted school-supply vault. Wild boars, trickster hyenas, armored rhinos, charging buffalo, hawks, bears, tigers, and crocodiles are drawn toward the magic stored inside its pencils, rulers, and erasers. Leo cannot leave the wall unprotected, so the player patrols its width, keeps the automatic weapons aligned with incoming lanes, and repairs damage between expeditions.": "Boom Mane Leo 守卫着WeightPlay 魔法学校用品库外的墙。野猪、狡猾的鬣狗、装甲犀牛、冲锋的水牛、鹰、熊、老虎和鳄鱼都被它的铅笔、尺子和橡皮中储存的魔法所吸引。 Leo 不能让城墙处于不受保护的状态，因此玩家会在城墙的宽度上巡逻，保持自动武器与进入的车道对齐，并在探险之间修复损坏。",
  "Boom Mane Leo has opened a forest reading trail where animal clues have been scattered across tile boards. Each correct path restores a clue card to the habitat album. Completing all ten trails rebuilds the forest, safari, ocean, Arctic, and mountain sections of the guidebook.": "Boom Mane Leo 开辟了一条森林阅读小道，瓷砖板上散布着动物线索。每条正确的路径都会将一张线索卡恢复到栖息地相册中。完成所有十条路线后，将重建指南中的森林、野生动物园、海洋、北极和山区部分。",
  "Boom Mane Leo, Spark Paw Fia, Moon Cap Orla, and Moss Shell Taro enter as a rotating hero team. Every fifth trial is a regional checkpoint. Defeating Void Crown Emperor in Trial 30 closes the final gate; the campaign creates no hidden Trial 31.": "Boom Mane Leo、Spark Paw Fia、Moon Cap Orla 和 Moss Shell Taro 作为轮换英雄队伍加入。每五个试验就是一个区域检查站。在第30试炼中击败虚空皇帝关闭了最后的大门；该活动没有创建隐藏的审判 31。",
  "Boom Mane Leo, Spark Paw Fia, Moon Cap Orla, and Moss Shell Taro enter the gates as a rotating hero team. A cleared trial stabilizes one step of the road and saves the next card. Every fifth trial is a regional checkpoint. Defeating the Void Crown Emperor in Trial 30 closes the last gate; there is no hidden Trial 31.": "Boom Mane Leo、Spark Paw Fia、Moon Cap Orla 和 Moss Shell Taro 作为轮换英雄团队进入大门。完成试炼可以稳定道路的一步并保存下一张牌。每五个试验就是一个区域检查站。在第30试炼中击败虚空皇帝关闭最后一道门；没有隐藏的审判31。",
