  "Boss Battles": "Boss战",
  "Boss beasts roar and slow nearby guards. Build a layered defense.": "Boss 野兽咆哮并减慢附近守卫的速度。建立分层防御。",
  "BOSS CALMED +2": "BOSS 平静 +2",
  "Boss checkpoint": "老板检查站",
  "Boss counterplay": "Boss反击",
  "Boss damage +{percent}%": "Boss 伤害 +{percent}%",
  "Boss first-clear bonus": "首领首通奖励",
  "Boss phase": "Boss阶段",
  "Boss phases trigger cumulatively at 70 and 35 percent health, so one large hit cannot skip a phase. Stone Stag refreshes armor and charges its lane. Ironroot Rhino braces, strikes a row and leaves rubble. Mirecoil Serpent adds currents, pulls heroes and regenerates unless two heroes hit it during that player turn. Embermane Lion places fire and gains a wounded extra action. Eclipse Griffin alternates flying ranged immunity with a grounded sweep. Rune Crown Chimera combines tide, burn, rubble, flight and a Mirror Wolf summon.": "Boss 阶段在生命值达到 70% 和 35% 时累积触发，因此一次大攻击无法跳过一个阶段。石鹿刷新护甲并冲锋。铁根犀牛支撑着，打出一排，留下瓦砾。秘卷蛇会增加电流、拉动英雄并再生，除非在该玩家回合中有两个英雄击中它。烬鬃狮会放火并获得受伤的额外动作。日蚀狮鹫交替使用飞行远程免疫和地面扫掠。符文皇冠奇美拉结合了潮汐、燃烧、碎石、飞行和镜狼召唤。",
  "Boss phases trigger cumulatively at 70 and 35 percent health. Stone Stag refreshes armor and charges; Ironroot Rhino leaves rubble; Mirecoil Serpent pulls and regenerates unless two heroes hit it; Embermane Lion adds fire and an extra action; Eclipse Griffin switches flight and sweep; Rune Crown Chimera combines terrain changes, flight and a clone summon.": "Boss 阶段会在生命值达到 70% 和 35% 时累积触发。石鹿刷新护甲和冲锋；铁根犀牛留下瓦砾；除非有两个英雄击中它，否则米尔卷蛇会拉动并再生；烬鬃狮增加了火焰和额外的行动； Eclipse Griffin 切换飞行和扫掠；符文皇冠奇美拉结合了地形变化、飞行和克隆召唤。",
  "Boss Pressure": "老板压力",
  "Boss pressure: survive two stags and raven fire.": "Boss 压力：在两只雄鹿和乌鸦火力中生存。",
  "Boss roar!": "老大吼！",
  "Boss rules: Rootbound rebuilds a breakable guard; Brambleback summons anchors and armored support at health thresholds; Lunar Wisp alternates visible and phased periods; Prism Shell can only be damaged while its gold shield segment is open; Tempest Horn is vulnerable after a marked charge; Voidcore changes phase twice, adds escorts, rebuilds protection, and activates two mirror pylons.": "Boss 规则：Rootbound 重建易碎的守卫；黑莓背龙在生命值达到阈值时召唤锚和装甲支援；月光交替可见周期和阶段周期；棱镜壳只能在其金盾段打开时受到损坏；暴风号角在明显冲锋后很容易受到攻击；虚空核心两次改变相位，增加护航，重建保护，并激活两个镜子塔。",
  "Boss skills are different. Thornwood Alpha attacks a row and shields itself, Abyss Shell Leviathan protects and heals its side, and Void Crown Emperor damages the whole squad while restoring its own health.": "boss技能不同。荆棘阿尔法攻击一排并保护自己，深渊贝壳利维坦保护并治疗其侧面，虚空皇冠皇帝在恢复自身生命值的同时对整个小队造成伤害。",
  "Boss Stage": "Boss阶段",
  "Boss stage. Block the boss lane and slow it with Owls.": "老大阶段。用猫头鹰阻挡 Boss 通道并减慢速度。",
  "Boss striker.": "老板前锋。",
  "BOSS WAVE": "老板波",
  "Boss Waves": "老板波",
  "BOSS: {boss}": "老板：{boss}",
  "Boss: armor thickens at each phase.": "Boss：护甲在每个阶段都会变厚。",
  "Boss: each phase regenerates faster.": "Boss：每个阶段的恢复速度都更快。",
  "Boss: every phase changes the forbidden type.": "Boss：每个阶段都会改变禁忌类型。",
  "Boss: phases accelerate the hunt.": "Boss：阶段性加速狩猎。",
  "Boss: stronger counters after each phase.": "Boss：每个阶段后都有更强的反击。",
  "Bosses keep their beast identity and add a unique projectile rule. The Boar Captain fires quick pursuit shots; the Hyena creates paired crossfire; the Rhino begins behind six shield hits and throws a heavy orb; the Buffalo aims a large siege orb at wall center; the Hawk combines repeated dashes with twin fast shots; and the Bear casts three-orb starfall.": "Boss 保留了他们的野兽身份并添加了独特的射弹规则。野猪队长快速射击追击；鬣狗产生配对交火；犀牛在六次护盾命中后开始并投掷一个沉重的球体；水牛将一个巨大的攻城球瞄准城墙中心；鹰将重复冲刺与两次快速射击结合在一起；熊施放了三球星落。",
