  "Boya del trueno": "特鲁诺博亚",
  "Braces, charges a row, and leaves blocked rubble.": "支撑，冲锋，并留下堵塞的瓦砾。",
  "Bramble and root lanes limit where the wolf can wait. Charging and armored ground enemies appear beside ranged threats, so target order matters. Thorn Colossus normally protects its glowing core; a missed root smash opens a short damage window while new root lanes warn where not to stand.": "荆棘巷和树根巷限制了狼可以等待的地方。冲锋和装甲地面敌人出现在远程威胁旁边，因此目标顺序很重​​要。荆棘巨像通常会保护其发光的核心；错过的根部粉碎会打开一个短暂的伤害窗口，而新的根部通道会警告不要站立。",
