  "Break the Wolves' adjacency before focusing one target.": "在集中一个目标之前打破狼队的邻接关系。",
  "Break three final Boss phases, escorts, and changing pylons.": "打破三个最终 Boss 阶段、护送和更换塔。",
  "Break two Boss armor plates while clearing anchors.": "清除锚时打破两个 Boss 装甲板。",
  "Break Wolf adjacency before trading damage; one move can remove Pack Fang from two attacks.": "在交易伤害之前打破狼的邻接；一招可以消除包牙的两次攻击。",
  "Break Wolf adjacency before trading damage. Moving one hero can remove Pack Fang from two attacks at once.": "在交易伤害之前打破狼的邻接。移动一名英雄可以同时消除包牙的两次攻击。",
  "Break Wolf adjacency first; one move can remove Pack Fang from two attacks.": "首先打破狼邻接；一招可以消除包牙的两次攻击。",
