  "Build a friendly animal park through 30 saved challenges with care choices, habitat arranging, facilities, and six park reviews.": "通过 30 个已保存的挑战，包括护理选择、栖息地安排、设施和六次公园审查，建立一个友好的动物公园。",
  "Build a group of four while filling three targets.": "建立一个四人小组，同时完成三个目标。",
  "Build a growing animal park.": "建立一个不断发展的动物公园。",
  "Build a lively safari park.": "建造一个热闹的野生动物园。",
  "Build a squad that survives five continuous waves. Clearing wave five saves the stage and unlocks the next one; every fifth stage ends with a regional Boss.": "建立一支能够在连续五波攻击中幸存下来的小队。清除第五波可保存该阶段并解锁下一阶段；每第五个阶段都会以一个区域 Boss 结束。",
  "Build a summoned animal team, spin ten kinds of downward-moving runes, complete doubled lines, and unleash separate pet attacks while shared defense and healing protect the summoner.": "组建召唤兽队伍，旋转十种向下移动的符文，完成双线，释放单独的宠物攻击，同时共同防御和治疗保护召唤者。",
  "Build a team of summoned animal heroes, align runes, and defeat every guardian.": "组建一支召唤动物英雄团队，排列符文，并击败每一个守护者。",
  "Build a team of up to five summoned animal heroes, spin three downward rune reels, combine the stopped symbols, and survive every wave of thirty guardian missions.": "组建一支最多由五名召唤动物英雄组成的团队，旋转三个向下的符文卷轴，组合停止的符号，并在每一波三十个守护者任务中生存下来。",
  "Build a two-row animal formation, train ten heroes, and defeat six regional bosses across a 30-stage auto-battler campaign.": "在 30 个阶段的自动战斗战役中，组建两排动物阵型，训练十位英雄，并击败六位地区首领。",
  "Build animal-power decks across 30 missions, counter ten regional mechanics, and defeat six phase-changing forest Bosses.": "在 30 个任务中构建动物动力套牌，对抗 10 个区域机械师，并击败 6 个阶段性森林 Boss。",
  "Build animal-power decks, read enemy intent, counter ten regional mechanics, and defeat six distinct Bosses across 30 missions.": "构建动物力量套牌、解读敌人意图、对抗 10 个区域机制，并在 30 个任务中击败 6 个不同的 Boss。",
  "Build Any Lane": "建造任意车道",
  "Build anywhere on the forest grid, shape enemy routes, and command WeightPlay heroes with balanced animal soldiers through 30 defense stages.": "在森林网格上的任何地方进行建造，塑造敌人的路线，并指挥 WeightPlay 英雄与平衡的动物士兵通过 30 个防御阶段。",
  "Build defenders, protect the crystal core, and unlock all 30 stages across six forest regions. Progress saves on this device.": "建立防御者，保护水晶核心，并解锁六个森林区域的所有 30 个阶段。进度保存在此设备上。",
  "Build efficient chains to reach the score target.": "建立高效的链条以达到分数目标。",
