  "Cast": "演员阵容",
  "Cast and clock: an expedition begins with 90 seconds, plus five seconds for each Boat Range level above Level 1. Hold the water or Space to charge and release to cast. More power shortens bite delay; it does not select a rarer fish.": "施法和计时：探险开始时间为 90 秒，每级船靶场等级高于 1 级则加 5 秒。按住水或空间进行蓄力并释放以施法。更大的力量缩短了咬合延迟；它不会选择更稀有的鱼。",
  "Cast and control tension.": "施放并控制张力。",
  "Cast first, then keep the marker centered.": "先投射，然后将标记保持在中心位置。",
  "Cast into the coral reef and build your sea-creature album.": "投入珊瑚礁并建立您的海洋生物相册。",
  "Cast power": "施展力量",
  "Cat": "猫",
  "Cat is the dependable ranged guard, and every fourth seed can pierce a second target. Dog has the health to block a lane at close range and briefly slows with each bite. Owl fires quickly and applies a lighter slow, which creates time against rushers. Fox costs shared diamonds to unlock, but its second shot can support a neighboring lane. These roles matter more than filling every tile: a Dog and Cat pair can hold one lane, while Owl and Fox help when pressure moves between lanes.": "猫是可靠的远程守卫，每四个种子就可以刺穿第二个目标。狗的生命值足以在近距离阻挡车道，并且每咬一口都会短暂减慢速度。猫头鹰的射击速度很快，并且速度较慢，这为对抗冲锋者创造了时间。福克斯需要共享钻石来解锁，但它的第二次射击可以支持邻近的车道。这些角色比填满每一块更重要：一对狗和猫可以占据一条车道，而猫头鹰和狐狸在压力在车道之间移动时提供帮助。",
  "Cat Keeper Check": "猫饲养员检查",
  "Cat, Bear, Owl, Lion, Penguin, and Koala each guard one five-stage lesson. Passing a Keeper Check repairs that part of the sky. Completing the final Koala Grand Star Check means all twelve animal constellations have returned to their proper routes.": "猫、熊、猫头鹰、狮子、企鹅和考拉各守卫一堂分为五个阶段的课程。通过守护者检查可以修复那部分天空。完成最后的考拉大星检查意味着所有十二个动物星座都已返回正确的路线。",
  "Cat, Bear, Owl, Lion, Penguin, and Koala each guard one five-stage lesson. Passing their Keeper Check repairs a new section of the sky. Completing the Koala Grand Star Check at Stage 30 means panda, cat, bear, lion, rabbit, fox, owl, frog, whale, chick, penguin, and koala lights can guide their animal friends again.": "猫、熊、猫头鹰、狮子、企鹅和考拉各守卫一堂分为五个阶段的课程。通过守护者检查可以修复天空的新部分。在第 30 阶段完成考拉大星星检查意味着熊猫、猫、熊、狮子、兔子、狐狸、猫头鹰、青蛙、鲸鱼、小鸡、企鹅和考拉灯可以再次引导他们的动物朋友。",
