  "Challenge Clear!": "挑战清除！",
  "Challenge Complete!": "挑战完成！",
  "Challenge mode adds a goal, drop budget, saved unlock path, and authored physics or queue rules. Free Play remains an unlimited best-score run.": "挑战模式添加了目标、降低预算、保存的解锁路径以及编写的物理或队列规则。免费游戏仍然是无限制的最佳成绩运行。",
  "Challenge Retry": "挑战重试",
  "Challenge selection": "挑战选择",
  "Challenge Spotlight": "挑战焦点",
  "Challenge unlocks, completion, selection, and best scores remain in this browser. Free Play keeps its separate local album and best-run list.": "挑战解锁、完成、选择和最佳成绩均保留在该浏览器中。 Free Play 保留其单独的本地专辑和最佳运行列表。",
  "Challenges": "挑战",
  "Challenges 1-5 teach the open box and finish at Meadow Drum.": "挑战 1-5 教授开箱并在 Meadow Drum 结束。",
  "Challenges 1-5 teach tickets, care, and habitat movement before Mimi's first review. Challenges 6-10 compare care choices, ask the player to hold a ready ticket box, and introduce the Snack Stand before Panko's picnic.": "挑战 1-5 在 Mimi 第一次复习之前教授门票、护理和栖息地移动。挑战 6-10 比较护理选择，要求玩家持有准备好的票箱，并在 Panko 野餐之前介绍小吃摊。",
  "Challenges 1-5, Meadow Steps:": "挑战 1-5，草地台阶：",
  "Challenges 1–5 introduce ticket collection, one care action, habitat movement, and the first Mimi review. Challenges 6–10 ask players to compare care routes, hold a ready ticket box, and improve the Snack Stand before Panko's picnic review.": "挑战 1-5 介绍了门票收集、一次护理行动、栖息地移动和第一次 Mimi 评论。挑战 6-10 要求玩家在 Panko 野餐回顾之前比较护理路线、准备好票箱并改进小吃摊。",
  "Challenges 11-15 add alternating River Current force.": "挑战 11-15 添加交替河流力。",
  "Challenges 11-15 introduce the View Deck, larger arrangements, and happiness targets. Challenges 16-20 add the Keeper Post and combine care, animal count, and facility planning for the rhino keeper audit.": "挑战 11-15 介绍了观景台、更大的安排和幸福目标。挑战 16-20 添加了饲养员岗位，并将护理、动物计数和设施规划结合起来，以进行犀牛饲养员审核。",
  "Challenges 11-15, River Current:": "挑战 11-15，河流：",
  "Challenges 11–15 add the View Deck, larger arrangements, and happiness targets. Challenges 16–20 bring in the Keeper Post and require care, animal count, and facility planning together. Challenges 21–25 focus on gate growth, a busier animal roster, and the penguin parade. Challenges 26–30 combine careful spending, all three facilities, happiness, arrangement, and income in the Grand Safari Festival finale.": "挑战 11-15 增加了观景台、更大的安排和幸福目标。挑战 16-20 引入了守护者岗位，需要同时进行护理、动物计数和设施规划。挑战 21-25 重点关注大门的增长、更繁忙的动物名册和企鹅游行。挑战 26-30 在 Grand Safari Festival 的结局中结合了谨慎的消费、所有三个设施、幸福、安排和收入。",
  "Challenges 16-20 use faster Mountain Weight gravity.": "挑战 16-20 使用更快的 Mountain Weight 重力。",
  "Challenges 16-20, Mountain Weight:": "挑战 16-20，山地重量：",
  "Challenges 21-25 grow the gate and animal roster for a penguin parade. Challenges 26-30 combine careful spending, all three facilities, happiness, arrangement, and income in the Grand Safari Festival finale.": "挑战 21-25 增加企鹅游行的大门和动物名册。挑战 26-30 在 Grand Safari Festival 的结局中结合了谨慎的消费、所有三个设施、幸福、安排和收入。",
  "Challenges 21-25 use the predictable Moon Parade queue.": "挑战 21-25 使用可预测的月球巡游队列。",
  "Challenges 21-25, Moon Parade:": "挑战 21-25，月球巡游：",
  "Challenges 26-30 combine advanced rules, with all four active at the Lion Crown Table finale.": "挑战 26-30 结合了高级规则，所有四个挑战都活跃在狮冠桌决赛中。",
  "Challenges 26-30, Crown Festival:": "挑战 26-30，皇冠节：",
  "Challenges 6-10 use the reduced Forest Window aim range.": "挑战 6-10 使用缩小的森林窗口目标范围。",
  "Challenges 6-10, Forest Window:": "挑战 6-10，森林之窗：",
  "Challenges add goals, drop budgets, saved unlocks, and authored rules; Free Play remains unlimited.": "挑战会增加目标、减少预算、保存解锁内容和编写规则；免费游戏仍然不受限制。",
  "Chamber": "室",
  "Chambers": "钱伯斯",
  "Chambers 1-5 teach path order. Later chapters introduce steam reactions, wards and shadows, twin currents, rune locks, and combined mastery layouts through Chamber 30.": "房间 1-5 教导路径顺序。后面的章节介绍了第 30 号房间的蒸汽反应、病房和阴影、双流、符文锁以及组合掌握布局。",
  "Champion Aura": "冠军光环",
