  "Changing Tray missions reorder them after a wrong choice so the next decision uses observation.": "更改托盘任务会在错误选择后重新排序，以便下一个决定需要观察。",
  "Changing Tray missions reorder them after a wrong choice.": "更改托盘任务在选择错误后重新排序。",
