  "Character Backpack": "人物背包",
  "Character backpack items": "角色背包物品",
  "Character level is permanent. Spend level points here so every run starts stronger.": "角色等级是永久的。在这里花费等级点数，这样每次跑步都会变得更强。",
  "Character position, marker line, success test, and feedback animation share one logical coordinate system so a visible success cannot still fall through the platform.": "角色位置、标记线、成功测试和反馈动画共享一个逻辑坐标系，因此可见的成功仍然不会落在平台上。",
