  "Charcos de veneno y barrido de cola del jefe": "Charcos de veneno y barrido de cola del jefe",
  "Charge": "充电",
  "Charge Comet Break with fewer gaps.": "以更少的间隙冲锋彗星断裂。",
  "Charge lane marked — prepare a different angle.": "标记充电通道 - 准备不同的角度。",
  "Charge lane marked — the Guardian is vulnerable after its rush.": "冲锋线已标记——守护者在冲锋后很容易受到攻击。",
  "Charge lanes": "充电车道",
  "Chargement": "收费",
  "Chargers enter from four sides while roots mark the center.": "充电器从四个侧面进入，而根则标记中心。",
  "Charges in a straight line when it sees a hero.": "当它看到英雄时会直线冲锋。",
  "Charging Buffalo": "冲锋水牛",
  "Charging the prism arena…": "为棱镜竞技场充电……",
  "Charging the prism launcher…": "为棱镜发射器充电...",
  "Chart 30 reef missions and land six Guardian fish.": "绘制 30 个珊瑚礁任务并登陆 6 条守护者鱼。",
  "Chasing packs": "追包",
  "Chasseurs d'ombre": "暗色猎犬",
  "Cheap blocker.": "廉价的拦截器。",
  "Check a cloud’s whole row before striking it.": "在击中云之前检查它的整排。",
  "Check all three tray pieces before committing the first one.": "在提交第一个托盘之前检查所有三个托盘。",
  "Check current and next bubbles before choosing an angle.": "在选择角度之前检查当前和下一个气泡。",
  "Check each customer&#39;s food bubble, VIP mark, table mark, and patience bar.": "检查每个顾客的食物气泡、VIP标记、餐桌标记和耐心条。",
  "Check each food color.": "检查每种食物的颜色。",
  "Check equal values before spending a flexible pair that totals ten.": "在花费总共十个灵活对之前检查是否相等。",
  "Check food bubbles, VIP marks, table marks, and patience before preparing a tray.": "在准备托盘之前检查食物气泡、VIP 标记、餐桌标记和耐心。",
  "Check for a VIP before preparing a normal guest's tray.": "在准备普通客人的托盘之前先检查是否有 VIP。",
  "Check for a VIP before preparing a normal guest&#39;s tray.": "在准备普通客人的托盘之前先检查是否有 VIP。",
  "Check Free Tiles": "检查免费瓷砖",
  "Check rare letters and board edges before choosing the first tile.": "在选择第一块瓷砖之前，请检查罕见字母和板边缘。",
  "Check the active bus and its remaining seats.": "检查活动巴士及其剩余座位。",
  "Check the capacity marks before committing a large group.": "在提交大型组之前检查容量标记。",
  "Check the food pictures above each customer.": "检查每位顾客上方的食物图片。",
  "Check the shape the train needs.": "检查火车所需的形状。",
  "Check the target list below the scene.": "检查场景下方的目标列表。",
  "Check which plates share a screw before moving it.": "在移动之前检查哪些板共用一个螺钉。",
  "Check word": "检查字",
  "Checkpoint": "检查站",
  "Checkpoint Cavern": "检查站洞穴",
  "Checkpoint goals need balance. Watch both counters and change priorities when either collection or score falls behind.": "检查点目标需要平衡。观察两个计数器并在收集或分数落后时更改优先级。",
  "Checkpoint goals require both an animal tier and points. A single large merge may satisfy the tier while a planned combo supplies the remaining score.": "检查站目标需要动物等级和积分。单个大型合并可能会满足该等级，而计划的组合则提供剩余分数。",
  "Checkpoints combine learned rules without combat. Targets retain forgiving hit perimeters, hints name and ring one target, held keys cannot spend both hints or skip Result, and reduced-motion preferences stop patrol movement. The Stage rail shows all 30 challenges even when later cards are locked, while unlocks, stars, and best times stay local to the current browser.": "检查点结合了学到的规则，无需战斗。目标保留宽容的命中范围，提示名称并响铃一个目标，按住的键不能同时使用提示或跳过结果，并且减少运动首选项停止巡逻运动。即使后来的卡片被锁定，舞台轨道也会显示所有 30 个挑战，而解锁、星星和最佳时间则保留在当前浏览器本地。",
  "Cheese": "奶酪",
  "Cheese Workshop": "奶酪工坊",
  "Cheetah Sprint": "猎豹冲刺",
  "Chefe": "谢弗",
  "Cherchez les paires et gardez une case libre.": "Cherchez lespaires etgardez une case libre。",
  "CHEST": "胸部",
  "Chest gear is claimed before the equip decision. Keeping the current loadout does not discard a new item; it remains in the backpack for later comparison.": "胸部装备在装备决定之前就已被领取。保持当前的装载量不会丢弃新物品；它保留在背包中以供以后比较。",
