  "Choose a vessel to lift its top group, then choose a compatible destination. The restoration is complete when every non-empty vessel holds only one color.": "选择一艘船来提升其顶级组，然后选择一个兼容的目的地。当每个非空容器仅容纳一种颜色时，修复就完成了。",
