  "Choose an unlocked card from the 30-stage horizontal expedition rail and read its route rule.": "从30级水平探险铁路中选择一张解锁卡并阅读其路线规则。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the 30-trial Stage rail and read its region rule, checkpoint Boss, and suggested hero.": "从 30 个试用阶段轨道中选择一张解锁的卡牌，并阅读其区域规则、检查点 Boss 和建议的英雄。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail and read its rule.": "从水平 30 级轨道中选择一张未锁定的卡片并阅读其规则。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail; every fifth card is a Boss checkpoint.": "从水平30级轨道中选择一张解锁卡；每五张卡就是一个 Boss 检查点。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-trial rail and read its region rule, checkpoint Boss, and suggested hero.": "从水平的 30 个试炼轨道中选择一张解锁的卡牌，并阅读其区域规则、检查点 Boss 和建议的英雄。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal Stage rail. Locked cards remain visible so the length of the 30-stage route and each fifth-stage Boss checkpoint are clear.": "从水平舞台导轨中选择一张未锁定的卡。锁定的卡牌仍然可见，因此 30 阶段路线的长度和每个第五阶段 Boss 检查点都清晰可见。",
  "Choose an unlocked card on the horizontal 30-board Stage rail and read its rule.": "在水平 30 板舞台导轨上选择一张未锁定的卡片并阅读其规则。",
