  "Choose an unlocked stage from the swipe rail, then begin the defense. Cleared non-final waves start automatically after a five-second countdown.": "从滑动轨道上选择一个未锁定的阶段，然后开始防御。已清除的非最终波数会在五秒倒计时后自动开始。",
  "Choose an unlocked stage on the horizontal stage trail and read its enemy icons and short plan.": "在水平舞台轨迹上选择一个未锁定的舞台，并阅读其敌人图标和简短计划。",
