  "Choose an unlocked waterway from the horizontal Stage rail.": "从水平舞台轨道上选择一条未上锁的水道。",
  "Choose an unlocked zone and read its quota, rescue count, time, and chapter rule.": "选择一个解锁区域并阅读其配额、救援次数、时间和章节规则。",
  "Choose an upgrade": "选择升级",
  "Choose any unlocked card on the horizontal 30-habitat Stage rail and read its rule label.": "选择水平 30 个栖息地舞台轨道上的任何解锁卡并阅读其规则标签。",
  "Choose any unlocked mission from the horizontal reef map. The card states its sea condition, catch goal, and whether a Guardian is waiting. Winning unlocks exactly the next mission; earlier missions remain replayable.": "从水平珊瑚礁地图中选择任何解锁的任务。该卡说明了其海况、捕获目标以及守护者是否正在等待。获胜即可解锁下一个任务；早期的任务仍然可以重玩。",
  "Choose any unlocked stage from the horizontal card rail.": "从水平卡轨中选择任何未锁定的阶段。",
  "Choose between breaking Shell Guard and stopping the Heron push.": "在破坏 Shell Guard 和停止 Heron 推送之间进行选择。",
  "Choose between ranged and ground threats": "在远程威胁和地面威胁之间进行选择",
  "Choose between two order animals.": "在两种动物之间进行选择。",
