  "Choose equal numbers or a pair that adds to 10.": "选择相等的数字或一对加起来等于 10 的数字。",
  "Choose every food shown in one order bubble, in numbered order when required, then tap an eligible customer.": "选择一个订单气泡中显示的每一种食物（需要时按编号顺序），然后点击符合条件的顾客。",
  "Choose every food shown in one order bubble, then tap that customer.": "选择一个订单气泡中显示的每一种食物，然后点击该顾客。",
  "Choose every pictured food, in numbered order when required, then tap an eligible customer.": "需要时按编号顺序选择图中的每种食物，然后点击符合条件的顾客。",
