  "Choose one animal power to keep in this mission deck.": "选择一种动物力量保留在这个任务牌组中。",
  "Choose one expedition relic, then spend the run's Supplies on temporary upgrades for the animals you intend to field.": "选择一件探险遗物，然后将这次探险的补给品用于临时升级您打算部署的动物。",
  "Choose one free blessing after each room and defeat the Boss.": "每个房间后选择一个免费祝福并击败 Boss。",
  "Choose one item": "选择一项",
  "Choose one of 30 animal investigations. Every fifth stage is a Junior Expert Check.": "从 30 项动物调查中选择一项。每第五阶段都是初级专家检查。",
  "Choose one of four heroes and clear a 30-trial shadow campaign.": "从四位英雄中选择一位，完成 30 次试炼的暗影战役。",
  "Choose one of four heroes for 30 three-room trials with five enemy families, saved mastery, and six distinct Bosses.": "选择四位英雄中的一位，进行 30 个三室试炼，其中包括 5 个敌人家族、已保存的精通以及 6 个不同的 Boss。",
  "Choose one of four WeightPlay heroes, clear three forest rooms, collect blessings, and defeat the Shadow Sovereign.": "选择四个WeightPlay英雄之一，清除三个森林房间，收集祝福，并击败暗影君主。",
  "Choose one of the three block groups.": "选择三个块组之一。",
