  "Choose one unlocked stage from the horizontal expedition rail and read its route rule before entering.": "从水平探险轨道中选择一个未锁定的阶段，并在进入之前阅读其路线规则。",
  "Choose one upgrade after each completed wave and adapt it to the next enemy mix.": "在每一波完成后选择一个升级，并将其适应下一个敌人组合。",
  "Choose or drag the helper item that matches the current zoo task.": "选择或拖动与当前动物园任务匹配的辅助项。",
  "Choose Park Challenge": "选择公园挑战",
  "Choose Power to shorten fights, Cooldown for skill access, or Recovery when carried health is low.": "选择力量来缩短战斗时间，选择冷却时间来获得技能，或者在生命值较低时选择恢复。",
  "Choose Puzzle": "选择拼图",
  "Choose Raid": "选择突袭",
  "Choose Reef Mission": "选择珊瑚礁任务",
  "Choose Reef Zone": "选择珊瑚礁区",
  "Choose Region": "选择地区",
  "Choose Rescue": "选择救援",
  "Choose Rod Strength or Bait Quality when safe fights take too long; choose Reel Control or Line Durability when the marker repeatedly escapes SAFE.": "当安全战斗花费太长时间时，选择鱼竿强度或鱼饵质量；当标记反复脱离安全时，选择卷轴控制或线耐用性。",
  "Choose Stage": "选择阶段",
  "Choose Start Game for the challenge rail or Free Play for an unlimited score run.": "选择“开始游戏”进行挑战，或选择“免费游戏”以获得无限分数。",
  "Choose Start Game to open the horizontal challenge rail, or choose Free Play for the original unlimited score run.": "选择“开始游戏”以打开水平挑战栏，或选择“免费游戏”以进行原始的无限得分运行。",
  "Choose Start Game, then drag the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked card.": "选择“开始游戏”，然后将水平舞台导轨拖动到解锁的卡上。",
  "Choose the Gearwood route.": "选择 Gearwood 路线。",
  "Choose the item that handles the immediate priority described by both clues.": "选择处理两条线索所描述的直接优先级的项目。",
  "Choose the matching care item.": "选择相匹配的护理项目。",
  "Choose the matching station": "选择匹配的电台",
  "Choose the nearest safe dock; dock number does not impose a hidden submission order.": "选择最近的安全码头；码头号码不会强加隐藏的提交顺序。",
  "Choose the quiet side before the routes cross.": "在路线交叉之前选择安静的一侧。",
  "Choose Tidy Habitat once and keep happiness above 78.": "选择整洁栖息地一次，幸福度保持在78以上。",
  "Choose Tidy Habitat to raise happiness, or Enrichment Time to earn tickets; each care action has a short cooldown.": "选择“整洁栖息地”来提升幸福感，或者选择“丰富时光”来赚取门票；每个护理动作都有短暂的冷却时间。",
  "Choose Tidy Habitat when happiness is required, but Enrichment Time when income is the bottleneck.": "当需要幸福时选择整洁栖息地，当收入成为瓶颈时选择丰富时间。",
  "Choose Trail": "选择路线",
  "Choose Trial": "选择试用",
  "Choose two equal numbers, or two numbers whose sum is 10. They must touch or see each other across cleared spaces.": "选择两个相等的数字，或两个总和为 10 的数字。它们必须在空旷的空间中接触或看到对方。",
  "Choose two matching free tiles.": "选择两个匹配的免费瓷砖。",
  "Choose whether the optional treasure is worth the detour. It awards the third medal and extra Moon Coins, but ordinary mission progress never requires it unless the current rule explicitly turns it into a seal.": "选择可选的宝藏是否值得绕道而行。它奖励第三枚奖章和额外的月亮币，但普通的任务进度从来不需要它，除非当前的规则明确将其变成封印。",
  "Choose whether to equip {gear} or keep the current loadout.": "选择是否装备{gear}或保持当前装备。",
  "Choose your age": "选择您的年龄",
  "Choose your age, meet animal heroes, and start playing. No ads or sign-in.": "选择你的年龄，认识动物英雄，然后开始玩。没有广告或登录。",
