  "Claim": "索赔",
  "Claim any completed milestone; claiming never resets the park or other milestone progress.": "领取任何已完成的里程碑；声称永远不会重置公园或其他里程碑进度。",
  "Claim the reward after every goal is complete, then continue to the next challenge.": "完成每个目标后领取奖励，然后继续下一个挑战。",
