  "Collect 500 total tickets": "总共收集 500 张门票",
  "Collect a power core as soon as the lane is safe enough because later waves are balanced around its attack increase.": "一旦车道足够安全，就立即收集能量核心，因为后面的波浪会围绕其攻击增加进行平衡。",
  "Collect a Shell Ward before exposing Taro to a Shadow Wisp.": "在让太郎暴露在暗影小精灵面前之前收集一个贝壳防护罩。",
  "Collect a small ticket box and learn where park income waits.": "收集一个小票箱并了解公园收入在哪里。",
  "Collect and Stack": "收集并堆叠",
  "Collect Aurora tiles in your color, carry them to one of three bridge docks, automatically submit the stack while nearby, and finish the required bridge distance before the rival crews.": "收集您颜色的极光瓷砖，将它们带到三个桥码头之一，在附近自动提交堆栈，并在竞争对手之前完成所需的桥距离。",
  "Collect consecutive stars to raise the next-star multiplier. A collision removes 80 points and resets that multiplier.": "收集连续的星星以提高下一颗星星的乘数。碰撞会消除 80 分并重置该乘数。",
  "Collect cyan aurora tiles. Other colors belong to the rivals.": "收集青色极光瓷砖。其他颜色属于竞争对手。",
  "Collect cyan tiles and carry them to any bridge dock.": "收集青色瓷砖并将它们带到任何桥码头。",
  "Collect cyan tiles and finish a bridge before the rivals.": "收集青色瓷砖并在对手之前完成一座桥梁。",
  "Collect drops promptly and spend before a thief can take them.": "及时收集掉落物并在小偷拿走之前将其花费掉。",
  "Collect early XP so the first upgrade changes more of the patrol.": "收集早期的经验值，以便第一次升级可以改变更多的巡逻。",
  "Collect every fruit before entering home.": "回家前收集所有水果。",
  "Collect EXP and spend both exact-value attribute points whenever growth pauses the same Battle screen.": "每当成长暂停同一战斗屏幕时，收集经验值并花费精确值的属性点。",
  "Collect EXP orbs after a safe defeat. When growth pauses the battle, spend both points before play resumes; leaving one point unspent is not allowed.": "安全失败后收集经验球。当成长暂停战斗时，在比赛恢复之前花掉两点；不允许留下一分未用。",
  "Collect falling sun before it fades. Sun pays for guards during that stage; coins earned from defeated beasts are saved for permanent training.": "在落日消逝之前收集它。 Sun 支付该阶段的警卫费用；从击败的野兽中获得的硬币将被保存下来用于永久训练。",
  "Collect fast. Choose a lane. Build first.": "快收藏吧。选择一条车道。首先构建。",
  "Collect fruit and keys while avoiding rocks, water, closed gates, and crumbled fragile paths.": "收集水果和钥匙，同时避开岩石、水、关闭的大门和破碎的脆弱路径。",
  "Collect fruit and route keys while avoiding rocks, water, closed gates, and unusable fragile tiles.": "收集水果和路线钥匙，同时避开岩石、水、关闭的大门和无法使用的易碎瓷砖。",
  "Collect goal": "收集目标",
  "Collect nearby crystals and keys from farther away.": "从远处收集附近的水晶和钥匙。",
  "Collect Relic Orbs. At level-up, choose one of three temporary upgrades or use the single optional reroll.": "收集遗物球。在升级时，选择三个临时升级之一或使用单个可选的重新滚动。",
  "Collect several tiles of your color without exceeding a safe return distance.": "在不超过安全返回距离的情况下收集几块与您颜色相同的图块。",
  "Collect stars for score and combo while avoiding cones, satchels, book stacks, and puddles.": "收集星星以获得分数和组合，同时避开圆锥体、书包、书架和水坑。",
  "Collect Sun": "收集太阳",
  "Collect sun, react to special enemy cues, and stop every beast before cottage hearts reach zero.": "收集阳光，对特殊的敌人提示做出反应，并在小屋之心归零之前阻止每只野兽。",
  "Collect the displayed number of keys and XP crystals before the timer ends.": "在计时器结束之前收集显示数量的钥匙和 XP 水晶。",
  "Collect the first XP crystals before committing to a distant key. One early upgrade changes the rest of the patrol.": "在使用远程钥匙之前收集第一批 XP 水晶。一项早期升级改变了巡逻队的其余部分。",
  "Collect the golden key before entering its gate; a rejected gate tap costs no move.": "进入大门前收集金钥匙；被拒绝的门水龙头不需要移动。",
  "Collect the golden route key, then enter its matching gate. A closed gate never consumes a move.": "收集黄金路线钥匙，然后进入其匹配的大门。关闭的门永远不会消耗一步。",
  "Collect the mission object and then reach the active extraction marker. When a rule says treasure is the first seal, the object cannot be collected until that seal is open.": "收集任务物体，然后到达活动的撤离标记。当规则规定宝藏是第一个封印时，在该封印打开之前无法收集该物品。",
  "Collect the needed bubbles before moves run out.": "在步数用完之前收集所需的气泡。",
  "Collect the smallest reachable salvage first to increase mass safely.": "首先收集最小的可到达的残骸以安全地增加质量。",
  "Collect the ticket box": "领取票箱",
  "Collect the ticket box when it fills, or leave tickets ready when a milestone asks for a full box.": "当票箱装满时收集票证，或者当里程碑需要装满票箱时将票证准备好。",
  "Collect three matching objects to clear them automatically.": "收集三个匹配的物体即可自动清除它们。",
  "Collect three prism shards to open this wreckage.": "收集三块棱镜碎片来打开这个残骸。",
  "Collect tickets, then leave a second amount waiting in the box.": "收集门票，然后将第二张门票留在盒子里等待。",
