  "Colpisci durante il recupero della Matriarca dopo lo scatto lunare.": "Colpisci durante il recupero della Matriarca dopo lo scatto月球。",
  "Combat roles: blockers buy time, Archers and Orla cover distance, Sappers apply splash damage and slowing, Medics heal damaged defenders, Fia focuses Boss pressure, and Gear Horn Rux strengthens nearby allies. Selecting a placed unit shows its upgrade cost and sell refund.": "战斗角色：阻挡者争取时间，弓箭手和奥拉覆盖距离，工兵施加溅射伤害和减速，医疗兵治疗受损的防御者，菲亚集中Boss压力，齿轮号角鲁克斯加强附近的盟友。选择放置的单位会显示其升级成本和销售退款。",
  "Combat roles: Guards buy time; Archers win long lanes; Sappers deliver splash and slows; Taro anchors a choke; Orla chains into nearby packs; Fia specializes in Boss damage; and Rux makes a close formation stronger. Selecting a placed unit shows its upgrade cost and sell refund.": "战斗角色：守卫争取时间；弓箭手赢得长线；电子工兵会产生溅射并减速；太郎锚定了扼流圈；奥拉用链子锁住了附近的狼群； Fia 专注于 Boss 伤害； Rux让紧密的阵型变得更强。选择放置的单位会显示其升级成本和销售退款。",
  "Combattimento tattico a rulli": "鲁利战斗纹身",
