  "Command three animal heroes through 30 authored rune-grid missions with terrain rules, special enemies, six phased Bosses, permanent upgrades, and local progress.": "指挥三位动物英雄完成 30 个编写的符文网格任务，其中包括地形规则、特殊敌人、六个阶段性 Boss、永久升级和本地进度。",
  "Command three animal heroes through 30 rune-grid missions with seven terrain rules, special enemies, permanent growth, and six phased Bosses.": "指挥三名动物英雄完成 30 个符文网格任务，其中包括七种地形规则、特殊敌人、永久成长和六个阶段性 Boss。",
  "Command three automatic prism batteries against dense shadow formations. Switch lanes to stop the closest threat and collect the rare power core before the stronger wave behind it arrives.": "指挥三座自动棱镜炮台对抗密集的阴影阵型。切换车道以阻止最近的威胁，并在后面更强大的浪潮到来之前收集稀有的能量核心。",
