  "Compare crossing clues before committing a cell.": "在提交单元之前比较交叉线索。",
  "Compare each lane's salvage, danger, oxygen estimate, and environmental clues. Manage shared tool power, survive fish encounters, reach the route target, and surface safely.": "比较每条车道的救援、危险、氧气估计和环境线索。管理共享工具动力，在遭遇鱼类时幸存下来，到达路线目标并安全浮出水面。",
  "Compare every queue front before sending a future color into the holding lane.": "在将未来的颜色发送到等待通道之前，比较每个队列前端。",
  "Compare every tempting jungle animal with the six picture chips; a visible animal can be a harmless visitor.": "将每种诱人的丛林动物与六张图片芯片进行比较；可见的动物可能是无害的访客。",
  "Compare food clues with animal families and body features.": "将食物线索与动物科系和身体特征进行比较。",
  "Compare loot, danger, and oxygen estimates. Save enough power for timed fish attacks, reach the target, or SURFACE early.": "比较战利品、危险和氧气估计。为定时鱼类攻击、到达目标或尽早浮出水面节省足够的电量。",
  "Compare loot, risk, and oxygen.": "比较战利品、风险和氧气。",
  "Compare pairs by what they uncover. Removing a top-layer pair usually creates more choices than clearing an already open edge.": "通过他们发现的内容来比较成对的人。删除顶层对通常比清除已经开放的边缘创造更多选择。",
  "Compare pink, black, white, and brown.": "比较粉色、黑色、白色和棕色。",
  "Compare points and curved edges when outline cars remove color.": "当轮廓车去除颜色时，比较点和弯曲边缘。",
  "Compare the evidence with the three or four animal names, then choose one.": "将证据与三四个动物名称进行比较，然后选择一个。",
  "Compare the evidence with the three or four animal-name choices and select one answer.": "将证据与三到四个动物名称选项进行比较并选择一个答案。",
  "Compare the left and right target estimates and environmental clues; use Sonar only when exact information is worth the battery cost.": "比较左右目标估计和环境线索；仅当准确信息值得电池成本时才使用声纳。",
  "Compare the pictures, then tap one tool or drag it onto the animal.": "比较图片，然后点击一个工具或将其拖到动物上。",
  "Compare the six picture chips below the scene with the partly covered animals in the habitat.": "将场景下方的六个图片碎片与栖息地中部分覆盖的动物进行比较。",
