  "Correct centre passages build Resonance. Echo Guard can recover one mistake at the last checkpoint, while Pulse Control and Foresight provide permanent tuning without changing the authored gate solutions.": "正确的中心通道会产生共鸣。 Echo Guard 可以在最后一个检查点恢复一个错误，而 Pulse Control 和 Foresight 则提供永久调整，而无需更改编写的门解决方案。",
  "Correct matches fill one fifth of the progress bar and award a food sticker for the result parade. A wrong box stays available and gives supportive feedback, so the child can look again without losing a life or restarting the level.": "正确的匹配会填满进度条的五分之一，并为结果游行奖励一张食物贴纸。错误的盒子会保持可用状态并提供支持性反馈，因此孩子可以再次查看而不会失去生命或重新启动关卡。",
