  "Cut vine": "砍藤",
  "Cut Vine": "砍藤",
  "Cut vines, move the leaf trampoline, and guide fruit to hungry animals in Animal Vine Rescue, a family-friendly animal physics puzzle on WeightPlay.": "在《Animal Vine Rescue》（WeightPlay 上一款适合全家一起玩的动物物理益智游戏）中，砍断藤蔓、移动叶子蹦床，并将水果引导给饥饿的动物。",
  "Cyan": "青色",
  "Cyan shadow circles hide Fia from patrol sight. Bell Warden gives a visible warning before each pulse; Fia gains Alert if she remains outside shadow when the bell rings.": "青色阴影圈使 Fia 无法被巡逻人员发现。 Bell Warden 在每次脉冲前发出明显的警告；如果菲亚在铃声响起时仍在阴影之外，则会获得警报。",
  "Cyan wave, gold sun, violet diamond, and coral paw always keep distinct emblems and textures.": "青色波浪、金色太阳、紫罗兰钻石和珊瑚爪始终保持着独特的标志和纹理。",
  "Cyan wave, gold sun, violet diamond, and coral paw keep distinct emblems. Read the segment at the bottom of the ring, closest to your spirit.": "青色波浪、金色太阳、紫罗兰钻石、珊瑚爪保持着鲜明的标志。阅读戒指底部最接近您精神的部分。",
  "Cycles charge, flood, burn, flight, and mirror summons at visible phases.": "在可见阶段循环冲锋、淹没、燃烧、飞行和镜像召唤。",
