  "Das geteilte Spektrum hat eine weitere Lichtkugel erzeugt!": "Das geteilte Spektrum hat eine weitere Lichtkugel erzeugt！",
  "Dash": "冲刺",
  "DASH": "达什",
  "Dash attack": "冲刺攻击",
  "Dash energy powers a temporary speed burst. Shield, magnet, and dash pickups provide short tactical effects, while workshop capacity, speed, and grip upgrades offer permanent local support.": "冲刺能量为暂时的速度爆发提供动力。护罩、磁铁和仪表板拾音器可提供短暂的战术效果，而车间容量、速度和抓地力升级可提供永久的本地支持。",
  "Dash is both movement and defense. Use it through a projectile fan or across the last part of a charge, then turn and slash during the enemy recovery instead of dashing only for speed.": "冲刺既是移动也是防御。使用它穿过射弹扇或冲锋的最后部分，然后在敌人恢复期间转身并砍杀，而不是仅仅为了速度而冲刺。",
  "Dash toward the nearest enemy, become invulnerable for 0.55 seconds, and deal {damage} close-range damage.": "冲向最近的敌人，0.55秒内无敌，并造成{damage}近距离伤害。",
  "Dash with Fia after a yellow charge warning so invulnerable movement crosses danger.": "在黄色冲锋警告后与 Fia 一起冲刺，以无懈可击的动作穿越危险。",
  "Dato animal: {animal} - {clue}": "拿督动物：{animal} - {clue}",
  "Dawn Preview": "黎明预览",
  "Day": "日",
  "Day {day}": "天 {day}",
  "Day complete": "一天完成",
  "Days 1-5 teach direct Picture Orders, single and repeated ingredients, and the growing queue. Day 5 is the first Cafe Review.": "第 1-5 天教授直接图片订单、单一和重复成分以及不断增长的队列。第五天是第一次咖啡馆评论。",
  "Days 1-5: Picture Orders.": "第 1-5 天：图片订单。",
  "Days 11-15 add VIP Service. A gold tag changes which otherwise-correct order may be delivered first.": "第 11-15 天添加 VIP 服务。黄金标签改变了原本正确的订单可以首先交付的情况。",
  "Days 11-15 require a waiting VIP to be served first. Days 16-20 alternate Table A and Table B. Days 21-25 ask for a different animal next whenever another species is eligible.": "第 11-15 天需要先为等待的 VIP 提供服务。第 16-20 天交替使用表 A 和表 B。第 21-25 天，只要有其他物种符合条件，就要求接下来选择不同的动物。",
  "Days 11-15: VIP Service.": "第 11-15 天：VIP 服务。",
  "Days 16-20 add Twin Tables. The required service alternates between Table A and Table B.": "第 16-20 天添加双桌。所需的服务在表 A 和表 B 之间交替。",
  "Days 16-20: Twin Tables.": "第 16-20 天：双桌。",
  "Days 21-25 add Animal Variety. Service must change species when another eligible friend is waiting.": "第 21-25 天添加动物品种。当另一个符合条件的朋友正在等待时，服务必须改变种类。",
  "Days 21-25: Animal Variety.": "第 21-25 天：动物品种。",
  "Days 26-29 combine two earlier rules. Day 30 activates recipe order, VIP priority, table alternation, and animal variety together.": "第 26-29 天结合了之前的两条规则。第 30 天同时激活菜谱订购、VIP 优先、餐桌轮换和动物品种。",
  "Days 26-30 form Festival Week. Four days combine two rules; Day 30 uses all four and ends the campaign.": "第 26-30 天构成节日周。四天结合了两条规则；第 30 天使用全部四个并结束活动。",
  "Days 26-30: Festival Week.": "第 26-30 天：节日周。",
  "Days 6-10 add Recipe Steps. Two-step orders lead to three-step practice and the Recipe Review.": "第 6-10 天添加食谱步骤。两步命令导致三步练习和食谱审查。",
  "Days 6-10 require the exact visible 1-2-3 order. Selecting the right ingredients in a different order is not accepted, so the recipe numbers carry real meaning.": "第 6-10 天需要精确可见的 1-2-3 顺序。不接受以不同的顺序选择正确的成分，因此配方编号具有真正的意义。",
  "Days 6-10: Recipe Steps.": "第 6-10 天：食谱步骤。",
  "Days, coins, best result, and upgrades are stored locally in this browser.": "天数、硬币、最佳结果和升级都存储在该浏览器本地。",
  "De 5×5 a 12×12": "德 5×5 和 12×12",
  "Deal {damage} damage to nearby enemies.": "对附近的敌人造成 {damage} 伤害。",
  "Deal {damage} damage to the nearest enemy and mark its next automatic hit for +18 damage.": "对最近的敌人造成 {damage} 伤害，并标记其下一次自动命中 +18 伤害。",
  "Deal 14 damage and draw 1 card.": "造成 14 点伤害并抽 1 张卡。",
  "Deal 6 damage. If another attack was played this turn, deal 12 instead.": "造成 6 点伤害。如果本回合进行了另一次攻击，则改为处理 12。",
  "Deal heavy damage to the closest target.": "对最近的目标造成严重伤害。",
  "Deals {p}× ATK damage and creates a shield equal to half the damage.": "造成{p}×攻击力伤害，并产生伤害一半的护盾。",
  "Deals {p}× ATK damage and restores HP equal to half the damage.": "造成{p}×攻击力伤害，并恢复一半伤害的生命值。",
  "Deals {p}× ATK damage to the selected enemy.": "对选定的敌人造成{p}×攻击力伤害。",
  "Deals {p}× ATK damage, then restores HP and creates a shield equal to 35% of that damage.": "造成{p}×攻击力伤害，然后恢复生命值，并形成相当于该伤害35%的护盾。",
  "Decide how to leave a fragile square before entering it.": "在进入一个脆弱的方格之前决定如何离开它。",
  "Decide whether the optional treasure is worth its longer route. It supplies the third medal and extra Moon Coins, but ordinary progress never requires it.": "决定可选的宝藏是否值得走更长的路。它提供第三枚奖牌和额外的月亮币，但普通的进步从来不需要它。",
  "Deck": "甲板",
  "Decke Karten auf und finde gleiche Tierpaare!": "Decke Karten auf unde gleiche Tierpaare！",
  "Decrease bullet firing interval by 20%.": "子弹发射间隔减少 20%。",
  "Deduction": "扣除",
  "Deduction mosaic puzzle": "演绎马赛克拼图",
  "Deep Camouflage": "深迷彩",
  "Deep Camouflage reduces the animal's contrast and enlarges its foreground grass, leaf, water, or dust cover. Keyboard focus and compass hints restore a strong readable cue, keeping the rule discoverable without making the target disappear.": "深度伪装会降低动物的对比度并放大其前景草、树叶、水或灰尘覆盖物。键盘焦点和指南针提示恢复了强大的可读提示，保持规则可发现，而不会使目标消失。",
  "Deep Camouflage:": "深度迷彩：",
