  "Defeat {count} {enemy}": "击败{count}{enemy}",
  "Defeat {count} Shadow Scouts": "击败 {count} 暗影斥候",
  "Defeat a splitter before its two shards spread.": "在分裂者的两个碎片散开之前击败它。",
  "Defeat every enemy, choose a permanent Rune Reward, and review saved XP, Runes and mission progress.": "击败每一个敌人，选择永久的符文奖励，并查看保存的经验值、符文和任务进度。",
  "Defeat every enemy, choose one permanent Rune Reward, and review the exact saved XP, Runes, best mission and next upgrade gap.": "击败每一个敌人，选择一个永久的符文奖励，并查看准确保存的 XP、符文、最佳任务和下一个升级差距。",
  "Defeat ordinary threats while watching for charges, ranged bolts, shields, regeneration, slow and silence effects.": "击败普通威胁，同时注意冲锋、远程螺栓、护盾、再生、缓慢和沉默效果。",
  "Defeat the {enemy} captain": "击败{enemy}队长",
  "Defeat the complete encounter. Victory saves the clear, unlocks the next stage, and offers Next Stage. Defeat offers a direct retry. Both results can return to Stage selection.": "彻底击败遭遇战。胜利可以保存清关，解锁下一阶段，并提供下一阶段。失败可直接重试。两种结果都可以返回阶段选择。",
  "Defeat the complete encounter. Victory saves the stage and unlocks the next one; defeat offers retry without deleting prior clears.": "彻底击败遭遇战。胜利拯救这一关并解锁下一关；失败提供重试而不删除先前的清除。",
  "Defeat the delayed Elite in Rooms 1 and 2, collect its Golden Key, open the chest and decide whether to equip the named drop or keep the current loadout.": "在房间 1 和 2 中击败延迟的精英，收集其金钥匙，打开宝箱并决定是否装备指定的掉落物或保留当前的装备。",
  "Defeat the fifth encounter to save the stage. Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 are Guardian checkpoints.": "击败第五场战斗以挽救舞台。第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 阶段是守护者检查站。",
  "Defeat the Shadow Sovereign": "击败暗影君主",
  "Defeat the third elite or checkpoint Boss before HP reaches zero.": "在生命值为零之前击败第三个精英或关卡Boss。",
  "Defeat! Your squad fainted.": "失败！你的小队晕倒了。",
  "Defeated {enemy}. Draft a new card.": "击败{enemy}。起草一张新卡。",
  "Defeated enemies leave XP crystals. Filling the XP bar pauses the patrol and offers three of the six available upgrades.": "击败的敌人会留下 XP 水晶。填满 XP 条会暂停巡逻，并提供六种可用升级中的三种。",
  "Defeats restore 3 Wall HP": "失败恢复 3 墙 HP",
