  "Diamond Summon": "钻石召唤",
  "Diamond-marked animals carry keys for blue trail seals, while starred pictures represent separated families. Patrol Trail boards alternate the available route between groups A and B after each match, asking the ranger to inspect a different part of the layered board. Clearing Board 30 restores the final Coral Shelf page and completes all six Habitat Finales.": "带有钻石标记的动物携带着蓝色小道印章的钥匙，而带星号的图片则代表离散的家庭。每场比赛结束后，巡逻板会在 A 组和 B 组之间交替使用可用路线，要求护林员检查分层板的不同部分。 Clearing Board 30 恢复了最终的珊瑚架页面并完成了所有六个栖息地结局。",
  "Diamonds": "钻石",
  "Diamonds are optional. They can reroll relic choices, revive a failed expedition, unlock two premium heroes, or unlock the golden cosmetic skin; normal stage progression does not require them.": "钻石是可选的。他们可以重新选择遗物，复活失败的探险队，解锁两名高级英雄，或解锁金色装饰皮肤；正常的阶段进展不需要它们。",
  "Diamonds open seals, stars mark rescue families, and blue sealed tiles wait for their key.": "钻石打开封印，星星标记救援家庭，蓝色密封瓷砖等待他们的钥匙。",
  "Diamonds optionally confirm a core revive, reroll a result reward, or unlock the golden frame. They are not required for normal campaign progress.": "钻石可以选择确认核心复活、重新滚动结果奖励或解锁黄金框。正常的战役进展不需要它们。",
  "Dica": "迪卡",
  "Dicas": "迪卡斯",
