  "Different bears live in forests, mountains, tundra, and icy coasts.": "不同的熊生活在森林、山脉、苔原和冰冷的海岸。",
  "Different capacities change where each color belongs.": "不同的容量会改变每种颜色所属的位置。",
  "Different kinds of me live in forests, deserts, grasslands, and water.": "不同种类的我生活在森林、沙漠、草原和水中。",
  "Different owls live in forests, grasslands, deserts, and farms.": "不同的猫头鹰生活在森林、草原、沙漠和农场。",
  "Different whales filter tiny prey or hunt fish and squid.": "不同的鲸鱼会过滤微小的猎物或捕食鱼类和鱿鱼。",
  "Difficile": "艰难梭菌",
  "Difficulty": "难度",
  "Difficulty changes navigation and objective structure rather than only raising the numerical quota.": "困难改变了导航和目标结构，而不仅仅是提高了数量配额。",
  "Difficulty comes from spatial consequences while the arithmetic remains limited to equality and sums of ten.": "困难来自于空间后果，而算术仍然仅限于等式和十之和。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing access decisions rather than simply adding tiles, shrinking pictures, or imposing a fast clock. Seals add dependency, rescues add visible subgoals, and Patrol Trail changes which set is currently available after each match. One fixed logical layout scales uniformly on phones, tablets, desktop, and short landscape. Touch, mouse, and keyboard share one validator; Result stays inside Battle; the Kids route creates no advertising request or reserve. Unlike a memory game, every picture remains visible, and unlike a flat matching board, removal order changes which tiles can be reached.": "通过改变访问决策而不是简单地添加图块、缩小图片或施加快速时钟来增加难度。海豹突击队增加了依赖性，救援队增加了可见的子目标，而巡逻追踪则改变了每场比赛后当前可用的设置。一种固定的逻辑布局在手机、平板电脑、桌面和短横向上统一缩放。触摸、鼠标、键盘共用一个验证器；结果保留在战斗中；儿童路线不会产生广告请求或保留。与记忆游戏不同，每张图片都保持可见，并且与平面匹配板不同，移除顺序会改变可以到达的图块。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing route logic rather than adding speed. Mud changes cost, gates change order, fragile paths change reversibility, and required fruit changes when home is valid. The 390 by 788 Kids canvas keeps Stage, Battle, and Result stable across devices. There is no timer, combat, leaderboard, account, purchase, or advertising request; the challenge comes from reading a small map and committing to a route.": "通过改变路线逻辑而不是增加速度来增加难度。泥浆改变成本，大门改变顺序，脆弱的路径改变可逆性，以及当家园有效时所需的水果改变。 390 x 788 Kids 画布在不同设备上保持舞台、战斗和结果稳定。没有计时器、战斗、排行榜、帐户、购买或广告请求；挑战来自于阅读小地图并确定路线。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing useful evidence instead of shrinking targets or adding a clock. Direct needs establish meanings; picture recognition, priority, recall and changing positions each add one understandable demand. The fixed logical Canvas scales uniformly across phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Situation effects never display the answer item, and visible-time feedback cannot finish while the page is backgrounded. Unlike Zoo Helper Day’s care categories and ordered routines, this game connects environmental situations to immediate item decisions. Kids play has no advertising, account, purchase, ranking or diagnosis.": "通过改变有用的证据而不是缩小目标或增加时钟来增加难度。直接需求确立意义；图片识别、优先级、召回和改变位置每一项都增加了一项可以理解的需求。固定逻辑画布在手机、平板电脑、桌面和短景观上统一缩放。情境效果永远不会显示答案项目，并且当页面处于后台时，可见时间反馈无法完成。与动物园助手日的护理类别和有序例程不同，该游戏将环境情况与即时项目决策联系起来。儿童游戏没有广告、帐户、购买、排名或诊断。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing what the player observes instead of shrinking controls, adding a timer or hiding the correct hit area. Direct matching establishes the vocabulary; outline, movement, memory and ordered selection each add one understandable decision. The fixed logical layout scales uniformly on phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Image-backed cars and tokens keep play visual, while localized text explains only the current rule. Match and memory delays count visible play time, so an app switch cannot silently advance the route. Unlike Animal Quiz, no factual reading is required; unlike Zoo Helper Day, the decision is visual equivalence rather than care purpose. Kids play has no advertising, purchase, account, ranking or diagnostic claim.": "通过改变玩家观察的内容而不是缩小控制、添加计时器或隐藏正确的击中区域来增加难度。直接匹配建立词汇表；轮廓、动作、记忆和有序选择每一项都增加了一个可以理解的决定。固定的逻辑布局在手机、平板电脑、桌面和短景观上统一缩放。图像支持的汽车和代币保持游戏的视觉效果，而本地化文本仅解释当前规则。比赛和记忆延迟会计算可见的比赛时间，因此应用程序切换无法默默地推进路线。与《Animal Quiz》不同，不需要阅读事实材料；与动物园助手日不同的是，这个决定是视觉对等而不是护理目的。儿童游戏没有广告、购买、帐户、排名或诊断声明。",
  "Difficulty grows through layer dependencies and tray pressure, not a hidden timer.": "难度是通过层依赖性和托盘压力而不是隐藏的计时器来增加的。",
  "Difficulty grows through readable pattern density rather than invisible physics changes.": "难度是通过可读的图案密度而不是看不见的物理变化来增加的。",
  "Dining Rhythm": "用餐节奏",
  "Direct matching, one required bank shot, the first zebra rescue, mixed colors, stones, and the first Safari Check establish precise collision.": "直接匹配、一次所需的银行射击、第一次斑马救援、混合颜色、石头和第一次狩猎检查建立精确的碰撞。",
  "Direct paths, crossing patrols, optional treasure, and extraction teach the complete base loop. Lantern Auditor ends the wing with a searchlight whose visible sight circle repeatedly expands and contracts.": "直接路径、交叉巡逻、可选宝藏和撤离教导完整的基地循环。灯笼审计员在机翼末端装有探照灯，其可见视线圈不断扩大和收缩。",
  "Direct picture-and-text situations introduce all animals, scenes, and helper items. Mission 5 is the first Helper Check.": "直接的图文情境介绍了所有动物、场景和辅助物品。任务 5 是第一个助手检查。",
  "Direct Scout packs teach movement, automatic range, skills, and two blessing choices. Shadow Prowler ends the region with a warned close shockwave.": "直接侦察包教授移动、自动射程、技能和两种祝福选择。暗影徘徊者用警告性的近距离冲击波结束了该区域。",
