  "Do I always need every fruit?": "我总是需要每种水果吗？",
  "Do I control attacks during battle?": "战斗中我可以控制攻击吗？",
  "Do I have to move quickly?": "我必须快速行动吗？",
  "Do I have to spend both attribute points?": "我必须花掉两个属性点吗？",
  "Do I lose a new item if I keep my current gear?": "如果我保留当前装备，我会失去新物品吗？",
  "Do I need Diamonds to finish the campaign?": "我需要钻石来完成活动吗？",
  "Do I need Diamonds to progress?": "我需要钻石才能进步吗？",
  "Do I need to guess?": "我需要猜测吗？",
  "Do mirrors need to be broken?": "镜子需要打破吗？",
  "Do not accept every loot item. Empty space can be more valuable than a weak object when Orla's shop or a Guardian is still ahead.": "不要接受所有战利品。当奥拉的商店或守护者仍在前方时，空旷的空间可能比脆弱的物体更有价值。",
  "Do not accept loot automatically. Keeping space for a later shop item can improve the final build.": "不要自动接受战利品。为以后的商店物品保留空间可以改善最终的构建。",
  "Do not always aim at the closest enemy. Anchors, splitters, and backline wisps can create more pressure than a slow front target, so use a bank route to reach the correct priority.": "不要总是瞄准最近的敌人。锚、分离器和后线小束可以比缓慢的前方目标产生更大的压力，因此请使用银行路线来达到正确的优先级。",
  "Do not attack into riposte. Block, draw or apply Poison until the stance changes.": "不要攻击还击。格挡、抽取或施加毒药，直到姿态改变。",
  "Do not chase every fast beast. Hold a useful firing lane and move early when a hawk or tiger begins a dash.": "不要追逐每只快速的野兽。守住一条有用的射击路线，并在鹰或老虎开始猛冲时尽早移动。",
  "Do not circle every room in the same direction. Reverse when ranged bolts fill the outside lane, and cut across an orbiter after it commits to its arc.": "不要将每个房间都朝同一方向环绕。当远程螺栓填满外侧通道时反转，并在轨道飞行器进入弧线后横穿轨道飞行器。",
  "Do not close every cell. A sealed route turns the maze into a direct fight against the nearest blocker and can remove the timing advantage you were trying to create.": "不要关闭每个单元格。封闭的路线会将迷宫变成与最近的阻挡者的直接战斗，并且可以消除您试图创造的时间优势。",
  "Do not collect a full ticket box if the current challenge specifically asks you to keep it ready.": "如果当前挑战特别要求您准备好票箱，请勿收集完整的票箱。",
  "Do not collect a full ticket box when the current challenge asks you to keep it ready.": "当当前挑战要求您准备好票箱时，请勿收集完整的票箱。",
  "Do not enter a fragile square simply because it is highlighted. Decide which side you want to leave from, because returning is not allowed.": "不要仅仅因为一个脆弱的方块被突出显示而进入它。决定从哪一边出发，因为不允许返回。",
  "Do not let enemies reach the core. Survive every wave; the final wave of each chapter is a Boss.": "不要让敌人到达核心。在每一波浪潮中生存下来；每章的最后一波都是Boss。",
  "Do not let one blocker carry the whole center lane.": "不要让一名拦路手占据整个中路。",
  "Do not rotate untouched mirrors until the route is close enough to use them.": "不要旋转未触及的镜子，直到路线足够近可以使用它们。",
  "Do not scan every zone automatically. Strong clues can preserve battery for a Shield or fish pulse, while jammed routes require direct inference.": "不要自动扫描每个区域。强有力的线索可以为护盾或鱼脉冲保留电池，而堵塞的路线则需要直接推理。",
  "Do not spend Owl's range on Thorn Boar from an adjacent cell. A two-cell hit avoids the melee counter and keeps the back line useful.": "不要将猫头鹰的射程花在邻近牢房的荆棘野猪身上。两格命中可以避免近战反击并保持后线有用。",
  "Do not spend the second jump immediately. Keep it available until a moving ledge, spread shot, or active ground lane confirms where the safe landing will be.": "不要立即进行第二次跳跃。保持其可用，直到移动壁架、分散射击或活动地面车道确认安全着陆位置。",
  "Do rivals make a zone impossible?": "竞争对手会让一个区域变得不可能吗？",
  "Do the weapons fire by themselves?": "武器会自己开火吗？",
