  "Drag + Rotate": "拖动+旋转",
  "Drag a block along its direction. Move the red explorer to the right exit. Thousands of deterministic trails are available.": "沿其方向拖动块。将红色探险家移至右侧出口。数以千计的确定性路径可用。",
  "Drag a piece into its faint outline. Tap a piece to turn it 45 degrees. Every piece must be snug and upright.": "将一块拖入其模糊的轮廓中。点击一块将其旋转 45 度。每件作品都必须紧密且直立。",
  "Drag across the tower or use Left and Right to rotate every ring together. A turquoise platform is safe; a violet cursed sector ends the run unless a shield or charged Comet Break protects Fia.": "在塔上拖动或使用向左和向右一起旋转每个环。绿松石色的平台是安全的；除非有护盾或带电彗星断裂保护菲亚，否则紫罗兰诅咒区域会结束奔跑。",
  "Drag across the tower or use Left and Right to rotate the rings.": "在塔上拖动或使用向左和向右旋转环。",
  "Drag an animal to a noticeably different meadow position; tiny accidental movement does not count.": "将动物拖到明显不同的草地位置；微小的意外移动不算在内。",
  "Drag an animal to a noticeably different position in the meadow. Tiny accidental movements do not count.": "将动物拖到草地上明显不同的位置。微小的意外动作不算在内。",
  "Drag and drop the animal into slot 1 of your active squad.": "将动物拖放到活跃小队的插槽 1 中。",
  "Drag animals in the meadow to arrange your zoo.": "拖动草地上的动物来布置你的动物园。",
  "Drag animals to new habitat positions for arrangement milestones.": "将动物拖到新的栖息地位置以安排里程碑。",
  "Drag anywhere across the arena to align the paddle with a finger or pointer, or use Left and Right or A and D. The paddle remains horizontally constrained.": "在区域中的任意位置拖动，以用手指或指针对齐挡板，或使用“左”和“右”或“A”和“D”。挡板保持水平约束。",
  "Drag anywhere across the arena to align the paddle with your finger. Contact near the paddle edge creates a sharper return angle.": "在竞技场中的任意位置拖动，使桨与手指对齐。桨叶边缘附近的接触会产生更尖锐的返回角。",
  "Drag food into the matching lunchbox.": "将食物拖入配套的午餐盒中。",
  "Drag from one colored seed to its match. Paths cannot share a tile, and every tile must be filled.": "从一种颜色的种子拖动到其匹配项。路径不能共享一个图块，并且每个图块都必须被填充。",
  "Drag from the holding marker to a compatible open dock while avoiding active routes, storms, and closed maintenance lanes.": "从等待标记拖动到兼容的开放码头，同时避开活动路线、风暴和封闭的维护车道。",
  "Drag from the launcher, preview the bounce path, then release.": "从启动器中拖动，预览弹跳路径，然后释放。",
  "Drag from the lion keeper toward the desired angle. Use the preview to decide whether a direct shot, one-wall bank, cross-arena bank, or pylon reflection reaches the priority target.": "从狮子饲养员拖动到所需的角度。使用预览来决定直接射击、单墙银行、跨竞技场银行或塔反射是否到达优先目标。",
  "Drag from the selected flight's holding marker to a compatible open dock and release on the dock.": "从所选航班的等待标记拖动到兼容的开放底座，然后在底座上释放。",
  "Drag horizontally to rotate the complete tower.": "水平拖动以旋转整个塔。",
  "Drag it onto empty cells, or tap the piece and then a board cell.": "将其拖到空单元格上，或点击该块，然后点击棋盘单元格。",
  "Drag it to the board, or tap the piece and then a cell.": "将其拖到板上，或点击该块，然后点击一个单元格。",
  "Drag left or right to rotate": "向左或向右拖动进行旋转",
  "Drag or hold to aim and release to fire. Arrow keys adjust the same logical aim; Enter or Space shoots.": "拖动或按住以瞄准并释放以开火。方向键调整相同的逻辑目标；进入或太空射击。",
  "Drag routes to compare depth and oxygen risk.": "拖动路线以比较深度和氧气风险。",
  "Drag routes to compare zones, salvage target, and oxygen risk.": "拖动路线以比较区域、救助目标和氧气风险。",
  "Drag sideways and choose an unlocked challenge.": "向侧面拖动并选择一个解锁的挑战。",
  "Drag sideways and choose an unlocked stage.": "向侧面拖动并选择一个未锁定的阶段。",
  "Drag the airship, or press Enter and use arrow keys, to choose its dock.": "拖动飞艇，或按 Enter 并使用箭头键来选择其停靠点。",
  "Drag the food to the matching lunchbox.": "将食物拖到匹配的午餐盒中。",
  "Drag the leaf or use ← →, then press Cut. Keep moving while the fruit falls.": "拖动叶子或使用 ← →，然后按剪切。当水果掉落时继续移动。",
  "Drag the leaf trampoline under the falling fruit.": "将叶子蹦床拖到掉落的水果下方。",
  "Drag the leaf. Cut the vine when you are ready.": "拖动叶子。准备好后切掉藤蔓。",
  "Drag the paddle or use Left/Right and A/D.": "拖动桨或使用左/右和 A/D。",
  "Drag the rail and choose an unlocked assault.": "拖动导轨并选择解锁的攻击。",
  "Drag the rail and choose an unlocked race.": "拖动轨道并选择一个未锁定的比赛。",
  "Drag the rail and choose an unlocked stage. Boss checkpoints are 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30.": "拖动导轨并选择一个未锁定的阶段。 Boss 检查点为 5、10、15、20、25 和 30。",
  "Drag the rail and choose an unlocked tower.": "拖动轨道并选择一个未锁定的塔。",
  "Drag the rail and choose an unlocked zone.": "拖动导轨并选择一个解锁区域。",
  "Drag the rail. A glowing frame marks the centered chamber.": "拖动导轨。一个发光的框架标志着中心室。",
  "Drag the rail. Choose any unlocked mission.": "拖动导轨。选择任何解锁的任务。",
  "Drag the rail. The centred glowing card is selected.": "拖动导轨。选择居中的发光卡。",
