  "Enemies": "敌人",
  "Enemies act after the rune result resolves. The summoner's health, shield, total defense, total healing, wave count, and enemy intent remain visible throughout Battle.": "敌人在符文结果结算后行动。召唤者的生命值、护盾、总防御、总治疗、波数和敌人意图在整个战斗中保持可见。",
