  "Enemy defeated. Repack for the next encounter.": "敌人被打败了。重新包装以备下次相遇。",
  "Enemy HP": "敌方生命值",
  "Enemy identities: Scouts chase, Ravens curve through the arena, Boars warn before charging, Hunters keep distance and fire, and Abyss Guards reduce ordinary damage until skills break guard.": "敌人身份：侦察兵追逐，乌鸦在竞技场中蜿蜒穿过，野猪在冲锋前发出警告，猎人保持距离并开火，深渊守卫会减少普通伤害，直到技能打破守卫。",
  "Enemy rules are positional, not just statistical. Wolves gain Pack Fang while adjacent to another Wolf. Ravens target the hero with the lowest health ratio. Stone Stag restores first-hit armor. Thorn Boar returns one damage after a surviving adjacent melee hit. Rune Fox teleports behind the weakest hero. Tide Turtle gives the nearest ally a one-hit guard, while Relic Heron pushes the hero it strikes. Cinder Ram charges a visible straight line instead of walking normally.": "敌人的规则是位置性的，而不仅仅是统计性的。狼在与另一只狼相邻时获得群牙。乌鸦的目标是生命值最低的英雄。石鹿恢复首击护甲。荆棘野猪在幸存的相邻近战攻击后返回 1 点伤害。符文狐狸传送到最弱的英雄身后。潮汐龟为最近的盟友提供一击防护，而遗物苍鹭则推动它击中的英雄。灰烬公羊没有正常行走，而是沿着可见的直线冲锋。",
  "Enemy rules are positional. Adjacent Wolves gain Pack Fang, Ravens hunt the weakest hero, and Stone Stag restores first-hit armor. Thorn Boar counters surviving adjacent melee hits, Rune Fox teleports behind the weakest hero, Tide Turtle guards an ally, Relic Heron pushes its target, and Cinder Ram charges a straight line.": "敌人的规则是位置性的。相邻的狼获得群牙，乌鸦猎杀最弱的英雄，石鹿恢复首击护甲。荆棘野猪反击幸存的相邻近战攻击，符文狐瞬移到最弱的英雄身后，潮汐龟守护盟友，遗迹苍鹭推动目标，灰烬公羊直线冲锋。",
