  "Extraction insurance is already active.": "提取保险已经生效。",
  "Extraction provides one medal. Avoiding capture provides a second, and returning with optional treasure provides the third. The best medal count for each mission, highest unlocked mission, Moon Coins, and Safehouse level are saved locally. Safehouse level rises as groups of five different missions are cleared. Earlier cards stay replayable, and the Result substate offers Retry, Missions, and Next Mission only when another campaign mission actually exists.": "提取可提供一枚奖牌。避免捕获提供了第二个，带着可选宝藏返回提供了第三个。每个任务的最佳奖牌数、最高解锁任务、月球币和安全屋等级均保存在本地。随着五个不同任务组的完成，安全屋的等级会上升。早期的卡牌仍然可重玩，并且仅当另一个战役任务实际存在时，结果子状态才提供重试、任务和下一个任务。",
  "Extraction ready": "提取准备就绪",
