  "Fall through consecutive rings to charge Comet Break and smash one danger.": "穿过连续的圆环，冲向 Comet Break，粉碎一个危险。",
  "Fallen": "堕落者",
  "Falling-crystal warnings and three-shot Crystal Bats make standing still risky. Glass Causeway places that pressure under moving platforms, and Shard Ambush introduces the Armored Boar counter. Stone Guardian blocks frontal claws, then drops its guard after a ground slam that sends jumpable shockwaves in both directions.": "掉落水晶警告和三发水晶蝙蝠让原地不动变得危险。玻璃堤道将压力置于移动平台下，碎片伏击引入了装甲野猪柜台。石守卫会挡住前爪，然后在地面猛击后放弃防御，向两个方向发送可跳跃的冲击波。",
