  "Fast consecutive recoveries raise the Moon Chain. Later zones add currents, shields, rivals, rescue cores, and a closing storm.": "快速连续恢复会提升月亮链。后来的区域增加了水流、护盾、对手、救援核心和封闭风暴。",
