  "Fia": "国际汽联",
  "Fia closes a glowing sanctuary loop": "国际汽联关闭了一个发光的避难所环路",
  "Fia combines pictures, decoys, and safe box shuffles.": "Fia 结合了图片、诱饵和保险箱洗牌。",
  "Fia descending through a crystal skyspire": "Fia 穿过水晶塔顶下降",
  "Fia Garra Chispeante": "菲亚·加拉·奇斯皮安特",
  "Fia is safe on restored land. Outside it, her open trail can be cut by a hunter; reconnecting claims the enclosed region. Hearts, target area, mission modifiers, and enemy routes remain visible during Battle.": "国际汽联在恢复的土地上是安全的。在它之外，猎人可以切断她的开放路径；重新连接声称封闭区域。战斗期间，红心、目标区域、任务修改器和敌人路线仍然可见。",
  "Fia is safe on restored land. The moment she crosses into corruption, her lightning trail becomes vulnerable. Reconnect it to claim the enclosed area before a hunter reaches the open line.": "国际汽联在恢复的土地上是安全的。一旦她陷入腐败，她的闪电轨迹就会变得脆弱。在猎人到达开放线之前重新连接它以占领封闭区域。",
  "Fia is sealed inside a protective comet sphere while descending thirty unstable skyspires. Drag left or right to rotate every ring. Pass through openings, bounce on safe turquoise stone, and avoid violet cursed sectors.": "菲亚在从三十座不稳定的天空尖塔下降时被密封在彗星保护球内。向左或向右拖动以旋转每个环。穿过开口，在安全的绿松石上弹跳，并避开紫罗兰诅咒区域。",
  "Fia Pata Chispa": "菲亚·帕塔·奇斯帕",
