  "Fia Pata Cintilante": "菲亚·帕塔·辛蒂兰特",
  "Fia reached the finish first. Adapt earlier and try again.": "国际汽联率先到达终点。尽早适应并重试。",
  "Fia restored Tower {n} in {time} seconds.": "Fia 在 {time} 秒内恢复了塔{n}。",
  "Fia Strike": "国际汽联罢工",
  "Fia travels inside a comet sphere through a chain of unstable skyspires. Each cleared tower restores one section of the high-altitude route and brings the rescue gate closer.": "菲亚在彗星球内穿行，穿过一连串不稳定的天空尖塔。每一座被清除的塔楼都会恢复一段高空路线，并使救援门更近。",
