  "Fill colors one enclosed region at a time. Brush draws inside the artwork with adjustable size, and the eraser removes brush strokes. Undo and redo step through recent changes; Clear starts the current page again after confirmation.": "一次为一个封闭区域填充颜色。画笔以可调整的大小在图稿内绘制，橡皮擦可消除画笔描边。撤消和重做最近更改的步骤；确认后清除重新启动当前页面。",
  "Fill every bus without deadlocking the holding lane to unlock the next terminal.": "填满每辆巴士，而不使等待车道陷入僵局，以解锁下一个航站楼。",
  "Fill every cell with one line.": "用一行填充每个单元格。",
  "Fill every open cell before releasing to clear the stage.": "在释放以清除舞台之前填充每个打开的单元格。",
  "Fill every order with groups of four or more.": "以四人或四人以上为一组填写每个订单。",
  "Fill large regions first and add brush details afterward.": "首先填充大区域，然后添加画笔细节。",
  "Fill the active bus. Future colors must wait in order.": "填充活动总线。未来的颜色必须按顺序等待。",
  "Filled": "充满",
  "Fim do turno": "菲姆杜诺",
  "Fin de la Noche": "午后",
  "Fin de la partida": "党派最终",
  "Final": "决赛",
  "Final Boss combines crystal, roots, and charge": "最终 Boss 结合了水晶、根茎和冲锋",
  "Final Boss: wards, curses and rotating seals.": "最终 Boss：守卫、诅咒和旋转封印。",
  "Final Guest Rehearsal": "最后嘉宾排练",
  "Find": "查找",
  "Find {target} first!": "首先找到{target}！",
  "Find a cart with a clear path to its edge.": "找到一辆通向其边缘的畅通无阻的手推车。",
  "Find a matching free tile.": "找到匹配的免费瓷砖。",
  "Find a Pair": "找到一对",
  "Find all four words to complete the trail and unlock the next one.": "找到所有四个单词来完成线索并解锁下一个。",
  "Find all six animals to save stars and best visible search time, unlock the next habitat, or replay the current one.": "找到所有六种动物以节省星星和最佳可见搜索时间，解锁下一个栖息地，或重播当前栖息地。",
  "Find animal and habitat words. Your progress stays on this device.": "找到动物和栖息地的单词。您的进度保留在此设备上。",
  "Find animals blended into each natural habitat.": "寻找融入每个自然栖息地的动物。",
  "Find Groups": "查找群组",
  "Find hidden animals.": "寻找隐藏的动物。",
  "Find matching cards.": "找到匹配的卡片。",
  "Find the {animal} pair next.": "接下来找到 {animal} 对。",
  "Find the animal words": "找出动物的单词",
  "Find the golden key star before crossing this gate.": "在穿过这扇门之前找到金钥匙星。",
  "Find the signal cart before tapping a gated cart.": "在点击门控车之前找到信号车。",
  "Find the trail key before crossing this gate.": "在穿过这扇门之前找到线索钥匙。",
  "Find These": "找到这些",
  "Find two cards with the same picture.": "找到两张具有相同图片的卡片。",
  "Find two identical tiles with no tile directly above and at least one horizontal side open.": "找到两块相同的瓷砖，上面没有瓷砖，并且至少一侧水平面敞开。",
  "Finde die passenden Tierkarten.": "找到蒂尔卡滕 (Tierkarten) 路过的地方。",
  "Finde sechs Tierpaare in der angezeigten Reihenfolge.": "在 der angezeigten Reihenfolge 中查找 Tierpaare。",
  "Finish": "完成",
  "FINISH": "结束",
  "Finish 10 questions to clear a stage.": "完成 10 个问题即可通关。",
  "Finish a nearly defeated formation before switching unless a bomb or breach is imminent.": "除非炸弹或突破迫在眉睫，否则在转换之前完成一个几乎被击败的阵型。",
  "Finish all shape friends to clear.": "完成所有形状的朋友即可清除。",
  "Finish every color group within the target moves.": "完成目标动作中的每个颜色组。",
  "Finish every decision to save stars and unlock the next shift.": "完成每一个拯救星星的决定并解锁下一个班次。",
  "Finish every request to save one to three stars and unlock exactly the next shift.": "完成每个请求以保存一到三颗星并准确解锁下一个班次。",
  "Finish line reached!": "到达终点线了！",
  "Finish the displayed mission goal before the placement limit.": "在放置限制之前完成显示的任务目标。",
  "Finish the order and make one group of three.": "完成订单并制作一组三个。",
  "Finish the order to earn a stamp.": "完成订单即可获得印章。",
  "Finish the previous trail to unlock this one.": "完成上一条线索即可解锁这条线索。",
  "Finish the shift to earn tickets, stars, and the next zoo moment.": "完成轮班即可赚取门票、星星和下一个动物园时刻。",
  "Finish when every non-empty vessel contains one color.": "当每个非空容器包含一种颜色时完成。",
  "Finish with at most {target} bumps": "最多完成 {target} 次颠簸",
  "Finishing a habitat confirms all six requested sightings. Every fifth challenge is a Habitat Checkpoint that reviews the search habit learned in that region. Completing Checkpoint 30 returns a verified picture census to the lodge: paired animals have been counted separately, harmless visitors have not been confused with the list, and the moving lookout patrol has been observed in the required order.": "完成栖息地确认了所有六次请求的目击事件。每五个挑战就是一个栖息地检查点，用于审查在该地区学到的搜索习惯。完成 30 号检查站后，会向小屋返回经过验证的图片普查：配对的动物已单独计数，无害的访客未与列表混淆，并且已按要求的顺序观察移动的瞭望巡逻队。",
  "Finsternisprisma": "芬斯特尼斯棱镜",
  "Finsternisregent": "芬斯特尼斯摄政王",
  "Finsternistor": "芬斯特尼斯托",
  "Fire lanes cycle on and off": "消防通道循环开启和关闭",
  "Fire lanes cycle, Ember Wolves redraw safe ground with trails, and Dive Bats force attention above the player. Cinder Wyvern is protected while airborne and releases a fire fan. Its landing creates a shockwave but also exposes the body, turning survival during flight into a planned counterattack.": "消防通道循环，灰烬狼用踪迹重新绘制安全地面，潜水蝙蝠将注意力集中在玩家上方。灰烬双足飞龙在空中时受到保护并释放火扇。它的着陆产生了冲击波，但也暴露了身体，将飞行中的生存变成了有计划的反击。",
  "Firefly Confusion": "萤火虫混乱",
  "Firefly Star Chain": "萤火星链",
  "Fires a strong leaf shot, then supports a nearby lane with a lighter volley.": "发射强力树叶射击，然后用较轻的齐射支援附近的车道。",
