  "Gale Scouts open with fast damage and Coil Lynxes overload the most common material in the pack, disabling those link bonuses. Splitting a build between two materials reduces that risk. The Tempest Archon combines an opening strike with chain-lightning damage for every isolated item.": "狂风侦察兵打开时会造成快速伤害，而盘旋山猫则会使包中最常见的材料超载，从而禁用这些链接奖励。将构建拆分为两种材料可以降低这种风险。暴风雨执政官将开场攻击与连锁闪电伤害结合在一起，对每个孤立的物品造成伤害。",
