  "Gather matching spring orbs into the same vessel and restore the forest's lost colors.": "将匹配的弹簧球收集到同一个容器中并恢复森林失去的颜色。",
  "Gato": "加托",
  "Gear": "齿轮",
  "Gear and optional tools: Rod, Reel, Line, Bait, Boat, and Scanner have five local levels. Scanner expands earlier species pools. A three-Diamond Rare Lure guarantees one rare eligible cast, while a two-Diamond Sonar reveals and locks one next fish. Both require confirmation and neither is needed for progression.": "装备和可选工具：杆、卷轴、线、鱼饵、船和扫描仪有五个本地级别。扫描仪扩大了早期的物种库。三颗钻石的稀有诱饵可保证出现一条稀有的合格鱼饵，而两颗钻石的声纳则可揭示并锁定下一条鱼。两者都需要确认，但进展都不需要。",
  "Gear and upgrades": "装备和升级",
  "Gear Boots": "齿轮靴",
  "Gear Horn Rhino": "齿轮角犀牛",
  "Gear Horn Rux": "齿轮喇叭鲁克斯",
  "Gear Horn Rux draws rune wheels for a forest rally cart": "Gear Horn Rux 为森林拉力车绘制符文轮",
  "Gear Horn Rux is the caravan packmaster, while Moon Cap Orla follows with a travelling shop. Clearing a stage reopens one section of road. Defeating the Root Guardian, Crystal Warden, Hollow Colossus, Furnace Leviathan, Tempest Archon, and Eclipse Hoardmaster restores all six regions and releases the stored cargo.": "Gear Horn Rux 是商队包装管理员，而 Moon Cap Orla 则拥有一家旅行商店。清理一个舞台会重新开放一段道路。击败根之守护者、水晶守望者、空心巨像、熔炉利维坦、暴风雨执政官和日蚀囤积大师可恢复所有六个区域并释放储存的货物。",
  "Gear Horn Rux is the caravan&#39;s packmaster. He cannot carry every useful object in a loose pile, so his task is to make a working build from the space available. Forge tools, Nature supplies, Crystal devices, and Moon charms become stronger when matching tags touch. Moon Cap Orla follows the route with a travelling shop, offering new gear when Rux reaches a safe stop. Clearing a stage means reopening one short section of road; defeating the Guardian at Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 restores an entire region. The final victory over the Eclipse Hoardmaster releases the stored cargo and reconnects all six workshops.": "齿轮·霍恩·鲁克斯是商队的背包管理员。他无法将所有有用的物品都松散地堆放在一起，因此他的任务是利用可用空间进行工作构建。当匹配标签接触时，锻造工具、自然用品、水晶装置和月亮护身符会变得更强。 Moon Cap Orla 沿着路线设有一家旅行商店，当 Rux 到达安全站时提供新装备。清理一个阶段意味着重新开放一小段道路；在第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 阶段击败守护者可以恢复整个区域。最终战胜日食储藏大师释放了储存的货物并重新连接了所有六个车间。",
  "Gear Horn Rux presenting an animal screw puzzle in his forest workshop": "Gear Horn Rux 在他的森林工作室中展示动物螺丝拼图",
  "Gear Horn Rux restores wooden animal signs inside the forest workshop. Select a screw, choose an empty hole, and watch unsupported plates drop away.": "Gear Horn Rux 在森林作坊内修复木制动物标志。选择一个螺钉，选择一个空孔，然后观察不受支撑的板掉落。",
  "Gear Horn Rux sketches rune wheels for a forest race cart": "Gear Horn Rux 为森林赛车绘制符文轮草图",
  "Gear Horn Rux's puzzle bench": "Gear Horn Rux 的拼图长凳",
  "Gear Jackal": "齿轮豺狼",
  "Gear Jackals gain damage as a fight continues, Magnet Beetles add damage for isolated items, and Rustwing Crows corrode Defense after each enemy turn. The Hollow Colossus alternates a braced phase that reduces Rux&#39;s strike with a rage phase that strengthens its own counterattack.": "装备豺狼会随着战斗的继续而受到伤害，磁力甲虫会为孤立的物品增加伤害，而锈翼乌鸦会在每个敌人回合后腐蚀防御。空心巨像会交替使用减少鲁克斯攻击的支撑阶段和加强自身反击的狂暴阶段。",
  "Gear Jackals gain power every counterattack.": "装备豺狼每次反击都会获得力量。",
  "Gear upgrades": "装备升级",
  "Gear Upgrades": "装备升级",
  "Gear, Album, and Optional Tools": "装备、相册和可选工具",
  "Gearpack 11 x 7": "齿轮组 11 x 7",
  "Gearwood Adventure": "吉尔伍德冒险",
  "Gearwood Trail": "吉尔伍德步道",
  "Gearwood's caravan road once linked six workshops. The route failed when its vaults reacted to the cargo: roots blocked the forest, crystals split the quarry, machines restarted in Clockwork Hollow, the foundry overheated, storm coils charged the observatory, and the Eclipse Vault sealed every recovered shipment behind a final mechanical army.": "吉尔伍德的商队路曾经连接着六个作坊。当它的金库对货物做出反应时，这条路线就失败了：树根堵塞了森林，水晶分裂了采石场，发条谷的机器重新启动，铸造厂过热，风暴线圈冲向天文台，日食金库将所有回收的货物密封在最后的机械军队后面。",
  "Gearwood&#39;s caravan road once carried tools, medicine, crystal lenses, and clockwork parts between six workshops. The route failed when its storage vaults began reacting to the materials inside them. Roots grew across the first trail, moon crystals split the quarry, abandoned machines restarted in Clockwork Hollow, and heat escaped from the Ember Foundry. Storm coils then charged the observatory above the clouds, while the Eclipse Vault sealed the collected cargo behind a final mechanical army.": "吉尔伍德的商队道路曾经在六个作坊之间运送工具、药品、水晶镜片和发条零件。当其存储库开始对其内部的材料产生反应时，这条路线就失败了。树根在第一条小道上生长，月晶分裂了采石场，发条谷废弃的机器重新启动，余烬铸造厂散发出热量。随后，风暴线圈冲向云层上方的天文台，而日食穹顶则将收集到的货物密封在最后一支机械军队后面。",
