  "Goal reached! Use remaining moves for a higher score.": "目标达到了！使用剩余的动作以获得更高的分数。",
  "Goal: {n} moves": "目标：{n}步",
  "Goal: {name}": "目标：{name}",
  "Goal: collect golden keys before 3:00. Crystals give XP, and upgrades help the ranger survive longer.": "目标：3:00之前收集金钥匙。水晶提供经验值，升级可以帮助游侠生存更长时间。",
  "Goal: collect golden keys before 3:00. Grab crystals to level up, then choose upgrades when the cards appear.": "目标：3:00之前收集金钥匙。抓住水晶来升级，然后在卡片出现时选择升级。",
