  "Goals use score, animal tier, merge count, combo, or a dual tier-plus-score checkpoint.": "目标使用分数、动物等级、合并计数、组合或双层加分数检查点。",
  "Goals, arena layouts, pickups, hazards, and rival behavior change together across the thirty authored races.": "在 30 场编写的比赛中，目标、竞技场布局、接球、危险和对手行为都会发生变化。",
  "Goals, Scoring, and Board Rules": "目标、计分和董事会规则",
  "Gold": "黄金",
  "Gold belongs only to the current expedition and is earned from encounters or selling equipment. Diamonds are a shared optional currency. At one shop stop, three Diamonds can replace Orla&#39;s three offered items after a separate confirmation; the refresh is never required to continue or defeat a Guardian. Workshop XP, discovered item entries, completed stages, and the next unlocked stage are saved locally.": "金币只属于当前的探险，可以通过遭遇或出售装备来获得。钻石是一种共享的可选货币。在一个商店，经过单独确认后，三颗钻石可以代替 Orla 提供的三件商品；继续或击败守护者不需要刷新。创意工坊 XP、发现的物品条目、已完成的阶段和下一个解锁的阶段都保存在本地。",
  "Gold Coins Earned +35%": "赚取金币+35%",
  "Gold Earned": "获得金币",
  "Golden Defender Frame": "金色后卫框",
  "Golden key nearby: move through it to raise your score.": "附近的金钥匙：通过它来提高你的分数。",
  "Golden Keys Collected": "收集金钥匙",
  "Golden keys satisfy the current stage objective and add to lifetime Patrol Rank. Calmed enemies drop temporary XP crystals; each level pauses play and offers three choices from damage, range, speed, max HP, attack interval, and pickup radius.": "金钥匙满足当前阶段的目标并增加终身巡逻等级。平静的敌人会掉落临时经验水晶；每个级别都会暂停游戏，并提供三种选择：伤害、范围、速度、最大生命值、攻击间隔和拾取半径。",
  "Golden keys serve two purposes. The current-stage count is the clear objective, while lifetime keys fill the Patrol Rank record on Main. XP crystals are temporary and belong only to the current attempt. They raise the current level and open upgrade choices; they are not a currency and cannot be saved for another stage. Health also resets at the beginning of each patrol.": "金钥匙有两个用途。当前阶段的计数是明确的目标，而终身钥匙则填补了主线上的巡逻排名记录。 XP水晶是暂时的，只属于当前的尝试。他们提高当前等级并开放升级选择；它们不是货币，不能保存到另一个阶段。每次巡逻开始时，生命值也会重置。",
