  "Good effort! Try again to protect the wall a little longer.": "好努力！再次尝试将墙壁保护得更久一点。",
  "Good effort. Recruit animals and upgrade the gate to grow faster.": "很好的努力。招募动物并升级大门以更快地成长。",
  "Good effort. Short practice helps reaction and focus.": "很好的努力。简短的练习有助于反应和集中注意力。",
  "Good effort. Try a different route shape or upgrade key blockers earlier.": "很好的努力。尝试不同的路线形状或尽早升级关键拦截器。",
  "Good effort. Try placing guards earlier to improve your next run.": "很好的努力。尝试更早地放置后卫以改善您的下一次跑步。",
  "Good focus practice: your next goal is to collect more crystals early so upgrades arrive sooner.": "良好的专注练习：您的下一个目标是尽早收集更多水晶，以便升级更快到达。",
  "Good helper!": "好帮手！",
  "Good practice: try guarding before enemy turns and focus one beast at a time.": "好的做法：尝试在敌人转向之前进行防守，并一次集中一只野兽。",
  "Good. Keep sliding gently and stay in SAFE until the fish is landed.": "很好。继续轻轻滑动并保持安全状态，直到鱼上岸。",
