  "Gravity Forge": "重力锻造",
  "Gravity pulls the fruit down while the active wind changes its horizontal speed. When the fruit touches the leaf, the contact point determines the new route. A centered hit produces a straighter upward arc. A hit near the left or right edge adds more sideways force. The leaf can be moved again before the fruit returns, allowing a second correction instead of locking the player into the first aim.": "重力将水果向下拉，而活跃的风改变其水平速度。当果实接触叶子时，接触点决定新的路线。居中击打会产生更直的向上弧线。靠近左边缘或右边缘的击打会增加更多的侧向力。在水果返回之前，叶子可以再次移动，从而允许进行第二次修正，而不是将玩家锁定在第一个目标中。",
  "Gravity Well": "重力井",
