  "Guardian phases: each regional Boss changes at 70 and 35 percent HP. Moss calls more rushers. Echo releases larger radial barrages. Crystal restores a hit-count ward. Mire heals and summons slowing beasts. Moon combines orbit movement with silence volleys. Crown adds wards, barrages, summons and recovery. The final mission therefore tests reading several effects, not only surviving a longer health bar.": "守护者阶段：每个地区Boss的生命值分别为70%和35%。莫斯召唤更多冲锋者。回声会释放更大的径向弹幕。水晶恢复命中计数守卫。泥沼可以治愈并召唤减速的野兽。月球将轨道运动与静默齐射结合起来。皇冠增加了守卫、弹幕、召唤和恢复。因此，最终任务测试读取多种效果，而不仅仅是在更长的生命条中生存。",
  "Guardian regrew": "守护者重生",
  "Guardian Rift": "守护者裂谷",
  "Guardian Route": "守护者路线",
  "Guardian route cleared": "守护者路线已清除",
  "Guardian Scale": "守护者秤",
  "Guardian sequences repeat a deliberate safe-lane rhythm. Use the first two gates to identify the pattern.": "守护者序列重复着刻意的安全车道节奏。使用前两个门来识别模式。",
  "Guardian squad": "守护小队",
  "Guardiano Corno di Tempesta": "暴风雨的守护者科尔诺",
  "Guardiano della Palude": "瓜亚诺·德拉·帕鲁德",
  "Guardias Abisales": "瓜迪亚斯·阿比萨莱斯",
  "Guardie: armatura fragile.": "守卫：电枢脆弱。",
  "Guarida del Lobo": "瓜里达·德尔·洛博",
  "Guia do jogo": "东望洋",
  "Guida al gioco": "吉达·阿尔吉奥科",
  "Guida di gioco": "吉达迪吉奥科",
  "Guida Fia fuori dalla zona sicura, chiudi gli anelli prima che le ombre spezzino la scia e ripristina 30 missioni dalle regole variabili.": "Guida Fia fuori dalla zona sicura，chiudi gli anelli prima che le ombre spezzino la scia 和 ripristina 30 任务 dalle regole variabili。",
  "Guida Fia in 30 gare, raccogli tessere ciano e costruisci un ponte prima di tre rivali.": "Guida Fia 位于 30 号车站，在 ponte prima di tre matchi 上进行了 raccogli tessere cano 和 costruisci。",
  "Guida il flusso di Fia attraverso i moltiplicatori, amplia il battaglione e distruggi 30 fortezze.": "Guida il flusso di Fia attraverso i moltiplicatori, amplia il battaglione e distruggi 30 fortezze。",
  "Guida l'anello lunare di Orla in trenta zone, recupera piccoli detriti per crescere, salva i nuclei e supera i rivali.": "Guida l'anello nure di Orla 在特伦塔区，recupera piccoli detriti per crescere，salva i nuclei e supera i leaguei。",
  "Guida originale WeightPlay": "原创指南WeightPlay",
  "GUIDA PUBBLICA": "公共指南",
  "Guide": "指南",
  "Guide {n} carts out": "引导{n}推车出站",
  "Guide a leftward breeze": "引导向左的微风",
  "Guide a rightward breeze": "引导向右的微风",
  "Guide animal friends safely home across each trail.": "引导动物朋友穿过每条小路安全回家。",
  "Guide animals home.": "引导动物回家。",
  "Guide animals through 30 routes with fruit, mud, keys, gates, fragile paths, and six Rescue Checkpoints.": "使用水果、泥土、钥匙、大门、脆弱的小路和六个救援检查站引导动物穿过 30 条路线。",
  "Guide animals through 30 saved route puzzles with fruit goals, mud, keys, gates, fragile paths, and six Rescue Checkpoints.": "引导动物穿过 30 个已保存的路线谜题，包括水果目标、泥土、钥匙、大门、脆弱的路径和六个救援检查站。",
  "Guide de jeu original WeightPlay": "原创游戏指南WeightPlay",
  "Guide du jeu": "游戏指南",
  "Guide every cart out · safety {safety}/3": "引导每辆车出站·安全{safety}/3",
  "Guide every cart out before using all three safety checks.": "在使用所有三项安全检查之前，引导每辆推车离开。",
  "Guide Fia across the cloud arena, collect cyan aurora tiles, and spend the stack to finish a bridge before three rivals.": "引导 Fia 穿过云竞技场，收集青色极光砖，并使用堆栈在三个对手之前完成一座桥梁。",
  "Guide Fia beyond safe land, close glowing loops before shadows cut the trail, and restore 30 rule-changing sanctuary missions.": "引导 Fia 走出安全地带，在阴影切断路径之前闭合发光环，并恢复 30 个改变规则的庇护所任务。",
  "Guide Fia through 30 cloud races, collect cyan aurora tiles, stack them, and build a bridge before three animal rivals.": "引导 Fia 完成 30 场云端竞赛，收集青色极光瓷砖，将其堆叠起来，并在三个动物对手面前搭建一座桥梁。",
  "Guide Fia through the opening": "引导 Fia 通过开口",
  "Guide fruit through 30 physics rescues with moving baskets, layered winds, double bounces, and Panko checkpoints.": "通过移动篮子、分层风、双重弹跳和 Panko 检查站，引导水果完成 30 种物理救援。",
  "Guide Leo through three forest trials and choose a blessing after every room.": "引导狮子座完成三个森林考验，并在每个房间后选择一个祝福。",
  "Guide Orla's lunar recovery ring through thirty astral zones, collect small debris to grow, rescue cores, outpace rivals, and reclaim crown wreckage.": "引导奥拉的月球回收环穿过三十个星界区，收集小碎片进行生长，拯救核心，超越对手，并回收皇冠残骸。",
  "Guide Orla's lunar ring across the astral foundry. Recover small debris first, grow, then reclaim the crown wreckage.": "引导奥拉的月环穿过星体铸造厂。首先回收小碎片，生长，然后回收树冠残骸。",
  "Guide Panko's spectrum spirit upward by pulsing only when the nearest scan marker matches the required color and emblem.": "仅当最近的扫描标记与所需的颜色和标志相匹配时，才通过脉冲引导 Panko 的光谱精神向上。",
  "GUIDE PUBLIC": "公众指南",
  "Guide Spark Paw Fia through moonlit patrol routes, recover lost relics, and decide whether to risk optional treasure before extraction.": "引导 Spark Paw Fia 穿过月光下的巡逻路线，找回丢失的文物，并在撤离前决定是否冒险选择宝藏。",
  "Guide Taro and the Star Core to the sanctuary without mixing dangerous materials.": "在不混合危险物质的情况下，引导太郎和星核前往庇护所。",
  "Guide the lunar ring": "引导月球环",
  "Guide the Ranger through golden keys. A stage requires its displayed key total; a Boss checkpoint also requires the guardian to be calmed.": "引导游侠使用金钥匙。一个阶段需要其显示的关键总数； Boss 检查站也需要守护者保持冷静。",
  "Guide twelve animal friends through 30 saved, no-timer route puzzles. Six regions add required fruit, weighted mud, trail keys, locked gates, fragile one-use paths, and Rescue Checkpoints.": "引导 12 名动物朋友完成 30 个已保存的无计时器路线谜题。六个区域添加了所需的水果、加重的泥浆、小道钥匙、上锁的大门、脆弱的一次性路径和救援检查站。",
  "Guidez Fia dans 30 courses, ramassez les dalles cyan et construisez un pont avant trois rivaux.": "Guidez Fia dans 30 个课程，在青色的 ramassez les dalles 和 construisez un pont avant trois rivaux 上。",
  "Gusty Tunnels": "阵风隧道",
  "Gut gemacht! Spiele noch einmal, um dir die Tiermerkmale besser zu merken.": "肠道宝石！ Spiele noch einmal，um dir die Tiermerkmale besser zu merken。",
