  "Habitat album": "栖息地相册",
  "Habitat Album {unlocked}/4": "栖息地相册{unlocked}/4",
  "Habitat Album complete · Keep merging toward the Lion King!": "栖息地专辑完成 · 继续向狮子王融合！",
  "Habitat arrangement goals count real animal movement in the meadow rather than a simple button press.": "栖息地安排目标计算的是草地上真实的动物运动，而不是简单的按钮按下。",
  "Habitat arrangement:": "栖息地安排：",
  "Habitat Bonus": "栖息地奖励",
  "Habitat chapters use a softened mystery image, while Feature Detective and expert stages use silhouettes so the written facts and outline matter.": "栖息地章节使用柔和的神秘图像，而特征侦探和专家阶段使用剪影，因此书面事实和大纲很重要。",
  "Habitat Checkpoint": "栖息地检查站",
  "Habitat cleared": "栖息地清理",
  "Habitat Clue": "栖息地线索",
  "Habitat Finale": "栖息地结局",
  "Habitat Homes": "居住家园",
  "Habitat locked": "栖息地锁定",
  "Habitat Missions": "栖息地任务",
  "Habitat Repair Report": "栖息地修复报告",
  "Habitat Restored!": "栖息地恢复！",
  "Habitat stages": "栖息地阶段",
  "Habitat stages use a mystery image, while Feature Detective and expert stages use silhouettes so facts and outlines matter.": "栖息地阶段使用神秘图像，而特征侦探和专家阶段使用剪影，因此事实和轮廓很重要。",
  "Habitat Visitors": "栖息地访客",
  "Habitat Visitors and Moving Patrol:": "栖息地访客和移动巡逻：",
  "Habitat Visitors are real animal pictures that are not printed on the six-item list. Tapping one counts as an empty choice and dismisses it, teaching list comparison without blocking completion. Moving Patrol gives targets a slow, small drift; reduced-motion settings stop that movement.": "栖息地访客是未印在六项清单上的真实动物图片。点击其中一个将被视为空选择并将其忽略，从而在不阻止完成的情况下进行列表比较。移动巡逻使目标缓慢、小幅漂移；减少运动设置会停止该运动。",
  "Habitats": "栖息地",
  "Habitats 1-5, Sunny Grassland: six freely selectable animals teach scene scanning and finish with the first Habitat Checkpoint.": "栖息地 1-5，阳光草原：六只可自由选择的动物教授场景扫描，并以第一个栖息地检查点结束。",
  "Habitats 11-15, Sunset Trees: Animal Pairs repeat three species at separate positions; Checkpoint 15 also asks for a fixed order.": "栖息地 11-15，日落树：动物对在不同的位置重复三个物种；检查点 15 还要求固定顺序。",
  "Habitats 16-20, Pond Watch: deeper foreground camouflage rewards slower edge-to-center scanning; later stages combine order and pairs.": "栖息地 16-20，池塘观察：更深的前景伪装奖励较慢的边缘到中心扫描；后期阶段结合了顺序和对。",
  "Habitats 21-25, Jungle Edge: harmless off-list visitors require comparison with the six printed chips. The checkpoint adds order and camouflage.": "栖息地 21-25，丛林边缘：无害的名单外访客需要与六个印刷芯片进行比较。检查站增加了秩序和伪装。",
  "Habitats 26-30, Lookout Hill: gentle target movement changes where the eye must return. The final checkpoint combines moving paired targets, Ranger Order, Deep Camouflage, and three habitat visitors.": "栖息地 26-30，Lookout Hill：温和的目标移动变化，眼睛必须返回。最后一个检查点结合了移动的配对目标、游骑兵团、深度伪装和三个栖息地访客。",
  "Habitats 6-10, River Crossing: Ranger Order changes priority from any visible animal to the next highlighted picture.": "栖息地 6-10，渡河：护林员命令将优先级从任何可见动物更改为下一个突出显示的图片。",
  "Hace demasiado calor.": "哈斯德马西亚多热量。",
