  "Hit a cloud to clear its row": "击中云以清除其行",
  "Hit Mirecoil Serpent with two different heroes during the same turn to stop regeneration.": "在同一回合中用两个不同的英雄击中米尔卷蛇以停止再生。",
  "Hit Mirecoil Serpent with two heroes in one turn; one large Skill does not stop regeneration.": "一回合用两名英雄击中米尔卷蛇；一大技能不会停止再生。",
  "Hit near the middle of the leaf for height. Use the left or right edge only when the basket is far across the clearing.": "击中叶子中部附近以获得高度。仅当篮子远离空地时才使用左边缘或右边缘。",
  "Hit the Serpent with two heroes each turn to stop regeneration.": "每回合用两名英雄击中蛇以停止再生。",
