  "Hold and drag across the archive, then release to move Fia.": "按住并拖动存档，然后松开以移动 Fia。",
  "Hold and drag in the archive to preview a route. Release to move Fia, or use WASD and arrow keys for shorter desktop steps.": "按住并拖动存档以预览路线。松开即可移动 Fia，或使用 WASD 和箭头键缩短桌面步骤。",
  "Hold and drag through the scene to preview Fia's route, then release to move.": "按住并拖动场景以预览 Fia 的路线，然后松开即可移动。",
  "Hold from start to portal and stay inside the wide trail.": "从起点一直坚守到入口，并留在宽阔的小道内。",
  "Hold happiness at 85 while tickets wait in the box.": "当门票在盒子里等待时，将幸福保持在 85。",
  "Hold in the reef play area to charge the cast, then release to cast.": "按住礁石游乐区即可为施法者蓄力，然后松开即可施法。",
  "Hold in the reef play area to charge, then release to cast.": "按住礁石游乐区进行冲锋，然后松开进行施放。",
  "Hold in the reef to charge, release to cast.": "按住礁石即可冲锋，松开即可施放。",
  "Hold one continuous line through 30 original trails, avoid walls and moving shadows, and guide Mimi to the paw portal.": "在 30 条原始路径中保持一条连续的路线，避开墙壁和移动的阴影，并引导咪咪到达爪子入口。",
  "Hold one lane with Turtle while Lion splits the pack.": "与海龟一起守住一条车道，而狮子则分头行动。",
  "Hold or drag inside the archive to preview a dashed route. Release to move Fia to that point. On desktop, WASD and the arrow keys provide shorter bounded steps.": "在存档内按住或拖动以预览虚线路线。松开即可将 Fia 移至该点。在桌面上，WASD 和箭头键提供更短的有界步骤。",
  "Hold or drag to guide the ring · Arrow keys / WASD": "按住或拖动以引导环·箭头键/WASD",
  "Hold or drag toward a point to move continuously.": "按住或向某个点拖动可连续移动。",
  "Hold or drag toward a point, use the direction keys, or use WASD to steer. Momentum continues after input changes, so wide turns are safer near large hazards.": "按住或向某个点拖动，使用方向键或使用 WASD 进行转向。输入变化后动力会持续，因此在靠近大危险时大转弯会更安全。",
  "Hold Shift or choose Pull to spend a magnetic charge.": "按住 Shift 或选择拉动即可消耗磁力。",
  "Hold the route": "保持路线",
  "Hold the sea or Space to cast. When a fish bites, drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right arrows.": "握住大海或空间来施放。当鱼咬钩时，拖动红色旋钮，在海面上滑动，或使用向左和向右箭头。",
  "Hold the water or Space and release the cast. A strong cast reduces time spent waiting for a bite.": "握住水或空间并释放石膏。坚固的石膏可以减少等待被咬的时间。",
  "Hold the water or Space, release the cast, and wait for the named fish to bite.": "握住水或空间，释放演员，等待指定的鱼咬钩。",
  "Hold the water to cast. When a fish bites, use the red knob below.": "持水施放。当鱼咬钩时，使用下面的红色旋钮。",
  "Hold to preview a route.": "按住可预览路线。",
  "Hold, trace, and reach the paw portal without touching the walls.": "抓住、追踪并到达爪子入口而不接触墙壁。",
