  "Hunters try to hold distance while Ravens change approach angles. Eclipse Archowl slows its pursuit and fires timed volleys across open space.": "猎人试图保持距离，而乌鸦则改变接近角度。日蚀弓箭手放慢了追击速度，并在空地上进行定时齐射。",
  "Hyena Trickster": "鬣狗骗子",
  "I am a bird that waddles.": "我是一只摇摇晃晃的小鸟。",
  "I am a bird with big eyes.": "我是一只长着大眼睛的鸟。",
  "I am a huge animal in the ocean.": "我是海洋里的一只巨大的动物。",
  "I am a meat eater that hunts or shares food with my pride.": "我是一个肉食者，以我的骄傲狩猎或分享食物。",
  "I am big, furry, and strong.": "我很大，毛茸茸的，而且很强壮。",
  "I am black and white and love bamboo.": "我是黑白的，喜欢竹子。",
  "I am built to eat animal protein and need a meat-based diet.": "我生来就吃动物蛋白，需要以肉类为主的饮食。",
  "I bark and wag my tail.": "我一边吠一边摇尾巴。",
  "I can eat a varied balanced diet prepared for dogs.": "我可以吃为狗准备的多样化均衡饮食。",
  "I can live in forests, grasslands, deserts, and even cities.": "我可以生活在森林、草原、沙漠，甚至城市。",
  "I carry a shell on my back.": "我的背上背着一个贝壳。",
  "I catch fish, krill, and squid in the water.": "我在水中抓鱼、磷虾和鱿鱼。",
  "I catch insects and other small animals with a quick tongue.": "我用敏捷的舌头捕捉昆虫和其他小动物。",
  "I clean my fur with my rough tongue.": "我用粗糙的舌头清理我的皮毛。",
  "I climb and swing.": "我攀爬、荡秋千。",
  "I climb slowly and sleep for much of the day.": "我慢慢地爬，一天的大部分时间都在睡觉。",
  "I eat grasses, leaves, and other plants.": "我吃草、树叶和其他植物。",
  "I eat grasses, leaves, bark, fruit, and roots.": "我吃草、树叶、树皮、水果和树根。",
  "I eat selected eucalyptus leaves.": "我吃精选的桉树叶。",
  "I eat small animals, insects, fruit, and other available food.": "我吃小动物、昆虫、水果和其他可用的食物。",
  "I fly quietly and hunt after sunset.": "我静静地飞翔，在日落后狩猎。",
  "I fuochi fatui lunari attraversano rapidamente le sale in rovina.": "我在罗维纳进行了销售。",
  "I graze on plants and chew cud to digest tough grass.": "我吃植物并反刍以消化坚韧的草。",
  "I have a big mane.": "我有一个大鬃毛。",
  "I have a long trunk.": "我有一个长长的树干。",
  "I have a very long neck.": "我有一个很长的脖子。",
  "I have black and white stripes.": "我有黑白条纹。",
  "I have long ears and hop.": "我有长耳朵，会跳。",
  "I have orange fur and a fluffy tail.": "我有橙色的皮毛和毛茸茸的尾巴。",
  "I hold bamboo with my front paws while I eat.": "我吃饭时用前爪抓着竹子。",
  "I huddle close to other penguins to stay warm.": "我和其他企鹅挤在一起取暖。",
  "I hug trees and have round ears.": "我拥抱树木，耳朵圆圆的。",
  "I hunt small animals and swallow many bites whole.": "我捕猎小动物并吞下很多口。",
  "I jump and say ribbit.": "我跳起来说“兔子”。",
  "I leap and catch insects with my long tongue.": "我跳跃并用长舌头捕捉昆虫。",
  "I leave the water to graze mainly on grass.": "我把水留在水里，主要吃草。",
  "I listen for small animals before making a quick pounce.": "在快速突袭之前，我会倾听小动物的声音。",
  "I live along cool southern coasts and islands.": "我住在凉爽的南部海岸和岛屿。",
  "I live in African grasslands and open woodland.": "我住在非洲草原和开阔的林地。",
