  "Infinite Forest begins with two random low-tier animals, has no move limit, and ends only when no legal slide or merge remains. Values continue beyond 2048, and its best score, highest tile, move count, and run count are saved separately from campaign stars and unlocks.": "无限森林以两只随机的低级动物开始，没有移动限制，只有在没有合法的滑动或合并时才结束。数值会持续到 2048 以上，并且其最佳得分、最高分块、移动计数和运行计数与战役星星和解锁项分开保存。",
