  "Is there a timer?": "有计时器吗？",
  "It applies a repeating sideways force to moving balls inside the physics box, and its direction changes over time.": "它对物理盒内移动的球施加重复的侧向力，并且其方向随时间而变化。",
  "It applies alternating sideways force to moving balls inside the box.": "它对盒子内移动的球施加交替的侧向力。",
  "It becomes available only when no legal matching pair remains.": "仅当不存在合法匹配对时才可用。",
  "It becomes movable after enough upper plates have been released.": "当足够多的上板被释放后，它就可以移动了。",
  "It can practice animal recognition, focus, hand-eye coordination, and simple care ideas such as food, water, cleaning, and play.": "它可以练习动物识别、注意力、手眼协调以及食物、水、清洁和玩耍等简单的护理理念。",
  "It cools Emberlight into harmless steam.": "它将余烬之光冷却成无害的蒸汽。",
  "It crosses active traffic and will raise congestion while both flights occupy the conflict.": "当两个航班都占据冲突时，它会穿过活跃的交通并会加剧拥堵。",
  "It did not match your color or your current capacity was full.": "它与您的颜色不匹配或您当前的容量已满。",
  "It doubles that rune ability after all three reels stop.": "三个卷轴全部停止后，符文能力会加倍。",
  "It ends when none of the remaining pieces can fit.": "当剩余的碎片都无法容纳时，它就结束了。",
  "It has no move limit. The run ends only when the board has no legal move, then saves your best score and highest animal.": "它没有移动限制。仅当棋盘没有合法移动时，运行才会结束，然后保存您的最好成绩和最高动物。",
  "It highlights the next cell in one possible complete route.": "它突出显示一条可能的完整路线中的下一个单元格。",
  "It is a visible animal not printed on the current list. It can be dismissed but does not count as a find.": "它是一种可见的动物，未列在当前列表中。它可以被驳回，但不算作发现。",
  "It is an automatic match created after cleared snacks fall and the board refills. Consecutive cascades increase the score multiplier.": "这是在清理完的零食掉落并且棋盘重新填满后创建的自动匹配。连续级联会增加分数乘数。",
  "It is an automatic match made after cleared snacks fall and the board refills.": "这是清理完的零食落下并重新填满棋盘后自动进行的匹配。",
  "It is full, sealed, or its top color does not match.": "它已满、密封，或其顶部颜色不匹配。",
  "It is raining.": "正在下雨。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing browser site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它存储在该浏览器中。清除浏览器站点数据或切换设备可能会删除或分离保存。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它存储在该浏览器中。清除站点数据或切换设备可能会删除或分离保存。",
  "It is too cold.": "天气太冷了。",
  "It is too dark.": "天太黑了。",
  "It is too hot.": "天气太热了。",
  "It occupies the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched; it should not jump to a distant hidden cell.": "它占据物理接触的气泡周围最近的打开位置；它不应该跳到远处的隐藏单元格。",
  "It pulls for longer. Stay patient near the middle.": "它拉的时间更长。在中间附近保持耐心。",
  "It raises attack for the current defense, and later formations are balanced around that increase.": "它提高了当前防御的攻击力，随后的阵型围绕该增加进行平衡。",
  "It rearranges the remaining values without changing the pairing rule.": "它重新排列剩余的值而不改变配对规则。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once, but it never removes an already placed guard.": "它会移除 12 个未消耗的太阳一次，但它永远不会移除已经放置的守卫。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once. Existing guards are not removed, so spending on a needed defense early is a valid response.": "一次可消除 12 个未消耗的阳光。现有的防护措施不会被撤除，因此尽早在所需的防御上投入资金是一个有效的应对措施。",
  "It requires both a named snack quantity and a score target.": "它需要指定的零食数量和分数目标。",
  "It restores screw positions, fallen plates, and the move count before the last move.": "它可以恢复螺钉位置、掉落的板以及上次移动之前的移动计数。",
  "It restores the board, goals, score, tray, and move state before the last placement.": "它恢复上次放置之前的棋盘、目标、得分、托盘和移动状态。",
  "It restores the complete state before your last placement.": "它会恢复上次放置之前的完整状态。",
  "It restores the previous board, score, move count, objective progress, and deterministic spawn state.": "它恢复之前的棋盘、得分、移动计数、目标进度和确定性生成状态。",
  "It reveals the exact left and right outcomes for the current zone; ordinary cards otherwise show estimates and environmental clues.": "它揭示了当前区域的准确左、右结果；普通卡片还显示估计和环境线索。",
  "It starts the next word with its first tile.": "它从第一个图块开始下一个单词。",
  "It uses the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched.": "它使用物理接触的气泡周围最近的打开位置。",
  "It uses timing pressure, gear choices, collection progress, and optional Diamond spending, so it is deeper than younger-child games.": "它使用计时压力、装备选择、收集进度和可选的钻石消费，因此它比低龄儿童游戏更有深度。",
  "Italiano": "意大利人",
  "Item rotated.": "项目旋转。",
  "Items": "项目",
  "Its bright barrier reduces damage while closed. Attack strongly after it opens.": "其明亮的屏障可减少关闭时的损坏。打开后强力攻击。",
  "Its bright shell barrier reduces damage while closed. Keep the lane blocked and attack strongly when the barrier disappears.": "其明亮的外壳屏障可减少关闭时的损坏。保持车道被封锁，当障碍物消失时强力攻击。",
  "Its coral guard opens and closes every two seconds.": "它的珊瑚防护装置每两秒打开和关闭一次。",
  "Its defense state is active. Trigger the visible counter window after a missed charge, slam, root smash, landing, or wall impact.": "它的防御状态是活跃的。在错过冲锋、猛击、根部粉碎、着陆或墙壁撞击后触发可见的计数器窗口。",
  "Its gills flare CYAN — counter with a PULSE!": "它的鳃呈青色——与脉冲相反！",
  "Its hit disables that hero's next Skill.": "它的命中会禁用该英雄的下一个技能。",
