  "Keep {n} tickets in the box": "将 {n} 门票放在盒子里",
  "Keep a chain of clean descents to charge Comet Break, then continue to the rescue gate.": "保持一连串干净的下降来冲锋彗星断裂，然后继续前往救援门。",
  "Keep a corner stable and protect empty spaces.": "保持角落稳定并保护空闲空间。",
  "Keep a second damage zone near the core.": "在核心附近保留第二个伤害区。",
  "Keep a spare blocker for the lane marked by the rush warning.": "在有紧急警告标记的车道上保留一个备用阻挡器。",
  "Keep an escape cell open while charges divide the squad.": "当冲锋将小队分开时，保持逃生室开放。",
  "Keep at least one buffer hole available for the next layer.": "至少为下一层保留一个可用的缓冲孔。",
  "Keep at least one empty vessel available as working space.": "至少保留一个空容器作为工作空间。",
  "Keep at least one path open, or blocked enemies will attack the nearest defender until the route reopens.": "至少保持一条路径畅通，否则被阻挡的敌人将攻击最近的防御者，直到路线重新打开。",
  "Keep baking": "继续烘烤",
  "Keep bonus treasure after one capture in the next mission. Tap again to confirm: {before} → {after} Diamonds.": "在下一个任务中捕获一次后保留奖励宝藏。再次点击确认：{before}→{after}钻石。",
  "Keep both edges active instead of emptying only one side.": "保持两侧边缘处于活动状态，而不是仅清空一侧。",
  "Keep both sides of the board moving. Emptying one side too early can leave the opposite edge with fewer useful matches.": "保持板的两侧移动。过早清空一侧可能会导致相对边缘的有用匹配减少。",
  "Keep Cloudline Skyport moving.": "让 Cloudline Skyport 继续前进。",
  "Keep coloring": "继续着色",
  "Keep core HP above zero through Wave 3. Victory saves the next route and Star Stones; failure still saves the earned Star Stones and leaves the best unlocked route intact.": "通过第 3 波将核心生命值保持在零以上。胜利可节省下一条路线和星石；失败仍然可以保存获得的星石，并完好无损地保留最佳的解锁路线。",
  "Keep current gear": "保持当前档位",
  "Keep Current Gear": "保持当前装备",
  "Keep diving": "继续潜水",
  "Keep dragging or using ← → under the fruit and bounce it toward the glowing basket.": "继续在水果下方拖动或使用 ← → 并将其弹向发光的篮子。",
  "Keep empty spaces available so the board can continue moving.": "保留可用的空白空间，以便板可以继续移动。",
  "Keep evolving · Best {best}": "不断进化·最好{best}",
  "Keep Exploring": "不断探索",
  "Keep exploring! Focus on picking up keys and keeping your health up.": "继续探索！专注于拿起钥匙并保持健康。",
  "Keep Fishing": "继续钓鱼",
  "Keep going—each cell may be used only once.": "继续——每个单元只能使用一次。",
  "Keep going—fill every garden tile.": "继续前进——填满每一块花园瓷砖。",
  "Keep growing your park": "继续发展你的公园",
  "Keep helping": "继续提供帮助",
  "Keep helping!": "继续帮忙！",
  "Keep holding and stay inside the trail.": "继续握住并留在路线内。",
  "Keep holding while tracing inside the turquoise corridor.": "在绿松石色走廊内追踪时继续按住。",
  "Keep large animals low and near the center while preserving an open lane for unmatched small balls.": "将大型动物保持在较低位置并靠近中心，同时为无与伦比的小球保留开放的通道。",
  "Keep matching small animals on the same side, but preserve one open lane for pieces that do not fit the current chain.": "继续在同一侧匹配小动物，但为不适合当前链条的棋子保留一条开放通道。",
  "Keep moving the leaf while the fruit falls and bounce it toward the basket.": "当水果掉落时继续移动叶子并将其弹向篮子。",
  "Keep one continuous hold.": "保持一次连续保持。",
  "Keep one dock and one approach lane available for urgent arrivals.": "保留 1 个码头和 1 条引道以供紧急抵达。",
  "Keep one flexible empty vessel until the middle of the solution.": "保留一个灵活的空容器直到溶液的中间。",
  "Keep Orla behind the last bend.": "让 Orla 留在最后一个弯道后面。",
  "Keep playing": "继续玩",
  "Keep Playing": "继续玩",
  "Keep ranged coverage near the crystal during Bat Crossing and later flying stages because bats bypass ground blockers. Slow boars before their armor breaks on storm stages so their wounded speed surge is less dangerous.": "在蝙蝠穿越和后来的飞行阶段，在水晶附近保持远程覆盖，因为蝙蝠会绕过地面阻挡物。在风暴阶段，在野猪的盔甲破裂之前减缓它们的速度，这样它们受伤的速度激增就不那么危险了。",
  "Keep ranged damage near the core.": "将远程伤害保持在核心附近。",
  "Keep reading": "继续阅读",
  "Keep running": "继续奔跑",
  "Keep serving as the queue grows and use earned coins for cafe upgrades.": "随着队列的增长继续服务，并使用赚取的硬币来升级咖啡馆。",
  "Keep several differently shaped open areas instead of one narrow gap.": "保留几个不同形状的开放区域，而不是一个狭窄的间隙。",
  "Keep sorting": "继续排序",
  "Keep steering while the fruit falls and use the leaf contact point to change its direction.": "当水果掉落时保持转向，并使用叶子接触点来改变其方向。",
  "Keep steering while the fruit moves. Use the center of the leaf for height or an edge to add sideways distance.": "当水果移动时保持转向。使用叶子的中心作为高度，或使用边缘来增加侧向距离。",
  "Keep the animal tower under the red warning line.": "将动物塔保持在红色警戒线以下。",
  "Keep the clue meaning in mind instead of testing every visible sequence.": "记住线索的含义，而不是测试每个可见的序列。",
  "Keep the largest animal near a corner, but avoid filling both neighboring edges with unmatched low tiers.": "将最大的动物放在角落附近，但避免用无与伦比的低层填充两个相邻边缘。",
  "Keep the line continuous—do not skip ahead.": "保持线路连续——不要向前跳。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line and complete the current goal before the drop budget ends.": "将堆放在红线以下并在下降预算结束之前完成当前目标。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line while working toward the current tier, merge-count, combo, score, or dual checkpoint goal.": "保持堆在红线以下，同时努力实现当前层、合并计数、组合、得分或双检查点目标。",
  "Keep the second jump until a moving ledge, spread shot, or hazard cycle confirms the safe landing.": "保持第二次跳跃，直到移动壁架、分散射击或危险循环确认安全着陆。",
  "Keep the top row open to vent its furnace pulse.": "保持顶排打开以释放炉脉冲。",
  "Keep the wall above zero HP until every normal beast and Boss is defeated.": "保持墙的生命值高于零，直到击败所有普通野兽和 Boss。",
  "Keep the weakest hero outside the Raven's range.": "将最弱的英雄置于乌鸦的射程之外。",
  "Keep this chamber open?": "保持这个房间打开吗？",
  "Keep this descent?": "保持这个血统吗？",
  "Keep this pulse run?": "保持这个脉冲运行吗？",
