  "Large fox and bunny groups fill orders faster.": "大型狐狸和兔子群体更快地完成订单。",
  "Large groups earn bonuses across two recipes.": "大团体可以通过两种食谱获得奖金。",
  "Large objects, stable overlap shadows, visible tray order, and automatic triple motion make each consequence readable without flashing the whole board.": "大型物体、稳定的重叠阴影、可见的托盘顺序和自动三重运动使每个结果都可读，而无需闪烁整个板。",
  "Large-batch bonuses can finish an order with fewer moves, but a group-goal stage still needs the displayed largest clear at least once.": "大批量奖金可以用更少的步数完成订单，但团体目标阶段仍然需要至少一次显示的最大通关。",
