  "Last Stand": "背水一战",
  "Later chapters add a fourth route, longer convoys, more queues, repeated bus colors, and a two-space holding lane instead of repeating the same three-bus layout.": "后面的章节添加了第四条路线、更长的车队、更多的队列、重复的巴士颜色和两个空间的等待车道，而不是重复相同的三巴士布局。",
  "Later chapters add denser plazas, signal-locked carts, convoy order, and mixed four-direction traffic.": "后面的章节添加了更密集的广场、信号锁车、车队秩序和混合四向交通。",
  "Later chapters add overlapping plates, shared screws, locked screws, smaller move limits, and longer release chains.": "后面的章节添加了重叠板、共享螺钉、锁定螺钉、更小的移动限制和更长的释放链。",
  "Later chapters add rescue beacons, storm lanes, ordered seals, shrinking borders, rival claims, and Guardian hunts. Unlocks, stars, and chosen trail cosmetics are saved locally.": "后面的章节增加了救援信标、风暴通道、有序海豹、缩小边界、竞争对手的主张和守护者狩猎。解锁、星星和选择的踪迹化妆品都保存在本地。",
  "Later chapters add sliding ice rails, signal gates, linked cargo, and one-way storm belts. Each device follows a fixed, readable rule.": "后面的章节添加了滑动冰轨、信号门、相连的货物和单向风暴带。每个设备都遵循固定的、可读的规则。",
  "Later chapters add vines, crystal shells, mystery wrapping, shifting shelves, tighter trays, and combined finale piles.": "后面的章节添加了藤蔓、水晶贝壳、神秘包装、移动架子、更紧的托盘和组合的结局堆。",
  "Later chapters split orbs through combos, move crystal bands, add permanent mirrors, advance crystal walls, alter the return with gravity, and place fatal void mines. Permanent mirrors are routing tools, not targets.": "后面的章节通过组合分裂球体，移动水晶带，添加永久镜子，推进水晶墙，改变重力返回，并放置致命的虚空地雷。永久镜像是路由工具，而不是目标。",
  "Later checkpoints combine these rules. The final challenge offers a preview, then adds mist, gust movement after misses, and parade movement after matches. The board is demanding because memory must be updated, not because the player is rushed.": "后来的检查点结合了这些规则。最后的挑战提供了预览，然后添加了薄雾、未命中后的阵风运动以及比赛后的游行运动。棋盘的要求很高，因为内存必须更新，而不是因为玩家很匆忙。",
  "Later combinations require quick lane reading and objective planning. The age label is guidance, not an ability rating.": "后期的组合需要快速的车道读取和客观的规划。年龄标签是指导，而不是能力评级。",
  "Later enemies change action planning. Ember Salamander leaves a temporary burn tile when it moves. Moon Moth silences one hero's Skill for the next player turn without removing Move, Attack or Guard. Archive Owl marks a hero so the next ranged hit gains damage. Mirror Wolf creates one adjacent one-HP clone when space permits. Seal Raven drains one Energy but never below zero. These traits remain active when Mission 29 combines one threat from five earlier chapters.": "后来敌人改变了行动计划。灰烬蝾螈移动时会留下暂时燃烧的方块。月蛾会在下一个玩家回合沉默一名英雄的技能，而不移除移动、攻击或防御。档案猫头鹰标记英雄，因此下一次远程攻击会造成伤害。当空间允许时，镜狼会创建一个相邻的一生命值克隆。海豹渡鸦会消耗 1 点能量，但绝不会低于零。当第 29 任务结合了前五个章节中的一种威胁时，这些特征仍然活跃。",
  "Later food, mixed and expert stages add a fourth name after the animal library has been introduced.": "后来的食物、混合和专家阶段在引入动物库后添加了第四个名称。",
  "Later food, mixed, and expert stages add a fourth name after players have learned the animal library.": "后来的食物、混合和专家阶段在玩家学会动物库后添加了第四个名称。",
  "Later routes add signal carts that unlock red signals, gated carts that must wait, and linked convoys that leave in order. Each route saves completion, stars, and the best blocked-tap count locally.": "后来的路线增加了可以解锁红色信号的信号车、必须等待的门控车以及按顺序离开的链接车队。每条路线都会在本地保存完成情况、星级和最佳阻塞点击数。",
  "Later routes combine faster visual decisions, route objectives, and score pressure.": "后面的路线结合了更快的视觉决策、路线目标和得分压力。",
  "Later stages combine six-unit formations, specialized targeting, permanent upgrades, combat failure pressure, Boss abilities, and optional Diamond decisions. Campaign progress, the last deployed formation and slot positions, Training Gold, Team Level, unlocked animals, permanent animal levels, completed stages, and cosmetic choice are stored locally in this browser; no login is required for basic play. Clearing this site's browser storage may remove that local progress.": "后期阶段结合了六单位编队、专门瞄准、永久升级、战斗失败压力、Boss 能力和可选的钻石决策。战役进度、最后部署的编队和位置、训练金币、团队等级、解锁动物、永久动物等级、已完成的阶段和化妆品选择都存储在该浏览器本地；基本游戏无需登录。清除此站点的浏览器存储可能会删除该本地进度。",
  "Later threats alter action order. Ember Salamander leaves temporary fire. Moon Moth blocks one Skill turn without blocking Move, Attack or Guard. Archive Owl marks a hero for extra ranged damage. Mirror Wolf creates an adjacent one-HP clone. Seal Raven drains one Energy but never below zero.": "后来的威胁改变了行动顺序。灰烬蝾螈留下暂时的火焰。月蛾阻挡一技能回合，且不阻挡移动、攻击或防御。档案猫头鹰标志着英雄的额外远程伤害。镜狼创造一个相邻的一生命值克隆体。海豹渡鸦会消耗 1 点能量，但绝不会低于零。",
  "Later waterways increase structural ambiguity instead of merely hiding the pipes or demanding faster input.": "后来的水道增加了结构的模糊性，而不仅仅是隐藏管道或要求更快的输入。",
  "Later zones add aimed turrets, crossfire, current fields, shielded objects, rival collectors, storms, and multiple rescue cores. The Result appears only after every displayed objective is complete.": "后来的区域增加了瞄准炮塔、交叉火力、电流场、屏蔽物体、对手收集器、风暴和多个救援核心。仅在每个显示的目标完成后才会出现结果。",
