  "Layered-wind stages apply different force above and below the middle of the clearing. The fruit may begin toward the animal, then drift away as it descends. Reverse-wind stages switch direction after the first leaf contact.": "分层风阶段在空地中部上方和下方施加不同的力。果实可能会开始朝向动物，然后随着下降而飘走。反向缠绕阶段在第一片叶片接触后切换方向。",
