  "Leaves drop beside matches, honey needs two hits and clouds clear a row.": "树叶掉落在火柴旁，蜂蜜需要敲击两下，云朵才会散去。",
  "Leaves drop beside matches, honey needs two hits, and clouds clear their row.": "树叶落在火柴旁边，蜂蜜需要两次，云彩清除了它们的行。",
  "Leaves fall beside a match, honey needs two direct hits, clouds clear a row, wind bends flight and shifting levels move alternating rows after a shot.": "树叶落在火柴旁边，蜂蜜需要两次直接击中，云清除一排，风使飞行弯曲，水平变化在一次射击后交替移动。",
