  "Level Up: Choose Your Growth": "升级：选择你的成长",
  "Level up! Reached Level {level}.": "升级！达到级别 {level}。",
  "Level up! Stat point +{n}": "升级！统计点 +{n}",
  "Level verlassen": "水平维拉森",
  "Level-ups grant permanent stat points for Health, Attack, or Maximum Oxygen. Every allocation previews the old and new total, and all earned points must be assigned before the dive continues. These upgrades support different approaches without replacing route reading: more health helps combat, more attack shortens retaliation cycles, and more oxygen expands the margin for risky lanes.": "升级可获得生命值、攻击力或最大氧气的永久统计点。每次分配都会预览旧的和新的总数，并且必须在潜水继续之前分配所有获得的积分。这些升级支持不同的方法，而不取代路线读取：更多的健康有助于战斗，更多的攻击缩短报复周期，更多的氧气扩大危险车道的余地。",
  "Levelauswahl": "利劳斯瓦尔",
  "Levelfortschritt": "水平福特施里特",
  "Levels": "级别",
  "Levels 1-5 establish fixed-box matching with familiar fruit, vegetables, and pantry foods. Mimi closes the first route by moving the boxes once after the third correct food.": "1-5 级建立了与熟悉的水果、蔬菜和食品储藏室食物的固定盒匹配。咪咪通过在第三次正确的食物后移动盒子一次来关闭第一条路线。",
  "Levels 1–5 teach direct shots, bank shots, rescue targets, mixed colors and stones.": "1-5 级教授直接射击、倾斜射击、救援目标、混合颜色和石头。",
  "Levels 1–5: Aim School.": "1-5 级：目标学校。",
  "Levels 11-15 introduce close pairs such as red and pink or blue and cyan, plus one harmless unused box. Nori combines picture-first clues with a decoy choice.": "第 11 至 15 级介绍了紧密的配对，例如红色和粉色或蓝色和青色，以及一个无害的未使用的盒子。诺里将图片优先的线索与诱饵选择结合起来。",
  "Levels 11–15 introduce Burst, Swap, leaf, honey and cloud rules.": "第 11 至 15 级介绍了突发、交换、叶子、蜂蜜和云规则。",
  "Levels 11–15: Barrier Country.": "11-15 级：屏障国家。",
  "Levels 16-20 group foods by vegetable, fruit, breakfast, and snack themes. Pogo's buffet presents seven boxes for five foods, requiring careful elimination without extending the session.": "16-20 级按蔬菜、水果、早餐和零食主题对食物进行分组。 Pogo 的自助餐有七盒五种食物，需要仔细消除，但不能延长用餐时间。",
  "Levels 16–20 add east/west wind and alternating moving rows.": "16-20 层增加了东/西风和交替移动的行。",
  "Levels 16–20: Monsoon Paths.": "16-20 级：季风路径。",
  "Levels 21-25 revisit moving boxes and picture matching in stronger combinations. Taro mirrors the box order once halfway through the garden check.": "第 21-25 级以更强的组合重新审视移动盒子和图片匹配。太郎在花园检查进行到一半时就反映了盒子的顺序。",
  "Levels 21–25 pair each power with barriers and finish with three rescues plus all four powers.": "21-25 级将每种力量与障碍配对，并以三项救援加上所有四种力量结束。",
  "Levels 21–25: Power Trails.": "第 21-25 级：动力轨迹。",
  "Levels 26-30 use six-box rainbows, warm-and-cool alternation, two decoys, and repeated safe movement. Fia's festival combines picture-only clues, one unused box, and a shuffle after each correct answer.": "26-30 级使用六盒彩虹、冷暖交替、两个诱饵和重复的安全移动。国际汽联的节日结合了纯图片线索、一个未使用的盒子以及每个正确答案后的洗牌。",
  "Levels 26–30 combine leaf-and-stone lanes, honey headwind, moving cloud rows and three-animal rescue. Level 30 uses every major rule.": "26 至 30 层结合了树叶和石头小道、蜂蜜逆风、移动云排和三只动物救援。 30 级使用所有主要规则。",
  "Levels 26–30: Grand Reunion.": "第 26-30 级：盛大团聚。",
  "Levels 6-10 compare warm, cool, light, and dark colors. A picture-only picnic removes visible words, and Orla's check rearranges boxes after every successful match.": "6-10 级比较暖色、冷色、浅色和深色。仅限图片的野餐会删除可见的文字，奥拉的检查会在每次成功匹配后重新排列方框。",
  "Levels 6–10 expand rescue chains and introduce Rainbow and Line Clear.": "第 6 至 10 级扩大了救援链并引入了 Rainbow 和 Line Clear。",
  "Levels 6–10: Rescue Routes.": "6-10 级：救援路线。",
