  "Life Drain": "生命汲取",
  "Light and Dark": "光明与黑暗",
  "Light every trail to finish the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每条踪迹以完成星座并解锁下一阶段。",
  "Light every trail to restore the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每条踪迹以恢复星座并解锁下一阶段。",
  "Light Everything": "照亮一切",
  "Lightning Dash": "闪电冲刺",
  "Lightning Dash shortens a committed move, making it useful for crossing a patrol line. Star Decoy pauses patrol movement for a level-based duration and is strongest where several routes overlap. Smoke Leaf resets Alert and adds a brief cover window, so it can rescue a run that has already become dangerous. A confirmed three-Diamond reroll changes the three offered gadget strengths. A confirmed five-Diamond insurance policy preserves optional treasure after one capture. These are optional platform choices: neither Diamonds nor insurance unlock missions, guardian encounters, medals, or free retries.": "闪电冲刺缩短了承诺的移动时间，使其在穿越巡逻线时非常有用。星诱饵会暂停巡逻运动一段时间，并且在多条路线重叠的情况下最强。烟叶重置警报并添加一个短暂的掩护窗口，因此它可以挽救已经变得危险的逃跑。已确认的三钻重掷改变了所提供的三种装备的优势。一份已确认的五钻保险单可在一次捕获后保留可选的宝藏。这些是可选的平台选择：钻石和保险都不能解锁任务、守护者遭遇、奖章或免费重试。",
  "Lightning Hollow": "闪电空洞",
  "Lightning Signs": "闪电标志",
  "Lightning strikes the player mark, then two mirrored marks.": "闪电击中玩家标记，然后是两个镜像标记。",
  "Lince de bobina": "林斯·德·博比纳",
  "LINE ×{value}": "线×{value}",
  "Line broke. The tension marker left the safe band too long.": "线断了。张力标记离开安全带太长。",
  "Line Clear removes the entire row it hits": "行清除会删除它所命中的整行",
  "Line control: after a bite, drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right. SAFE control removes fish power. Remaining outside the band too long breaks the line, returns to casting, and leaves the mission clock running.": "线路控制：咬一口后，拖动红色旋钮，在海上滑动，或使用左、右。安全控制消除了鱼的力量。在乐队之外停留太久就会打破路线，返回选角，并让任务时钟继续运行。",
  "Line Durability": "线路耐用性",
