  "Mimi checks tickets, one tidy habitat, and a cheerful park together.": "咪咪一起查票，有一个整洁的栖息地，还有一个令人愉快的公园。",
  "Mimi Heal": "Mimi Heal",
  "Mimi intercambia las cajas una vez tras tres comidas.": "咪咪intercambia las cajas una vez tras tres comidas。",
  "Mimi is restoring color to dormant puzzle boards in a magical forest workshop. Stone cells block parts of each board, so the route must pass through every open cell exactly once.": "咪咪正在魔法森林工作室中恢复休眠拼图板的颜色。石块阻挡了每块木板的一部分，因此路线必须恰好穿过每个开放的石块一次。",
  "Mimi ordina tesori magici a gruppi di tre": "咪咪魔法魔法集",
  "Mimi sorting colorful fantasy treasures into groups of three": "咪咪将色彩缤纷的奇幻宝藏分成三组",
  "Mimi sorting magical treasures into groups of three": "咪咪将魔法宝藏分成三组",
  "Mimi swaps the boxes once after three foods.": "咪咪吃完三顿饭后就换一次盒子。",
  "Mimi troca as marmitas de lugar uma vez, depois do terceiro alimento.": "Mimi troca 作为 lugar uma vez 的 marmitas，depois do terceiro alimento。",
  "Mimi, Orla, Nori, Pogo, Taro, and Fia wait at Levels 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30. These Guardians do not fight or punish mistakes. Each introduces a friendly check: a one-time box move, repeated safe shuffles, picture-first matching, extra unused boxes, a halfway mirror, or a final combination. Finishing Fia's festival check means every route has received a correctly sorted lunchbox.": "Mimi、Orla、Nori、Pogo、Taro 和 Fia 在 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 级等待。这些守护者不会对抗或惩罚错误。每个都引入了友好的检查：一次性盒子移动、重复安全洗牌、图片优先匹配、额外未使用的盒子、半镜像或最终组合。完成国际汽联的节日检查意味着每条路线都收到了正确分类的午餐盒。",
  "Mimi, Panko, an otter inspector, a rhino keeper, and the penguin parade team visit at five-stage checkpoints. Passing a review means the park has demonstrated basic care, picnic service, viewing space, keeper support, parade capacity, or the balanced planning needed for the final festival.": "咪咪、潘科、水獭检查员、犀牛饲养员和企鹅巡游队参观了五个阶段的检查站。通过审查意味着公园已经展示了基本护理、野餐服务、观赏空间、饲养员支持、游行能力或最终节日所需的平衡规划。",
  "Mimi's color-grid workshop": "咪咪的色格工作坊",
  "Mimi's greenhouse shelves are overflowing with enchanted keepsakes. Only uncovered objects can move into the tray. Three matching objects vanish, but seven unmatched objects end the attempt.": "咪咪的温室架子上摆满了迷人的纪念品。只有未覆盖的物体才能移入托盘。三个匹配的物体消失了，但七个不匹配的物体结束了尝试。",
  "Mimi's living trail workshop": "咪咪的生活轨迹工作坊",
  "Mimi's Picnic Check": "咪咪的野餐支票",
  "Mimi's Welcome Review": "咪咪的欢迎评论",
  "Mimics copy pressure from Rux&#39;s strongest combat statistic, while Tag Sealers rotate the disabled material among Forge, Nature, Crystal, and Moon. The Eclipse Hoardmaster joins rotating seals with isolation damage, forcing the final pack to keep several useful link families without leaving loose equipment.": "模仿者复制来自拉克斯最强战斗统计数据的压力，而标签密封者则在熔炉、自然、水晶和月亮之间轮换禁用材料。 Eclipse Hoardmaster 将旋转密封件与隔离损坏结合在一起，迫使最终包装保留几个有用的连接系列，而不会留下松动的设备。",
  "Mina Fragmentada": "米娜·弗拉格门塔达",
  "Minimum-batch stages require groups of three or four before a tap can clear. Sequence stages highlight one order animal at a time; clearing a later animal reshapes the board but does not advance its counter. Bonus stages let a group of four, five, or six count extra toward the active order.": "最小批量阶段需要三到四人一组才能清除水龙头。序列阶段一次突出显示一种动物；清除后面的动物会重塑棋盘，但不会推进其计数器。奖励阶段让四人、五人或六人一组额外计入有效订单。",
  "Minuto dividido": "米努托·迪维迪多",
  "Mira ai rigeneratori.": "Mira ai rigeratori。",
  "Mira attraverso una porta lunare mobile che cambia il corridoio di rimbalzo.": "米拉·阿特拉韦索（Mira attraverso）在月亮门上移动，在走廊的走廊上移动。",
  "Mira la comida y su color.": "Mira la comida y su 颜色。",
  "Mira le sfere spirituali lungo 30 percorsi difensivi con nemici speciali, piloni a specchio mobili, sei boss unici e potenziamenti della fortezza.": "Mira le sferespiritulilungo 30 percorsi difensivi con nemici Speciali, piloni a Specchio Mobili, sei boss unici e potenziamenti della fortezza.",
  "Mira tra i piloni mobili mentre gli assalitori segnalano le corsie.": "Mira tra i piloni mobili mentre gli assalitori segnalano le corsie。",
