  "Mirror Keeper": "镜子守护者",
  "Mirror missions warn with a shimmer and then exchange the two live markers. Their new positions are real, not a decorative effect.": "镜像任务会发出闪光警告，然后交换两个实时标记。他们的新位置是真实的，而不是装饰效果。",
  "Mirror missions warn with a shimmer and then exchange the two live markers. Their new positions are real, not a visual decoy.": "镜像任务会发出闪光警告，然后交换两个实时标记。他们的新位置是真实的，而不是视觉诱饵。",
  "Mirror Pack": "镜子包",
  "Mirror pylons": "镜面塔架",
  "Mirror Pylons": "镜塔",
  "Mirror pylons: later routes place one or two solid hexagonal pylons inside the arena. Orbs physically reflect from them, creating bank paths that do not exist in the early regions. Some pylons move horizontally, so a previously safe angle may stop working during the same wave.": "镜子塔：后面的路线会在竞技场内放置一两个实心六角形塔。球体从它们身上反射出来，创造出早期区域中不存在的银行路径。一些塔架水平移动，因此先前的安全角度可能会在同一波中停止工作。",
  "Mirror Route Logic Puzzle": "镜像路径逻辑谜题",
  "Mirror Ruins": "镜之遗迹",
  "Mirror shift incoming!": "镜移来袭！",
