  "Mist Crown": "雾冠",
  "Mist Crown Monarch": "雾之冠君",
  "Mist Crown rules: temporary curses cost one Energy to remove; holding one at turn end deals damage before it cycles through discard. The triad ward blocks direct damage until Attack, Defense and Utility cards have all been used. Progress crosses turns, but the final Boss can rebuild the ward.": "迷雾王冠规则：临时诅咒需要消耗 1 点能量才能消除；在回合结束时持有一个会在其循环丢弃之前造成伤害。三合一守卫会阻挡直接伤害，直到攻击、防御和实用卡都被使用为止。进度会跨越多个回合，但最终的 Boss 可以重建守卫。",
  "Mist Curse": "迷雾诅咒",
