  "Moon": "月亮",
  "Moon Archive": "月球档案",
  "Moon Archive Keeper": "月球档案保管员",
  "Moon Archive Missions": "月球档案任务",
  "Moon Bow": "月弓",
  "Moon Cap Orla": "奥拉月帽",
  "Moon Cap Orla and Rainbow Hop Mimi have found thirty forest fountains whose colors were mixed by a storm. Every solved vessel restores one fountain. Seals, vessels of different sizes, and tighter routes represent damaged parts of the spring network that must be repaired in the correct order.": "Moon Cap Orla 和 Rainbow Hop Mimi 发现了 30 个森林喷泉，它们的颜色因暴风雨而混合。每解决一个容器就会恢复一个喷泉。密封件、不同尺寸的容器和较紧的路线代表弹簧网络的损坏部分，必须按正确的顺序进行修复。",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding a lunar recovery ring": "奥拉月帽引导月球回收环",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding an animal evolution puzzle": "奥拉月帽引导动物进化之谜",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding animal carts through a forest plaza": "Moon Cap Orla 引导动物车穿过森林广场",
  "Moon Cap Orla maintains a moonlit sanctuary where matching animal spirits combine into stronger forms. The thirty campaign missions are her field lessons: the player restores each sanctuary board by reaching a named animal tier, completing a required number of merges, or earning a target score before the move supply runs out.": "奥拉月帽维护着一个月光庇护所，在那里，相配的动物灵魂结合成更强大的形式。三十个战役任务是她的实地课程：玩家通过达到指定的动物等级、完成所需数量的合并或在移动供应耗尽之前获得目标分数来恢复每个庇护所图板。",
  "Moon Cap Orla plans each entry from the safehouse while Spark Paw Fia enters the archive. Fia is not there to attack the guards. The task is to recover misplaced moon seals, courier tokens, star maps, clockwork lenses, and district relics without escalating the lockdown. Clearing a mission restores one route on Orla&#39;s archive map. Passing the Lantern Auditor, Bell Warden, Mirror Keeper, Clockwork Marshal, Vault Sealkeeper, and Eclipse Curator proves that an entire five-mission wing is safe again. Completing Mission 30 resolves the Curator&#39;s eclipse route and ends the current campaign; the result does not pretend that a nonexistent Mission 31 is available.": "Moon Cap Orla 计划着安全屋的每一次进入，而 Spark Paw Fia 则进入档案室。菲亚并不是来攻击守卫的。任务是在不升级封锁的情况下找回丢失的月球封印、信使代币、星图、发条镜头和地区文物。完成一项任务会恢复奥拉档案地图上的一条路线。通过提灯审计员、贝尔看守者、镜子守护者、发条元帅、秘库封印者和日食馆长的考验，证明整个五任务翼再次安全。完成任务 30 可以解决馆长的日食路线并结束当前的战役；结果并不假装不存在的 Mission 31 可用。",
  "Moon Cap Orla plans each entry while Spark Paw Fia enters the archive. Fia is not fighting the guards: the job is to recover the misplaced seals, courier tokens, star maps, clockwork lenses, and district relics without escalating the lockdown. Clearing a mission restores one route to the archive map. Passing the Lantern Auditor, Bell Warden, Mirror Keeper, Clockwork Marshal, Vault Sealkeeper, and Eclipse Curator proves that an entire five-mission wing is safe. Mission 30 ends the lockdown by completing the Curator's full eclipse route; it does not invent a false Mission 31.": "Moon Cap Orla 计划每个条目，而 Spark Paw Fia 则进入档案。国际汽联并不是在与警卫作战：他们的工作是在不升级封锁的情况下找回丢失的印章、信使代币、星图、发条镜头和地区文物。清除任务会恢复通往存档地图的一条路线。通过提灯审计员、贝尔看守者、镜子守护者、发条元帅、秘库封印者和日食馆长的通过证明整个五任务翼是安全的。第 30 号任务通过完成馆长号的全食路线来结束封锁；它并没有发明虚假的Mission 31。",
  "Moon Cap Orla runs the dispatch tower while Gear Horn Rux maintains cargo, passenger, and repair docks. Bubble Fin Nori handles urgent courier and rescue flights. Together they keep the Cloudline district moving through ordinary arrivals, cargo crossings, storms, repair windows, and a final festival rush.": "Moon Cap Orla 负责运营调度塔，而 Gear Horn Rux 负责维护货运、客运和维修码头。 Bubble Fin Nori 负责处理紧急快递和救援航班。他们一起让 Cloudline 区在普通到达、货物过境、暴风雨、维修窗口和最后的节日高峰期间保持正常运转。",
  "Moon Cap Orla studies the crossing from above. Every wooden animal cart can leave only in the direction it faces, so the safest route depends on which paths are already clear.": "奥拉月帽从上方观察这次穿越。每辆木制动物车只能沿着它所面向的方向离开，所以最安全的路线取决于哪些路径已经畅通。",
  "Moon Cap Orla uses a controlled recovery ring to remove corrupted nonliving debris and uncover stranded rescue cores.": "Moon Cap Orla 使用受控回收环清除损坏的非生命碎片并发现搁浅的救援核心。",
  "Moon Cap Orla's constellation workshop": "Moon Cap Orla 的星座工作坊",
