  "Moon Shuffle stages move the same unmatched symbols after a wrong guess, so old locations must be updated rather than blindly repeated.": "Moon Shuffle 阶段在错误猜测后会移动相同的不匹配符号，因​​此必须更新旧位置而不是盲目重复。",
