  "Moon Veil Moth": "月纱蛾",
  "Moon Veil Moths suppress Moon links and Prism Rams hide behind larger barriers. Mixed materials become safer than relying on one repeated charm. The Crystal Warden adds an eighteen-point prism shield and reflects shards after its core is exposed.": "月幕蛾压制月球链接，棱镜公羊躲在更大的障碍后面。混合材料比依赖一种重复的魅力更安全。水晶守望者增加了一个十八点棱镜护盾，并在其核心暴露后反射碎片。",
  "Moon Veil Moths, Coil Lynxes, Tag Sealers, and the final Guardian can suppress or rotate a material tag. The active seal appears above the battle.": "月幕飞蛾、盘卷山猫、标签封印者和最终守护者可以抑制或旋转材料标签。主动封印出现在战斗上方。",
