  "Nori Aleta Burbuja": "诺里·阿莱塔·布尔布贾",
  "Nori diving through a bright coral abyss toward an ancient relic": "海苔潜入明亮的珊瑚深渊，奔向古老的遗迹",
  "Nori explores six layers of a bright coral abyss where old navigation relics were scattered among currents, air pockets, wrecks, and territorial sea life. The campaign begins on readable lantern shelves, then crosses resource reefs, clue-denial ruins, pressure waters, mastery trenches, and the final Heart of the Abyss. Each named route has its own relic, encounter order, fish positions, salvage target, and operating rule.": "诺里探索了六层明亮的珊瑚深渊，那里古老的航海遗迹散布在洋流、气穴、沉船和领海生物中。战役从可读的灯笼架开始，然后穿过资源礁、拒绝线索的废墟、压力水域、掌握战壕和最后的深渊之心。每条命名航线都有自己的遗迹、遭遇顺序、鱼位、打捞目标和操作规则。",
  "Nori HP": "海苔HP",
  "Nori lost the encounter. Half of the salvage was secured.": "诺里输掉了这次遭遇。一半的打捞物已得到保护。",
