  "Normal fish use steady, darting, or heavy pull identities. Steady fish reward small corrections, darting fish reverse direction in bursts, and heavy fish hold one direction longer. The current fish identity is shown in the hook instruction and Sonar readout.": "正常的鱼使用稳定、快速或重拉的身份。稳定的鱼会奖励小的修正，快速的鱼会突然改变方向，而重的鱼会在一个方向保持更长时间。当前鱼的身份显示在钩指令和声纳读数中。",
