  "Nothing may cover it and at least one horizontal side must be open; Patrol Trail also checks the A or B route shown in the objective.": "不得覆盖任何东西，且至少一侧水平面必须敞开； Patrol Trail 还会检查目标中显示的 A 或 B 路线。",
  "Nothing may cover its position, and at least one horizontal side must be open. Patrol Trail boards also limit matching to the A or B route shown in the objective.": "不得有任何物体遮挡其位置，且至少一侧水平面必须敞开。巡逻路线板还限制与目标中显示的 A 或 B 路线的匹配。",
