  "Numbered recipes:": "编号食谱：",
  "Numbered recipes: Days 6-10 require the exact visible 1-2-3 order. The right ingredients in a different order are rejected, so recipe numbers are a real rule rather than decoration.": "编号食谱：第 6-10 天需要精确可见的 1-2-3 顺序。不同顺序的正确成分会被拒绝，因此配方编号是真正的规则而不是装饰。",
