  "Numbered Stars": "编号星星",
  "Numbers remain visible as text and the selection state uses more than color, supporting keyboard, touch, and mouse play.": "数字仍然以文本形式可见，选择状态不仅仅使用颜色，还支持键盘、触摸和鼠标操作。",
