  "Oak Seed": "橡树种子",
  "Oak Seed: All units gain +1 Health in battle.": "橡树种子：所有单位在战斗中获得 +1 生命值。",
  "Obiettivo {target}": "奥别蒂沃 {target}",
  "Object secured!": "对象已锁定！",
  "Objectifs de la commande": "司令部的目标",
  "Objective": "目的",
  "Objective Incomplete": "目标不完整",
  "Objectives change success conditions: finish the route, collect a target number of stars, reach a best combo, stay under a collision limit, or reach a target score.": "目标会改变成功条件：完成路线、收集目标数量的星星、达到最佳组合、保持在碰撞限制以下或达到目标分数。",
  "Objects at or below the collector's current size threshold.": "等于或低于收集器当前大小阈值的对象。",
  "Objects small enough for the current collector glow as valid salvage. Absorbing them raises mass and score; touching an object that is still too large costs stability and breaks the chain.": "足够小的物体可以让集电器发光作为有效的回收物。吸收它们会提高质量和分数；触摸仍然太大的物体会降低稳定性并破坏链条。",
  "Objeto girado.": "奥杰托·吉拉多。",
  "Observation": "观察",
  "Observatoire {number}": "天文台{number}",
