  "Observe": "观察",
  "Observe a cor de cada alimento.": "观察 acor de cada alimento。",
  "Observe o alimento e sua cor.": "观察食物和糖。",
  "Observe which measured trait failed and adjust only that trait on the next attempt.": "观察哪个测量的特征失败，并在下次尝试时仅调整该特征。",
  "Obsidian Causeway": "黑曜石堤道",
