  "Obtenido": "奥布泰尼多",
  "Ocaso de panteras": "奥卡索·德·潘特拉斯",
  "Occupy three linked Seal cells to remove the enemy ward.": "占领三个相连的封印牢房来移除敌人的守卫。",
  "OCEAN": "海洋",
  "Ocean Cupcakes": "海洋纸杯蛋糕",
  "Ocean current": "洋流",
