  "Ordena habilidades, movimiento y defensa antes de que coincidan silencio y marcas.": "行动和防御在沉默和马卡斯的同时发生。",
  "Order cards carefully: enable Wolf Pack's combo, draw before spending the last Energy, and Block before a large attack.": "仔细排序卡片：启用狼群的连击，在消耗最后能量之前抽牌，并在大规模攻击之前格挡。",
  "Order cards carefully: enable Wolf Pack&#39;s combo, draw before spending the last Energy, and Block before a large attack.": "仔细排序卡片：启用狼群的连击，在消耗最后能量之前抽牌，并在大规模攻击之前格挡。",
