  "Ordered pairs:": "订购对：",
  "Ordered stages name the animal pair that must be cleared next. A correct pair found out of order is shown, then hidden without advancing.": "有序的阶段命名了接下来必须清除的动物对。显示顺序不正确的正确对，然后隐藏而不前进。",
