  "Orders and patience:": "命令和耐心：",
  "Orders and patience: Three guests begin each day and more may join. Order bubbles show required food; cards show patience. A guest who waits too long leaves and reduces business rating. The day pauses only when rating reaches zero.": "订单和耐心：每天开始三位客人，可能会有更多客人加入。订单气泡显示需要的食物；卡片显示耐心。等待时间过长的客人会离开并降低商务评级。仅当评级达到零时，这一天才会暂停。",
