  "Outline Cars reduce color so geometry matters. Switching Cars reorder after every correct match. Remember Passenger hides the symbol but allows a no-penalty reveal. Boarding Pass requires the passenger to be selected first.": "轮廓汽车减少了颜色，因此几何形状很重要。每次正确匹配后切换汽车重新排序。请记住，乘客会隐藏该符号，但允许显示而不会受到处罚。登机牌要求首先选​​择乘客。",
