  "Panel": "控制板",
  "Panko Barriga Tambor": "潘科·巴里加·坦博尔",
  "Panko beside a glowing bamboo waterway": "Panko 位于发光的竹水道旁",
  "Panko Check": "面包屑检查",
  "Panko checkpoints create memorable difficulty landmarks without introducing combat into a bakery puzzle. Keyboard and screen-reader players use the same native bubble buttons as touch players; accessible names include the animal, row, column, connected-group size, active-order state, and current minimum. Unlike a direct sorting game, Animal Bubble Bakery keeps one persistent board whose shape must be planned several moves ahead.": "Panko 检查站创造了令人难忘的难度地标，而无需将战斗引入面包房谜题中。键盘和屏幕阅读器播放器使用与触摸播放器相同的原生气泡按钮；可访问的名称包括动物、行、列、连接组大小、活动订单状态和当前最小值。与直接分类游戏不同，《动物泡泡面包店》保留了一块永久性的棋盘，其形状必须提前几步进行规划。",
  "Panko Checks": "面包屑检查",
  "Panko connecting a glowing bamboo waterway to a flowering grove": "Panko 连接发光的竹水道和开花的树林",
  "Panko coordinating colorful animal buses and passenger queues": "Panko 协调色彩缤纷的动物巴士和乘客队列",
  "Panko escaped!": "潘科逃脱了！",
  "Panko finding connected number pairs on a bamboo puzzle board": "Panko 在竹拼图板上找到相连的数字对",
  "Panko guiding a spectrum spirit through aurora gates": "Panko 引导光谱精神穿过极光之门",
  "Panko is reopening thirty shaded gardens. Each plant has one authored mirror arrangement that brings real light to its cell.": "Panko 正在重新开放三十个遮荫花园。每株植物都有一个精心设计的镜子排列，可以为其细胞带来真正的光线。",
  "Panko is restoring thirty garden waterways whose bamboo joints were twisted by a storm. Every board is a closed engineering problem: the spring, basin, pipe shapes, and correct route are authored before play begins.": "Panko 正在修复 30 条花园水道，其竹节因暴风雨而扭曲。每块板都是一个封闭的工程问题：弹簧、盆、管道形状和正确的路线是在游戏开始之前编写的。",
  "Panko maps thirty crowded forest gates. Every block begins on a fixed grid and every puzzle has a verified sequence that releases the marked explorer.": "Panko 绘制了三十个拥挤的森林大门。每个区块都从一个固定的网格开始，每个谜题都有一个经过验证的序列，可以释放标记的探索者。",
  "Panko moving trail blocks through a bamboo grove": "Panko 移动小道块穿过竹林",
  "Panko quiere un Puesto de aperitivos, enriquecimiento y una caja de entradas animada.": "Panko quiere un Puesto de aperitivos，enriquecimiento y una caja de entradas animada。",
  "Panko routing a golden sunbeam through mirrors in a bamboo garden": "Panko 在竹园里透过镜子投射金色的阳光",
  "Panko runs a bakery where animal customers order with picture stamps instead of long written lists. Bunny stamps mark berry treats, whales mark ocean cupcakes, chicks mark sunny pastries, frogs mark garden rolls, and foxes mark bright fruit cakes. A delivery cart reaches the shop after a limited number of moves. The player's job is to help Panko combine matching stamps, finish every visible tray, and send each order out before the cart leaves.": "Panko 经营一家面包店，动物顾客点餐时会用图章代替长长的书面清单。兔子邮票标记浆果美食，鲸鱼标记海洋纸杯蛋糕，小鸡标记阳光糕点，青蛙标记花园卷，狐狸标记明亮的水果蛋糕。送货车经过有限次数的移动后到达商店。玩家的任务是帮助 Panko 组合匹配的邮票，完成每个可见的托盘，并在购物车离开之前发送每个订单。",
  "Panko runs a small bakery where each animal customer uses a picture stamp instead of a written ingredient list. Bunny bubbles mark berry treats, whales mark ocean cupcakes, chicks mark sunny pastries, frogs mark garden rolls, and foxes mark berry cakes. A delivery cart arrives after a limited number of moves, so the player helps Panko combine connected stamps and finish each visible tray before the cart leaves.": "Panko 经营一家小面包店，每位动物顾客都使用图章而不是书面成分清单。兔子泡泡标记浆果款待，鲸鱼标记海洋纸杯蛋糕，小鸡标记阳光糕点，青蛙标记花园卷，狐狸标记浆果蛋糕。送货车在有限的移动次数后到达，因此玩家需要帮助 Panko 组合相连的邮票，并在购物车离开之前完成每个可见的托盘。",
  "Panko the Bakery Coach": "面包店教练 Panko",
  "Panko wants a Snack Stand, enrichment, and a lively ticket box.": "Panko 想要一个小吃摊、丰富的食物和一个热闹的售票箱。",
