  "Patrols alternate between a blue slow phase and an amber surge. Clockwork Marshal glows before full-speed pursuit, encouraging players to cross during the readable slow window instead of trying to outrun every guard.": "巡逻在蓝色慢速阶段和琥珀色激增阶段之间交替。发条元帅在全速追击之前会发光，鼓励玩家在可读的慢速窗口内穿过，而不是试图超越每个守卫。",
  "Patrols alternate between a blue slow phase and an amber surge. The field border and guardian glow provide the warning.": "巡逻在蓝色慢速阶段和琥珀色激增阶段之间交替。田野边界和守护者光芒提供了警告。",
