  "Phone picks": "手机精选",
  "Phone, desktop, tablet, and short landscape use the same logical Battle composition. Pointer and keyboard share one state, hidden-page time is suspended, and Result remains inside Battle above the physical reserve. Album progress requires repeated tension decisions, while saved gear and mission selection give return visits a concrete planning choice.": "手机、台式机、平板电脑和短风景都使用相同的逻辑战斗构图。指针和键盘共享一种状态，隐藏页面时间暂停，结果保留在物理储备之上的战斗中。专辑进度需要反复做出紧张的决定，而保存的装备和任务选择则为回访提供了具体的计划选择。",
  "Physics": "物理学",
  "Physics loading failed": "物理加载失败",
  "Physics Merge": "物理合并",
  "Physics Puzzle": "物理谜题",
  "Physics remains active after every drop. Balls can roll, push neighboring stacks, or trigger delayed merges. A fresh falling ball does not immediately count as danger; game over requires a settled or slow-moving ball to remain above the red line. Challenge mode also has a declared drop budget. After the final ball settles, the goal is checked. Free Play has no drop limit and ends only when the tower stays too high.": "每滴后物理都会保持活跃状态。球可以滚动、推动相邻的堆叠或触发延迟合并。新落下的球不会立即被视为危险；游戏结束需要一个稳定的或缓慢移动的球保持在红线上方。挑战模式也有明确的掉落预算。最终球落定后，检查球门。免费游戏没有掉落限制，只有当塔保持得太高时才会结束。",
  "Physics Routes": "物理路线",
  "Pianifica prima di toccare": "托卡雷初级钢琴",
  "Pianifica rimbalzi su pareti e piloni in 30 percorsi, contrasta armature, fasi, divisori e assalitori, poi sconfiggi sei boss.": "Pianifica rimbalzi su pareti 和 piloni 在 30 个 percorsi、对比电枢、fasi、divisori 和 assalitori、poi sconfiggi sei boss 中。",
  "Picado de Fragmentos": "残片断崖",
  "Pick a bank lane between two armored columns.": "在两个装甲纵队之间选择一条银行车道。",
  "Pick a color and select Fill or Brush.": "选择一种颜色并选择“填充”或“画笔”。",
