  "Picnic Bell": "野餐铃",
  "Picnic Bell, Bakery Gate, Garden Drum, Workshop Clock, Bridge Banquet, and Crown Table are checkpoint orders. Clearing Stage 30 means the complete feast has reached the crown table.": "野餐钟、面包店门、花园鼓、作坊钟、桥宴和皇冠桌是检查点订单。通过第30关意味着完整的盛宴已经到达了皇冠桌。",
  "Picnic Crowd": "野餐人群",
