  "Pico de Brasas": "布拉萨斯峰",
  "Picture + Feature": "图片+特色",
  "Picture Care": "图片护理",
  "Picture Introductions": "图片介绍",
  "Picture Match": "图片匹配",
  "Picture Tool and mixed missions intentionally rely on artwork; accessible names remain available.": "图片工具和混合任务有意依赖艺术作品；可访问的名称仍然可用。",
  "Picture Tool and mixed missions rely on artwork while accessible names remain.": "图片工具和混合任务依赖于艺术作品，同时保留了可访问的名称。",
  "Picture Tool missions still keep accessible tool names, but the visible artwork is the main clue.": "图片工具任务仍然保留可访问的工具名称，但可见的艺术品是主要线索。",
  "Picture tools": "图片工具",
  "Picture Tools": "图片工具",
  "Picture Tools and some Keeper Mix shifts intentionally use the eight tool images. Accessible names remain available.": "图片工具和一些 Keeper Mix 班次有意使用八个工具图像。可访问的名称仍然可用。",
  "Picture Tools hide visible words but retain accessible names. Paired Clues show two icons and one priority answer. Remember the Need allows a no-penalty reveal. Changing Tray reorders tools after an error.": "图片工具隐藏可见的单词，但保留可访问的名称。配对线索显示两个图标和一个优先答案。请记住，需要允许无惩罚地透露。发生错误后更改托盘会重新排序工具。",
  "Picture Tools shifts intentionally use the eight tool images; accessible names remain.": "图片工具有意使用八个工具图像；保留可访问的名称。",
  "Picture Tools visually remove item words but retain large art and accessible names.": "图片工具在视觉上删除了项目文字，但保留了大型艺术作品和易于理解的名称。",
  "Picture Tools:": "图片工具：",
  "Picture-only levels visually remove printed food and color names while keeping accessible labels for screen readers. Decoy levels add one or two unused boxes, but the correct color is always present.": "仅图片级别在视觉上消除了印刷的食物和颜色名称，同时保留了屏幕阅读器可访问的标签。诱饵关卡会添加一两个未使用的框，但始终存在正确的颜色。",
  "Picture-only levels visually remove printed food and color names while keeping accessible labels for screen readers. Decoy levels add one or two unused boxes, but the correct color is always present. Moving-box levels rearrange choices only after a correct answer and never while a drag is active.": "仅图片级别在视觉上消除了印刷的食物和颜色名称，同时保留了屏幕阅读器可访问的标签。诱饵关卡会添加一两个未使用的框，但始终存在正确的颜色。移动框级别仅在正确答案后重新排列选项，而不会在拖动处于活动状态时重新排列选项。",
  "Picture-Only Picnic": "仅图片野餐",
  "Picture-only tools, paired clues, memory, and changing positions combine. Mission 30 has six situations and is the final Helper Check.": "仅图片工具、配对线索、记忆和改变位置结合在一起。任务 30 有六种情况，是最后的助手检查。",
  "Picture-Order Cafe Campaign": "图片订购咖啡馆活动",
