  "PIERCE!": "刺穿！",
  "Piercing and splash are strongest against fixed lanes or center-heavy formations; side shots cover alternating and edge attacks.": "刺穿和飞溅对于固定车道或重心阵型来说是最强的；侧面射击涵盖交替攻击和边缘攻击。",
