  "Piste Unblock": "滑雪道解锁",
  "Placas de zarzas y anclas protegen al Coloso.": "科洛索广场 (Placas de zarzas y anclas protegen al Coloso)。",
  "Placas sobrepostas": "索布雷波斯塔斯广场",
  "Placas superpuestas": "超级广场",
  "Placche di rovi e ancore spinose proteggono il Colosso.": "Placche di rovi e ancore spinose proteggono il Colosso。",
  "Place {item} here.": "将{item}放在这里。",
  "Place a blocker and ranged support in highlighted incoming lanes.": "在突出显示的传入车道中放置阻挡者和远程支援。",
  "Place all three block groups on the forest board. Complete a row or column to restore habitat and open new space.": "将所有三个块组放在森林板上。完成一行或一列以恢复栖息地并开辟新空间。",
  "Place an opening beneath Fia before her next landing.": "在菲亚下次着陆之前在她下方放置一个开口。",
  "Place animal guards and stop the wild beasts.": "设置动物守卫并阻止野兽。",
  "Place at least one item before fighting.": "战斗前至少放置一件物品。",
  "Place blocks and complete a line.": "放置块并完成一条线。",
  "Place blocks directly over the waiting acorns.": "将方块直接放在等待的橡子上方。",
  "Place burst damage before the final bend.": "在最终弯曲之前放置爆发伤害。",
  "Place cells from matching Forge, Nature, Crystal, or Moon items beside one another. Every active same-tag link adds Attack and Defense.": "将匹配的锻造、自然、水晶或月球物品中的单元格放置在彼此旁边。每个活动的相同标签链接都会增加攻击和防御。",
  "Place each piece in its outline.": "将每个部分放在其轮廓中。",
  "Place Guards": "地方守卫",
  "Place identical animal balls together. They merge into the next tier and award points.": "将相同的动物球放在一起。他们合并到下一层并奖励积分。",
  "Place large balls low and toward the center. A large ball near a wall can trap several small balls above it.": "将大球放低并靠近中心。靠近墙壁的大球可以捕获其上方的几个小球。",
  "Place matching material tags next to each other for bonuses.": "将匹配的材料标签并排放置以获得奖励。",
  "Place the leaf under the first falling path before pressing Cut, then make smaller corrections while the fruit is moving.": "在按“剪切”之前，将叶子放在第一个下落路径下方，然后在水果移动时进行较小的修正。",
  "Place three animal block groups, clear complete rows and columns, and restore 30 forest habitats or continue in Infinite Grove.": "放置三个动物方块组，清除完整的行和列，并恢复 30 个森林栖息地或继续前往无限丛林。",
  "Placed": "已放置",
  "Placement Strategies": "安置策略",
  "Plan": "计划",
  "Plan 30 saved stages with score, collection, pair, cascade, big-match, and dual checkpoint goals.": "计划 30 个已保存的阶段，包括得分、收集、配对、级联、大型比赛和双检查点目标。",
  "Plan a loop through several small pieces instead of accelerating toward one distant target.": "规划一个通过几个小块的循环，而不是加速向一个遥远的目标。",
  "Plan a Route": "规划路线",
  "Plan around a raised center and wide open sides.": "围绕凸起的中心和宽阔的侧面进行规划。",
  "Plan around corners before committing your route.": "在确定路线之前先规划好拐角处。",
  "Plan before tapping": "攻丝前做好计划",
  "Plan chains and objectives": "计划链和目标",
  "Plan connected animal-bubble clears across 30 recipe puzzles, multi-tray orders, and friendly Panko checkpoints.": "计划连接的动物泡泡清除 30 个食谱谜题、多托盘订单和友好的 Panko 检查站。",
  "Plan de crecimiento": "渐进计划",
  "Plan del parque completo": "完整公园计划",
  "Plan del puesto de aperitivos": "开胃酒计划",
  "Plan each pull, resolve material reactions, and guide Taro and the Star Core through 30 handcrafted Rootvault chambers.": "规划每次拉动，解决材料反应，并引导太郎和星核穿过 30 个手工制作的根穹室。",
  "Plan every swap across 30 saved stages and six distinct puzzle chapters in WeightPlay's animal snack match game.": "在 WeightPlay 的动物零食配对游戏中，规划 30 个已保存阶段和 6 个不同谜题章节中的每次交换。",
  "Plan every swap across 30 saved stages. Rotating snack pools and six goal families turn the 7-by-10 board into a different puzzle in each chapter.": "规划 30 个已保存阶段的每次交换。旋转的零食池和六个目标系列将 7 x 10 的棋盘变成每个章节中的不同谜题。",
  "Plan farther ahead as new colors join the spring.": "随着春季新颜色的加入，请提前计划。",
  "Plan for all five waves before pressing Start Battle: victories continue directly into the next enemy formation, so a balanced opening lineup is safer than a one-wave counter.": "在按“开始战斗”之前计划好所有五波：胜利会直接延续到下一个敌方阵型，因此平衡的开局阵容比一波反击更安全。",
  "Plan for Tide tiles to shift occupied cells after the enemy turn.": "计划潮汐瓷砖在敌人回合后移动占领的单元格。",
  "Plan one board across two different recipes.": "计划一块板涵盖两种不同的食谱。",
  "Plan one continuous route and fill every open cell without visiting any cell twice.": "规划一条连续路线并填充每个开放的单元格，而无需访问任何单元格两次。",
  "Plan routes across 30 Moon Archive missions, master shadow, mirror, clockwork, bell, seal, and spotlight rules, then outwit six guardians.": "规划 30 个月球档案馆任务的路线，掌握影子、镜子、发条、钟声、海豹和聚光灯规则，然后智取六名守护者。",
  "Plan safe moves before a sealed vessel opens.": "在密封容器打开之前计划安全行动。",
  "Plan the biggest matching group first, then save moves for the glowing order bubbles.": "首先规划最大的匹配组，然后为发光的订单气泡保存动作。",
  "Plan the profile": "规划个人资料",
