  "Press and hold the round start seal.": "按住圆形起始密封件。",
  "Press Enter to select this airship, then use arrow keys to choose a dock and Enter to dispatch.": "按 Enter 选择这艘飞艇，然后使用箭头键选择停靠点并按 Enter 进行调度。",
  "Press J to slash and K or Shift to dash. Touch players use the visible direction, Jump, and Attack controls.": "按 J 进行斜线，按 K 或 Shift 进行破折号。触摸玩家使用可见的方向、跳跃和攻击控件。",
  "Press J to slash. Press K or Shift to dash. On touch screens, use the two direction buttons plus the visible Jump, Attack, and Dash buttons.": "按 J 进行斜线。按 K 或 Shift 进行冲刺。在触摸屏上，使用两个方向按钮以及可见的跳跃、攻击和冲刺按钮。",
  "Press Spin to stop three downward reels one by one. Every visible rune contributes its effect, and a completed line of matching runes doubles that ability.": "按旋转可一一停止三个向下的卷轴。每个可见的符文都会贡献其效果，并且完整的匹配符文线会使该能力加倍。",
  "Press Start Battle to watch your squad fight automated shadow beast rounds.": "按“开始战斗”即可观看您的小队与自动暗影兽回合的战斗。",
  "Press Start Battle. Attacks, healing, shields, row targeting, and faint abilities resolve automatically according to the chosen formation.": "按开始战斗。攻击、治疗、护盾、行瞄准和微弱技能会根据所选阵型自动结算。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal mission rail to an unlocked card.": "按“开始游戏”并将水平任务栏滑动到解锁的卡上。",
