  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal route rail to an unlocked card.": "按“开始游戏”并将水平路线滑到解锁的卡上。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked investigation.": "按“开始游戏”并滑动水平舞台导轨即可解锁调查。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked level.": "按“开始游戏”并将水平舞台导轨滑动至解锁级别。",
  "Press Start Game, swipe the 30-card mission rail, and choose an unlocked card after reading its sea condition and catch goal.": "按“开始游戏”，滑动 30 张卡的任务栏，在读取海况并捕获目标后选择一张解锁的卡。",
  "Press Start Game, swipe the mission rail, and select an unlocked card after reading its sea-condition line.": "按“开始游戏”，滑动任务栏，读取海况线后选择一张解锁卡。",
