  "Recommended for ages 9+ and family play. One Line practices hand-eye coordination, focus, and route control through play. It requires no account and uses no formal ability ranking.": "建议 9 岁以上儿童和家庭玩耍。 One Line 通过游戏练习手眼协调能力、注意力和路线控制。它不需要帐户，也不使用正式的能力排名。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+ and family puzzle play. A round usually takes two to six minutes and practices logic, focus, and problem solving through play. Stage unlocks, best star ratings, best times, and constellation progress are stored only in this browser. No account is required, and the Skill Report is supportive game feedback rather than a formal assessment.": "建议 9 岁以上儿童和家庭益智游戏使用。一轮通常需要两到六分钟，通过游戏练习逻辑、注意力和解决问题的能力。阶段解锁、最佳星级、最佳时间和星座进度仅存储在此浏览器中。不需要帐户，技能报告是支持性的游戏反馈，而不是正式的评估。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+. The puzzles practise visual planning and flexible problem solving; they are not an ability test.": "建议 9 岁以上儿童使用。谜题练习视觉规划和灵活解决问题；它们不是能力测试。",
  "Recommended for ages 9+. The puzzles practise visual scanning and planning; they are not an ability test.": "建议 9 岁以上儿童使用。谜题练习视觉扫描和规划；它们不是能力测试。",
