  "Recover one wrong passage at a checkpoint.": "在检查站恢复一条错误的通道。",
  "Recover quickly after a broken line. On Guardian missions, read the named boss rule and any armor cue before making a large correction.": "断线后迅速恢复。在守护者任务中，在进行大规模修正之前，请先阅读指定的 Boss 规则和任何装甲提示。",
  "Recover relics, read hazards, and surface before oxygen runs out.": "回收文物，了解危险，并在氧气耗尽之前浮出水面。",
