  "Recover the mission object and then reach the active extraction marker. If a rule identifies treasure as the first seal, the mission object cannot be collected until that treasure seal is open.": "回收任务物体，然后到达活动的撤离标记。如果规则将宝藏指定为第一个封印，则在该宝藏封印打开之前无法收集任务对象。",
  "Recover the moonlit relic.": "找回月光圣物。",
