  "Reef Notes": "珊瑚礁注释",
  "Reef Notes are field credits for the rod, reel, line, bait, boat, and scanner. Every fifth mission reaches a habitat marker guarded by Sun Crown Guardian, Kelp Leviathan, Coral Ram Ray, Eclipse Manta, Storm Lantern Warden, or Crystal Crown Sovereign. Landing one completes its five-mission chart. Mission 30 restores all six charts and records the final deep-water Guardian.": "礁石注释是鱼竿、渔线轮、鱼线、鱼饵、船和扫描仪的现场记录。每五个任务都会到达一个由太阳皇冠守护者、海带利维坦、珊瑚拉姆鳐鱼、日蚀蝠鲼、风暴灯笼守护者或水晶皇冠君主守卫的栖息地标记。着陆一号完成了它的五项任务图。第 30 号任务恢复了所有六张海图并记录了最后的深水守护者。",
  "Reef Notes are field credits used to improve the survey gear. Each fifth mission reaches a habitat marker guarded by Sun Crown Guardian, Kelp Leviathan, Coral Ram Ray, Eclipse Manta, Storm Lantern Warden, or Crystal Crown Sovereign. Landing the Guardian validates that region's chart. Mission 30 files the sixth chart and ends the campaign without creating Mission 31.": "珊瑚礁笔记是用于改进调查装备的现场积分。每第五个任务都会到达一个由太阳皇冠守护者、海带利维坦、珊瑚拉姆鳐鱼、日食蝠鲼、风暴灯笼守护者或水晶皇冠君主守卫的栖息地标记。登陆卫报验证了该地区的图表。任务 30 提交第六张图表并结束战役，但未创建任务 31。",
