  "Reels stop in a fixed visual order, completed lines glow before resolving, and hero actions remain separate from the combined summoner defense and healing totals.": "卷轴以固定的视觉顺序停止，完成的线条在解决之前会发光，英雄的动作与召唤者防御和治疗的总和保持独立。",
