  "Regional mechanics: armor reduces each direct hit; riposte counters the next Attack; Exhaust raises one card's next cost; marks punish ending with a named card; Weak reduces the next Attack. Regeneration heals, cleanse removes Poison, haste skips through intent order, fog hides an intent, and seals disable one card type for a turn.": "区域机制：装甲减少每次直接命中；反击反击下一次攻击；耗尽会提高一张卡的下一次费用；以指定卡片标记惩罚结尾；弱会减少下一次攻击。再生可以治愈，净化可以消除毒药，急速可以跳过意图顺序，雾气可以隐藏意图，而封印则可以在一个回合中禁用一种卡牌类型。",
  "Regional mechanics: armor reduces each direct hit; riposte counters the next Attack; Exhaust raises one card&#39;s next cost; marks punish ending with a named card; Weak reduces the next Attack. Regeneration heals, cleanse removes Poison, haste skips through intent order, fog hides an intent, and seals disable one card type for a turn.": "区域机制：装甲减少每次直接命中；反击反击下一次攻击；耗尽会提高一张卡的下一次费用；以指定卡片标记惩罚结尾；弱会减少下一次攻击。再生可以治愈，净化可以消除毒药，急速可以跳过意图顺序，雾气可以隐藏意图，而封印则可以在一个回合中禁用一种卡牌类型。",
