  "Rod Strength": "杆强度",
  "Rod Strength removes fish power faster. Reel Control makes the marker follow the chosen position more smoothly. Line Durability both widens the safe band and improves control. Bait Quality increases catch Notes and contributes to landing speed. Boat Range extends the mission clock. Reef Scanner expands the species pool that can appear in earlier regions, which helps fill missing album entries without changing the mission goal. Each item has five saved levels and uses Reef Notes rather than Diamonds.": "鱼竿强度可以更快地消除鱼的力量。卷轴控制使标记更平滑地跟随所选位置。线路耐用性既拓宽了安全范围，又提高了控制能力。饵料质量可提高捕获量并有助于提高着陆速度。船靶场延长了任务时钟。珊瑚礁扫描仪扩展了早期区域中可能出现的物种库，这有助于在不改变任务目标的情况下填补缺失的相册条目。每个项目都有五个已保存的级别，并使用礁石笔记而不是钻石。",
  "Rodas livres": "罗达斯里弗尔",
