  "Rooms": "客房",
  "Rooms 1 and 2 contain authored enemy combinations. Clearing each opens a mandatory choice of Roaring Power, Comet Rhythm, or Moon Recovery. Room 3 is an elite captain on ordinary trials and a named Boss on checkpoint trials.": "房间 1 和 2 包含编写的敌人组合。清除每一个都会打开咆哮力量、彗星节奏或月球恢复的强制选择。 3号房间在普通试炼中是精英队长，在关卡试炼中是指定Boss。",
  "Rooms Cleared": "房间已清理",
