  "Run 30 cafe days with picture orders, numbered recipes, VIP priority, alternating tables, and six Cafe Reviews.": "运行 30 个咖啡馆日，提供图片订单、编号食谱、VIP 优先权、轮换餐桌和六篇咖啡馆评论。",
