  "Run Again": "再跑一次",
  "Run and permanent growth: each wave offers Bigger Orb, Split Orb, Piercing Shine, Faster Recharge, Core Shield, or Scout Magnet according to the current choice cycle. Star Stones earned at Result improve Orb Forge damage, starting Core Shield HP, Companion Den support strikes, and Scout Tower rewards. A three-Diamond blessing reroll is optional, confirmed in two steps, and never required to unlock routes.": "奔跑和永久成长：根据当前选择周期，每一波都会提供更大的球、分裂的球、刺穿光芒、更快的充电、核心护盾或侦察磁铁。在结果中获得的星石可以提高球体锻造伤害、起始核心护盾生命值、同伴巢穴支持打击和侦察塔奖励。三钻祝福重投是可选的，只需两步即可确认，并且不需要解锁路线。",
  "Run Boost": "跑步提升",
  "Run Complete": "运行完成",
  "Run Complete!": "运行完成！",
  "Run Ended": "运行结束",
  "Run growth: defeated enemies drop green Relic Orbs. Filling the EXP bar pauses the room and offers three relic upgrades, such as damage, attack rate, Max HP, movement or pickup range. One optional three-Diamond reroll is available per draft. Run relic counts reset when a new expedition starts, so the next build may solve the same threat mix differently.": "奔跑成长：被击败的敌人会掉落绿色的圣物球。填充 EXP 栏会暂停房间并提供三种遗物升级，例如伤害、攻击率、最大生命值、移动或拾取范围。每个草稿可提供一个可选的三钻重滚。当新的探险开始时，运行遗物计数会重置，因此下一个版本可能会以不同的方式解决相同的威胁组合。",
  "Run HP carries into the next room, with only a small heal at the portal. A defensive relic before Room 3 can be more valuable than another damage choice.": "运行 HP 进入下一个房间，在传送门处只有一个小治疗。 3号房间之前的防御遗物可能比其他伤害选择更有价值。",
  "Run Keys": "运行键",
  "Run reef expeditions with an otter fishing team, time casts, manage line tension, fill a sea-creature album, and upgrade gear locally.": "与水獭捕鱼队一起进行珊瑚礁探险、计时、管理线张力、填充海洋生物相册并在本地升级装备。",
