  "Rux Cuerno Engranaje": "鲁克斯·库尔诺·恩格拉纳杰",
  "Rux is restoring a cargo ark one warehouse at a time. Every rune crate must reach a glowing dock before the route can reopen.": "Rux 正在一次修复一个仓库的货柜。每个符文箱都必须到达发光的码头，然后路线才能重新开放。",
  "Rux pushing rune cargo through a sky ark": "鲁克斯推动符文货物穿过天方舟",
  "Rux read every obstacle and outraced Fia.": "Rux 读懂了每一个障碍并超越了 Fia。",
