  "Rythme des phases": "阶段节奏",
  "Sabana del amanecer": "萨瓦纳德尔阿马内塞尔",
  "Safari": "狩猎之旅",
  "SAFARI": "萨法里",
  "Safari Dash": "狩猎冲刺",
  "Safari Dash - How to Play": "Safari Dash - 玩法",
  "Safari Dash - WeightPlay": "Safari Dash - WeightPlay",
  "Safari Dash game": "野生动物园冲刺游戏",
  "Safari Dash game guide": "Safari Dash 游戏指南",
  "Safari Dash is a three-lane animal runner with 30 saved routes across six regions. Spark Paw Fox restores guide stars while route cards announce five objective types and the active rules. Star trails, two-lane gates, sticky mud, and authored Guardian patterns make later routes require different reading and recovery decisions instead of only increasing speed.": "Safari Dash 是一款三车道动物跑步游戏，已保存 30 条路线，横跨六个地区。 Spark Paw Fox 恢复了指南星，同时路线卡宣布了五种目标类型和有效规则。星迹、双车道门、粘稠的泥浆和编写的守护者模式使得后面的路线需要不同的读取和恢复决策，而不仅仅是提高速度。",
  "Safari Dash is a three-lane animal runner with 30 saved routes, six regions, five kinds of route objectives, and six Guardian Checks. Spark Paw Fox carries guide stars between protected trails while players read safe lanes, collect star tokens, and decide when a tempting star line is worth crossing into danger. The campaign begins with open paths, then adds two-lane gates, sticky mud, guided star trails, and authored Guardian patterns that change the route rather than merely increasing speed.": "Safari Dash 是一款三车道动物奔跑游戏，拥有 30 条已保存路线、六个区域、五种路线目标和六项监护人检查。 Spark Paw Fox 在受保护的小道之间携带引导星星，而玩家则读取安全路线，收集星星标记，并决定何时值得穿越诱人的星星线进入危险。战役从开放的道路开始，然后添加了两车道的大门、粘稠的泥土、引导星迹，并编写了改变路线而不仅仅是提高速度的守护者模式。",
  "Safari Dash is intended for ages 9+ because later routes combine faster visual decisions, route objectives, and score pressure. The Result reports real evidence from the run: lane changes, stars collected, obstacle bumps, and best uninterrupted combo. These values describe one play session only. They are not a developmental assessment, diagnosis, or comparison with other children. Progress and the local Top 5 remain in this browser's local storage.": "Safari Dash 适合 9 岁以上的儿童，因为后面的路线结合了更快的视觉决策、路线目标和得分压力。结果报告了跑步中的真实证据：变道、收集的星星、障碍物颠簸以及最佳不间断组合。这些值仅描述一次游戏会话。它们不是发育评估、诊断或与其他儿童的比较。进度和本地前 5 名仍保留在此浏览器的本地存储中。",
  "Safari Dash is intended for ages 9+ because later routes combine quick lane reading, objectives, and score pressure. The Skill Report uses only current-run evidence: lane changes, stars, bumps, and best combo. It is not a diagnosis, developmental assessment, or comparison with other children.": "Safari Dash 适合 9 岁以上的儿童，因为后面的路线结合了快速车道阅读、目标和得分压力。技能报告仅使用当前运行的证据：变道、星星、颠簸和最佳组合。它不是诊断、发育评估或与其他儿童的比较。",
  "Safari Dash uses three lanes so a choice remains readable on a phone without shrinking the fox or hazards into tiny targets. Each input moves exactly one lane; a held keyboard key cannot skip across two lanes, and a captured touch swipe can finish even if the finger crosses the Canvas edge. Route timers range from 28 to 45 seconds so a retry is short, while the 30-route campaign supplies longer-term structure.": "Safari Dash 使用三个车道，因此选择在手机上仍然可读，而不会将狐狸或危险缩小为微小目标。每个输入只移动一条车道；按住的键盘键不能跳过两个通道，即使手指越过画布边缘，捕获的触摸滑动也可以完成。路由计时器的范围为 28 到 45 秒，因此重试时间很短，而 30 条路由的活动提供了长期结构。",
