  "Save a shield or charged Comet Break for a crowded cursed segment rather than using it on a simple ring.": "为拥挤的诅咒部分保留盾牌或带电的彗星断裂，而不是在简单的戒指上使用它。",
  "Save and privacy": "保存和隐私",
  "Save Burst for dense barriers and Line Clear for a row containing several obstacles or rescue bubbles.": "对于密集的障碍物，请保存“爆裂”；对于包含多个障碍物或救援气泡的行，请保存“清线”。",
  "Save Burst for dense barriers and Line Clear for valuable rows.": "对于密集的障碍物，请保存“爆裂”，对于有价值的行，请保存“清线”。",
  "Save hero focus for each healing phase.": "为每个治疗阶段保留英雄焦点。",
  "Save magnetic pulls for positions that cannot be recovered by ordinary walking and pushing.": "对于无法通过普通行走和推力恢复的位置，请保留磁力拉力。",
  "Save one full lane of sun for the final guardian's moon pulse.": "为最后守护者的月亮脉冲保留一整条太阳。",
  "Save role coverage for Boss stages. The final Voidroot Emperor changes phase at two health thresholds, summoning bats first and then armored ground support while rebuilding guard.": "保存 Boss 阶段的角色覆盖范围。最终的虚根皇帝会在两个生命值阈值处改变相位，首先召唤蝙蝠，然后在重建守卫时召唤地面装甲支援。",
  "Save shielded large salvage until enough prism keys and mass have been collected.": "保存屏蔽的大量废品，直到收集到足够的棱镜钥匙和质量。",
  "Save sonar pings for harder zones or rare shimmer movement.": "将声纳脉冲保存在较困难的区域或罕见的闪光运动中。",
  "Save sun for two complete lanes rather than many weak guards.": "将阳光留给两条完整的车道，而不是许多弱后卫。",
  "Save the optional Diamond reroll for a blessing set that genuinely misses the route's rule. Normal route unlocking and all six Bosses remain playable without spending Diamonds.": "保留可选的钻石重滚以获得真正违反路线规则的祝福套装。正常路线解锁，所有六个 Boss 都可以在不花费钻石的情况下玩。",
  "Save the optional Diamond reroll for a blessing set that genuinely misses the route&#39;s rule. Normal route unlocking and all six Bosses remain playable without spending Diamonds.": "保留可选的钻石重滚以获得真正违反路线规则的祝福套装。正常路线解锁，所有六个 Boss 都可以在不花费钻石的情况下玩。",
