  "Scan from the bottom upward. A low clear moves more bubbles and can connect animals that were separated across several rows.": "从下往上扫描。低透明可移动更多气泡，并且可以将分散在几行中的动物连接起来。",
  "Scan from the bottom upward. Clearing a low group moves more bubbles and creates more possible connections.": "从下往上扫描。清除低组会移动更多气泡并创建更多可能的联系。",
