  "Score Puzzle": "得分谜题",
  "Score stages ask for a total number of points. Collection stages count only the named snack. Pair stages accept either of two named snacks, which creates more possible routes but also asks the player to watch two colors at once. Big-match stages require one clear containing four, five, or six tiles. Cascade stages require a falling refill to create a second or third automatic match. Checkpoint stages combine a specific collection order with a score target, so neither half can be ignored.": "分数阶段要求总分。收集阶段仅计算指定的零食。配对阶段接受两种指定零食中的任何一种，这创造了更多可能的路线，但也要求玩家同时观看两种颜色。大型比赛阶段需要包含四块、五块或六块瓷砖的清场。级联阶段需要下降的补充来创建第二个或第三个自动匹配。检查点阶段将特定的收集顺序与分数目标结合起来，因此任何一半都不能被忽略。",
  "Score, collection, pair, cascade, big-match, and dual checkpoint goals ask for different plans.": "得分、收集、配对、级联、大型比赛和双检查点目标需要不同的计划。",
  "Scores and favorites stay on this device.": "乐谱和收藏夹保留在此设备上。",
