  "Scores are for fun and local progress tracking only. They are not an IQ test, medical diagnosis, psychological test, or formal school assessment.": "分数仅供娱乐和本地进度跟踪。它们不是智商测试、医学诊断、心理测试或正式的学校评估。",
  "Scores are for fun and progress tracking only.": "分数仅用于娱乐和进度跟踪。",
