  "Select {item}.": "选择{item}。",
  "Select a complete golden pin.": "选择一个完整的金针。",
  "Select a slot, then choose an owned hero below.": "选择一个插槽，然后在下面选择一个拥有的英雄。",
  "Select a vessel with a movable top orb, then select a compatible destination with space. The destination must be empty or show the same top color.": "选择具有可移动顶部球体的容器，然后选择具有空间的兼容目的地。目标必须为空或显示相同的顶部颜色。",
  "Select a weapon to view damage, cooldown and merge details.": "选择武器以查看伤害、冷却时间和合并详细信息。",
  "Select an empty vessel or one whose top orb matches.": "选择一个空容器或顶部球体匹配的容器。",
  "Select an incoming animal airship and read its dock, patience, cargo or passenger need, and damage state.": "选择一艘即将到来的动物飞艇并阅读其码头、耐心、货物或乘客需求以及损坏状态。",
  "Select an item from the tray. Tap an open green cell to place it, or rotate the selected shape before trying another position.": "从托盘中选择一个项目。点击打开的绿色单元格进行放置，或者在尝试其他位置之前旋转选定的形状。",
  "Select an unlocked route from the horizontal Stage rail. The card states its objective and active route rules before play begins.": "从水平舞台导轨中选择一条未锁定的路线。该卡在比赛开始前说明其目标和活动路线规则。",
  "Select an unlocked terminal.": "选择一个解锁的终端。",
  "Select Cat, Dog, Owl, or an owned Fox, then tap an empty grass tile in the lane that needs help.": "选择猫、狗、猫头鹰或拥有的狐狸，然后点击需要帮助的车道上的空草块。",
  "Select Check Word, or finish a continuous drag, to submit the path.": "选择“检查单词”或完成连续拖动以提交路径。",
  "Select equipment from the tray, rotate it when useful, and place it on a valid green cell in the 11 x 7 pack.": "从托盘中选择设备，在有用时旋转它，然后将其放置在 11 x 7 包中的有效绿色单元上。",
  "Select Leo, Fia, Orla, or Taro; the choice stays saved for later visits.": "选择 Leo、Fia、Orla 或 Taro；该选择将被保存以供以后访问。",
  "Select Leo, Fia, Orla, or Taro. Hero selection and unlocked progress are saved locally.": "选择 Leo、Fia、Orla 或 Taro。英雄选择和解锁进度均保存在本地。",
  "Select Lion, Owl or Turtle on the board or in the Squad Action roster. Choose an adjacent highlighted cell to move, a highlighted enemy to attack, Guard, or Skill.": "在面板或小队行动名册中选择狮子、猫头鹰或乌龟。选择要移动的相邻突出显示的单元格、要攻击的突出显示的敌人、守卫或技能。",
  "Select Lion, Owl or Turtle, then move to a highlighted cell, attack a highlighted enemy, Guard, or use Skill.": "选择狮子、猫头鹰或乌龟，然后移动到突出显示的单元格，攻击突出显示的敌人、守卫或使用技能。",
  "Select one complete golden pin and pull it.": "选择一根完整的金针并将其拉出。",
  "Select one free tile, then another free tile with the same picture. A valid match removes both together. Selecting a different picture keeps the newer tile selected and explains that a match is still needed.": "选择一个免费图块，然后选择另一个具有相同图片的免费图块。有效的匹配会将两者一起删除。选择不同的图片会使较新的图块保持选中状态，并说明仍然需要匹配。",
  "Select one of these ancient relics to empower your explorer.": "选择这些古代文物之一来增强您的探险家的能力。",
  "Select one of these ancient relics to empower your wolf.": "选择这些古代遗物之一来增强你的狼的力量。",
  "Select one relic to buff your squad for the entire expedition run.": "选择一件遗物来增强你的小队在整个探险过程中的能力。",
  "Select one unlocked screw and then an empty hole. A plate falls as soon as none of its support holes still contains a screw. Shared fasteners can hold several plates, while locked screws become available only after enough upper layers have fallen.": "选择一颗未锁定的螺钉，然后选择一个空孔。一旦板的支撑孔中不再有螺钉，板就会掉落。共用的紧固件可以固定多块板，而锁定的螺钉只有在足够的上层掉落后才可用。",
