  "Shadow Brute attacks blockers quickly, Forest Behemoth summons escorts, Ironbark Colossus rebuilds armor, Verdant Ancient heals, Tempest Ravager hastens allies, and Voidroot Emperor changes phase twice.": "暗影蛮族快速攻击阻挡者，森林巨兽召唤护卫，铁树巨像重建护甲，苍翠远古治疗，风暴掠夺者催促盟友，虚根皇帝两次改变相位。",
  "Shadow Brute breaks weak front lines.": "暗影蛮族打破了薄弱的前线。",
  "Shadow circles hide Fia from patrol sight.": "阴影圆圈将 Fia 隐藏在巡逻队的视线之外。",
