  "Shadow Fox Scout": "影狐斥候",
  "Shadow foxes apply steady pressure, panthers close quickly, and crystal boars absorb more attacks. Later stages add breakable shields, announced charges, scorch ground, drifting drops, mirrored strikes, and a moving Eclipse safe ring.": "暗影狐施加稳定的压力，黑豹快速接近，水晶野猪吸收更多攻击。后期阶段增加了易碎护盾、宣布冲锋、焦土、漂流掉落、镜像打击和移动的日蚀安全环。",
