  "Shadow Scouts": "暗影斥候",
  "Shadow Scouts chase directly. Prism Ravens approach on curved flight. Ember Boars show a warning before charging. Moon Hunters maintain distance and fire periodically. Abyss Guards reduce ordinary damage until hero skills break their guard.": "暗影斥候直接追击。棱镜乌鸦以曲线飞行方式接近。灰烬野猪在充电前会显示警告。月球猎人保持距离并定期开火。深渊守卫会减少普通伤害，直到英雄技能打破他们的守卫。",
