  "Shield-heavy stage. Use Owl slows and Fox burst if unlocked.": "重盾阶段。如果解锁，请使用猫头鹰减速和狐狸爆发。",
  "Shielded": "屏蔽",
  "Shielded enemies and charge waves demand target priority.": "受到屏蔽的敌人和冲锋波需要目标优先。",
  "Shielded formations must lose their shield before taking normal damage. Bombs must be defused before their countdown finishes, champions require sustained focus, and any surviving monster that crosses the bottom line damages the crystal core.": "护盾编队必须在受到正常伤害之前失去护盾。炸弹必须在倒计时结束前拆除，冠军需要持续集中注意力，任何跨越底线的幸存怪物都会损坏水晶核心。",
  "Shielded packs protect fast followers.": "屏蔽包可以保护快速追随者。",
  "SHIELDED: stay SAFE until it opens.": "屏蔽：在打开之前保持安全。",
  "Shields and denser cursed sectors demand a plan.": "护盾和更密集的诅咒区域需要制定计划。",
  "Shift": "转变",
  "Shift {n} unlocked": "Shift {n} 解锁",
  "Shift {n}/30": "平移{n}/30",
  "Shift {shift}: {done}/{goal} flights completed and {errors}/3 errors. This shift progress will be lost; saved medals and rewards stay safe.": "班次 {shift}：{done}/{goal} 航班已完成，{errors}/3 个错误。此转变进度将会丢失；保存的奖牌和奖励保持安全。",
  "Shift 1 teaches two docks, route drawing, and four forgiving arrivals. Shift 2 opens the third dock and cargo-passenger priorities. Shift 3 adds a moving storm and weather beacon. Shift 4 adds damaged flights, repair parts, and a maintenance closure. Shift 5 combines ten arrivals, overlapping windows, and optional festival contracts.": "第一班教授两个码头、绘制路线和四个宽容的到达。 Shift 2 打开第三个码头和货客优先。 Shift 3 添加了移动风暴和天气信标。 Shift 4 增加了损坏的航班、维修零件和维护关闭。 Shift 5 结合了 10 名抵达者、重叠的窗口和可选的节日合同。",
  "Shift complete: {station} earned {tickets} tickets and kept visitor happiness at {mood}%.": "班次完成：{station} 赢得了 {tickets} 门票，并将游客满意度保持在 {mood}%。",
  "Shift complete!": "换档完成！",
  "Shift progress, medals, reputation, upgrades, discoveries, tutorial state, and settings stay in this browser.": "转变进度、奖牌、声誉、升级、发现、教程状态和设置都保留在此浏览器中。",
  "Shift selection": "班次选择",
  "Shifting Hall": "变速大厅",
  "Shifting Orrery": "移动太阳系仪",
  "Shifts": "轮班",
  "Shifts 1-5 teach exact Care Match requests and end with the first Keeper Check.": "1-5 轮班教导准确的护理比赛请求，并以第一次守门员检查结束。",
  "Shifts 1–5, Care Match:": "1-5 班次，护理匹配：",
  "Shifts 11-15 introduce Care Categories with one or more valid tools.": "第 11 至 15 班使用一种或多种有效工具介绍护理类别。",
  "Shifts 11–15, Care Categories:": "11-15 班次，护理类别：",
  "Shifts 16-20 briefly hide requests, which can always be restored by tapping the animal.": "Shifts 16-20 会短暂隐藏请求，这些请求始终可以通过点击动物来恢复。",
  "Shifts 16–20, Remember and Help:": "16-20 班，记住并帮助：",
  "Shifts 21-25 require ordered two-step routines; Shift 25 contains three complete pairs.": "21-25 班需要有序的两步例程； Shift 25 包含三个完整的对。",
  "Shifts 21–25, Two-Step Routine:": "21-25 班次，两步程序：",
  "Shifts 26-30 recombine earlier rules. Shift 30 uses picture-only category choices, memory recall and six decisions. Checkpoints are exactly 5/10/15/20/25/30.": "26-30 班次重新组合了之前的规则。 Shift 30 使用仅图片类别选择、记忆回忆和六个决策。检查点正好是 5/10/15/20/25/30。",
  "Shifts 26–30, Keeper Mix:": "26-30 轮班，Keeper Mix：",
  "Shifts 6-10 remove visible item labels in Picture Tools play.": "Shifts 6-10 删除图片工具播放中可见的项目标签。",
  "Shifts 6–10, Picture Tools:": "班次 6-10，图片工具：",
  "SHOCKWAVE": "冲击波",
  "Shop": "商店",
  "Shop shelf items": "商店货架上的物品",
  "Short deterministic routes turn mistakes into useful information instead of random punishment. Large carts, visible arrows, and the same tap rule work across phone and desktop. Pause, Help, Undo, Restart, and Result actions preserve a clear flow. Progress stays only in this browser.": "短的确定性路线将错误转化为有用的信息，而不是随机惩罚。大型购物车、可见的箭头和相同的点击规则适用于手机和桌面设备。暂停、帮助、撤消、重新启动和结果操作保持清晰的流程。进度仅保留在此浏览器中。",
  "Short shifts and large care pictures give preschool players a clear ending without a timer. Difficulty changes the kind of observation—recognition, classification, memory or order—instead of shrinking hit areas. Touch, drag, mouse and keyboard share one transaction, and the logical layout scales uniformly across phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Unlike Animal Quiz, this game asks which care tool fits the moment rather than which animal matches a fact. Kids play has no advertising, account, purchase, ranking or failure screen.": "短暂的轮班和大型护理图片为学龄前玩家提供了一个无需计时器的清晰结局。困难改变了观察的类型——识别、分类、记忆或顺序——而不是缩小命中区域。触摸、拖动、鼠标和键盘共享一项事务，逻辑布局在手机、平板电脑、台式机和短横向上统一缩放。与动物测验不同，该游戏询问哪种护理工具适合当前情况，而不是哪种动物符合事实。儿童游戏没有广告、帐户、购买、排名或失败屏幕。",
  "Short Starlight": "短星光",
  "Shots": "镜头",
  "Shots Left": "左镜头",
  "Should every wheel be a circle?": "每个轮子都应该是圆的吗？",
  "Show Guide": "演出指南",
  "Show Hint": "显示提示",
  "Show Hint highlights the next cell in one possible solution, while Restart clears the current route. Using a hint reduces the best star result for that attempt.": "显示提示突出显示一个可能的解决方案中的下一个单元格，而重新启动则清除当前路线。使用提示会降低该尝试的最佳星级结果。",
  "Show objective": "显示目标",
  "Shower": "淋浴",
  "Showing {skill} games with {name}.": "显示 {skill} 与 {name} 的游戏。",
  "Shows one safe next pin.": "显示一个安全的下一个引脚。",
  "Shows the exact recommended profile before every obstacle.": "在每个障碍物之前显示准确的推荐轮廓。",
  "Shuffle": "随机播放",
  "Shuffle is a recovery tool and becomes available only when no legal matching pair remains.": "Shuffle 是一种恢复工具，只有在没有合法匹配对时才可用。",
  "Shuffle is disabled while a legal pair exists. If the board has no free match, Shuffle rearranges remaining picture tokens, preserves key and rescue markings, and guarantees a playable pair.": "当存在合法对时，随机播放被禁用。如果棋盘上没有自由匹配，则随机播放会重新排列剩余的图片标记，保留关键和救援标记，并保证可玩的对。",
