  "Skill Report": "技能报告",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Clear win with {core}% core HP. For a perfect clear, upgrade blockers earlier and stretch the route before burst waves.": "技能报告：{stars}/3 星。以 {core}% 核心生命值明显获胜。为了获得完美的畅通，请尽早升级阻挡物并在爆发波浪之前拉长路线。",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Close clear with {core}% core HP. Add Medic or Sapper support sooner and avoid sealing the route too early.": "技能报告：{stars}/3 星。以 {core}% 核心 HP 关闭清除。尽早添加医疗兵或工兵支援，避免过早封锁路线。",
  "Skill Report: {stars}/3 Stars. Strong route planning kept the core at {core}%. Next, time hero focus fire even earlier on bosses.": "技能报告：{stars}/3 星。强大的路线规划使核心保持在 {core}%。接下来，时间英雄会更早地向 Boss 集中火力。",
  "Skill Report: good practice. Next run, aim earlier and use walls to hit multiple beasts.": "技能报告：良好的实践。下一次奔跑，更早瞄准并使用墙壁击中多个野兽。",
  "Skill Report: good practice. Upgrade gear and keep the marker inside the safe band earlier.": "技能报告：良好的实践。升级装备并尽早将标记保持在安全范围内。",
  "Skill Report: Logic, Problem Solving, and Focus practiced through path planning and upgrade timing.": "技能报告：通过路径规划和升级时机练习逻辑、解决问题和专注力。",
  "Skill Report: strong focus and reaction. You managed line tension while choosing safer casts.": "技能报告：强烈的专注力和反应力。您在选择更安全的铸件的同时控制了线张力。",
  "Skill Report: strong logic and reaction. You used bounce planning and upgrade choice to protect the fortress.": "技能报告：逻辑性强，反应性强。您使用弹跳计划和升级选择来保护堡垒。",
  "Skill Report: The core fell. Reshape the route, keep one readable path open, and upgrade key blockers before the next pressure wave.": "技能报告：核心掉落。重塑路线，保持一条可读路径畅通，并在下一次压力波到来之前升级关键拦截器。",
