  "Slide a 4×4 forest grid, merge matching animals, and clear 30 saved evolution missions with stones, score goals, and move limits.": "滑动 4×4 森林网格，合并匹配的动物，并使用石头清除 30 个已保存的进化任务、得分目标和移动限制。",
  "Slide back into SAFE now.": "现在滑回安全区。",
