  "Slide horizontal and vertical blocks along their own axes until the red explorer gains a clear route through the exit.": "沿着各自的轴滑动水平和垂直块，直到红色探险家获得通过出口的清晰路线。",
  "Slide the blocks and guide Panko out through the gate across 30 trails, with thousands of deterministic layouts.": "滑动方块并引导 Panko 通过大门穿过 30 条小径，其中有数千种确定性布局。",
