  "Snack Blocks - 30-Stage Match Puzzle Game": "Snack Blocks - 30 阶段配对益智游戏",
  "Snack Blocks - How to Play": "零食块 - 玩法",
  "Snack Blocks - WeightPlay": "零食块 - WeightPlay",
  "Snack Blocks board": "零食积木板",
  "Snack Blocks game guide": "零食块游戏指南",
  "Snack Blocks is a 30-stage animal snack puzzle about preparing a traveling feast. Every legal swap must create a match, every stage gives a complete move budget, and six chapters change which snacks appear and what counts as success. Progress and personal best scores stay in this browser, so a player can return to the latest unlocked stage without an account.": "Snack Blocks 是一款包含 30 个阶段的动物零食拼图，旨在准备一场旅行盛宴。每个合法的交换都必须创建一个匹配，每个阶段都给出完整的移动预算，六个章节会改变出现的零食以及成功的标准。进度和个人最好成绩会保留在该浏览器中，因此玩家无需帐户即可返回到最新的解锁阶段。",
  "Snack Blocks is intended for ages 9+ and family play because later stages combine two goals, changing snack pools, and cascade planning. Its local Skill Report is supportive run feedback, not a diagnosis, school assessment, or comparison with other children.": "Snack Blocks 适合 9 岁以上儿童和家庭游戏，因为后期阶段结合了两个目标：更换零食池和级联规划。其当地的技能报告是支持性的跑步反馈，而不是诊断、学校评估或与其他孩子的比较。",
  "Snack Blocks is intended for ages 9+ and family play because later stages combine two goals, changing snack pools, and cascade planning. The local Skill Report summarizes only events from the current run. It is supportive play feedback, not an intelligence test, diagnosis, school assessment, or comparison with other children. The game is free, needs no login, and stores unlocked stages and records only in the current browser.": "Snack Blocks 适合 9 岁以上儿童和家庭游戏，因为后期阶段结合了两个目标：更换零食池和级联规划。本地技能报告仅总结当前运行的事件。这是支持性的游戏反馈，而不是智力测试、诊断、学校评估或与其他孩子的比较。该游戏是免费的，无需登录，并且仅在当前浏览器中存储解锁的阶段和记录。",
