  "Solve 30 animal investigations with picture, habitat, feature, behavior, food, mystery-image, and silhouette clues.": "通过图片、栖息地、特征、行为、食物、神秘图像和轮廓线索解决 30 项动物调查。",
  "Solve 30 animal-help missions with picture tools, paired clues, memory needs, and changing trays.": "使用图片工具、配对线索、记忆需求和更换托盘完成 30 个动物帮助任务。",
  "Solve 30 picture, habitat, feature, action, and food investigations.": "解决 30 项图片、栖息地、特征、动作和食物调查。",
