  "Some cells are still empty. Keep planning your route.": "有些单元格仍然是空的。继续规划你的路线。",
  "Some challenges ask the park to prepare a ready box. Collect only after that goal is satisfied.": "有些挑战要求公园准备一个现成的盒子。仅在满足该目标后收集。",
  "Some challenges test whether the park can prepare income without immediately spending it. Collect only after that goal is satisfied.": "一些挑战测试公园是否可以在不立即支出的情况下准备收入。仅在满足该目标后收集。",
  "Some images could not load; available art will be used": "部分图片无法加载；将使用现有的艺术",
  "Some sealed missions require optional treasure as the first seal before the mission object becomes valid.": "一些密封任务需要可选的宝藏作为任务对象生效之前的第一个密封。",
  "Some stages require groups of three or four before any bubbles can clear. Queue stages place a bright outline around the animal that must be served next; clearing another animal changes the board but does not advance its later counter. Bonus-batch stages make a sufficiently large group count extra toward the active order. Group-goal stages require one clear at least as large as the displayed target in addition to finishing all recipe counters.": "有些阶段需要三到四人一组才能清除气泡。排队阶段在接下来必须提供服务的动物周围放置了明亮的轮廓；清除另一只动物会改变棋盘，但不会推进其后面的计数器。奖励批次阶段使足够大的组对活跃订单额外计数。除了完成所有配方计数器之外，团体目标阶段还需要清除至少与显示目标一样大的目标。",
