  "Spark Paw Fox": "火花爪狐",
  "Spark Paw Fox carries replacement stars through every route. Zebra Pathfinder, Rhino Trailkeeper, Hippo Waterwarden, Eagle Skykeeper, Lion Pridekeeper, and Elephant Crownkeeper each test one five-route region before reopening it. Clearing Route 30 reconnects all six regions.": "Spark Paw Fox 带着替补明星走过每条路线。斑马探路者、犀牛守道者、河马水卫者、鹰天空守护者、狮子骄傲守护者和象冠守护者在重新开放之前分别测试一个五路线区域。清理 30 号公路将重新连接所有六个区域。",
  "Spatial Control": "空间控制",
  "Spatial Inventory": "空间库存",
  "Spatial Inventory Expedition": "空间库存探险",
  "Spatial Inventory Roguelite": "空间库存 Roguelite",
