  "SPD": "SPD",
  "Special Beasts and Counterplay": "特殊野兽和反击",
  "Special Enemies": "特殊的敌人",
  "Special enemies change the layout problem. Shields absorb opening damage, Ambushers strike before the normal exchange, isolation adds damage for unlinked items, corrosion removes Defense over time, top-row heat punishes occupied ventilation cells, overload suppresses the pack's most common tag, and rotating seals cycle among all four materials.": "特殊的敌人改变了布局问题。护盾吸收开口伤害，伏击者在正常交换之前发动攻击，隔离会增加对未连接物品的伤害，腐蚀会随着时间的推移消除防御，顶排热量会惩罚占用的通风单元，过载会抑制包装中最常见的标签，并且旋转密封件会在所有四种材料之间循环。",
  "Special enemies:": "特殊敌人：",
  "Special enemies: armored beasts absorb a fixed number of hits before losing HP. Stationary thorn anchors periodically give nearby allies a shield. Moon wisps visibly phase out and cannot be damaged until they return. Crystal splitters create two faster shards when defeated. Chargers mark a line, rush, then leave a recovery opening.": "特殊敌人：装甲兽在失去生命值之前会吸收固定数量的攻击。固定的荆棘锚定期为附近的盟友提供护盾。月亮的缕缕明显地逐渐消失，并且在它们返回之前不会被损坏。水晶分裂者被击败后会产生两个更快的碎片。冲锋队划出一条线，冲锋，然后留下一个恢复空档。",
  "Special enemies: Crystal Bats fire spreads, Armored Boars open after a missed patrol turn, Charger Boars burst across lanes, Ember Wolves leave fire, Dive Bats pursue vertically, Rift Bats blink between perches, and Mirror Wolves split once into two fragile echoes.": "特殊敌人：水晶蝙蝠火力蔓延，装甲野猪在错过巡逻转弯后打开，冲锋野猪冲过车道，灰烬狼离开火力，潜水蝙蝠垂直追击，裂缝蝙蝠在栖息地之间眨眼，镜狼分裂成两个脆弱的回声。",
  "Special enemies: Ironbark stages give enemies breakable guard armor; mistwood enemies recover health while moving; storm enemies accelerate after falling below half health; eclipse stages combine armor, recovery, surge behavior, flying routes, and reduced slow effectiveness.": "特殊敌人：铁皮阶段为敌人提供可破坏的护甲；迷雾林敌人在移动时恢复生命值；风暴敌人在生命值低于一半后会加速；日食阶段结合了装甲、恢复、激增行为、飞行路线和降低的缓慢效果。",
  "Special Memory Rules": "特殊记忆规则",
  "Special Rescue Rules": "特别救援规则",
  "Spectrum changed to {name}.": "频谱更改为{name}。",
  "Spectrum in Harmony": "和谐的频谱",
