  "Speed {speed} · Height {height} · Grip {grip} · Width {width}": "速度{speed}·高度{height}·握力{grip}·宽度{width}",
  "Speed {val}": "速度 {val}",
  "Speed / dodge hero": "速度/闪避英雄",
  "Speed is not required. Pause on the current cell and plan the remaining route before moving.": "速度没有要求。在移动之前在当前单元格暂停并规划剩余路线。",
  "Speed:": "速度：",
  "Spend {points} training point(s) before the next run.": "在下一次跑步之前花费 {points} 训练点。",
  "Spend 1 point on {name}: {effect}": "在 {name} 上花费 1 分：{effect}",
  "Spend 3 Diamonds to refresh Orla's stock?": "花3钻石刷新奥拉库存？",
  "Spend 3 Diamonds to reroll these blessings?": "花费3钻石来重新滚动这些祝福？",
  "Spend a Skill before Moon Dust can silence that hero.": "在月尘沉默该英雄之前使用技能。",
  "Spend both points before battle resumes. {points} remaining.": "在战斗重新开始之前用完两点。剩余 {points}。",
  "Spend coins for a card or equipment for future runs.": "花费硬币购买卡片或设备以供将来运行。",
  "Spend coins on one of three permanent upgrades, replay an unlocked day, or continue to the next day.": "花费硬币进行三个永久升级之一，重玩解锁的一天，或继续到第二天。",
  "Spend earned shards on permanent launcher upgrades.": "将赢得的碎片用于永久启动器升级。",
  "Spend earned shards on permanent racing upgrades.": "将赢得的碎片用于永久赛车升级。",
  "Spend earned stat points after level-ups, then continue to the next zone or return to Dive Routes from settlement.": "花费升级后获得的统计点，然后继续前往下一个区域或从结算返回潜水路线。",
  "Spend every point before continuing.": "在继续之前花掉每一点。",
  "Spend Forge Bolts on tools that help every race.": "使用 Forge Bolts 购买对每场比赛都有帮助的工具。",
  "Spend Forge Bolts on tools that immediately help every race.": "使用 Forge Bolts 购买可以立即帮助每场比赛的工具。",
  "Spend important sun before a thief's pouch activates.": "在小偷的袋子被激活之前，要好好晒晒太阳。",
  "Spend one Energy to remove one. Holding it at turn end deals two damage and cycles it through discard.": "花费 1 点能量来消除 1 点。在回合结束时握住它会造成两次伤害并循环丢弃。",
  "Spend runes to permanently upgrade each animal hero.": "花费符文永久升级每个动物英雄。",
  "Spend saved sky shards on permanent control and survival upgrades.": "将保存的天空碎片用于永久控制和生存升级。",
  "Spend saved upgrade points from Stage when permanent power, bulwark health, or starting economy needs improvement. Optional Diamond actions always show their cost and require confirmation.": "当永久力量、堡垒健康或启动经济需要改进时，使用舞台上节省的升级点。可选的钻石操作始终会显示其成本并需要确认。",
  "Spend Seed Marks on planning aids. Solutions never change.": "将种子标记用于规划辅助工具。解决方案永远不会改变。",
  "Spend shared WeightPlay diamonds on special animal guards.": "将共享的 WeightPlay 钻石用于特殊的动物守卫。",
  "Spend stage coins to place soldiers or WeightPlay heroes on normal ground tiles. Use the visible range preview before confirming a position.": "花费阶段金币将士兵或 WeightPlay 英雄放置在普通地砖上。在确认位置之前使用可见范围预览。",
  "Spend Star Gears on permanent recovery-ring tuning.": "将星齿轮用于永久恢复环调整。",
  "Spend Star Notes on permanent pulse tuning.": "在永久脉冲调谐上花费星星笔记。",
  "Spend the stack automatically at the dock and reach the finish before a rival.": "在码头自动使用堆叠并在对手之前到达终点。",
  "Spend tickets on the gate, one of three facilities, or a new animal.": "在大门、三个设施之一或新动物上花费门票。",
  "Spend upgrade points earned from victories. Upgrades are local-only and optional.": "花费从胜利中获得的升级积分。升级仅限本地且可选。",
  "Spettro diviso": "分光光度计",
  "Spezza due placche del boss mentre elimini le ancore.": "斯佩扎（Spezza）是老板的心头好。",
  "Spezza le tre fasi finali del boss, le scorte e i piloni mobili.": "最后，我的老板、我的小伙子和皮洛尼·莫比利。",
