  "SPIN": "旋转",
  "Spin 3 reels": "旋转 3 个卷轴",
  "Spin animal runes to command attacks. Read the monster's intent, hold one reel, and let Mimi's rabbit rune restore your health.": "旋转动物符文来指挥攻击。读懂怪物的意图，握住一根卷轴，让咪咪的兔子符文恢复你的生命值。",
  "Spin downward": "向下旋转",
  "Spin downward reels. Matching lines double their effect; pets attack separately while defense and healing combine for the summoner.": "向下旋转卷轴。搭配线条效果加倍；宠物单独攻击，同时为召唤者提供防御和治疗。",
  "Spin, read the completed lines, and continue until every wave and guardian is defeated.": "旋转，阅读完整的线条，然后继续，直到每一波和守护者都被击败。",
  "Spin: the three center runes act from left to right.": "旋转：三个中心符文从左到右起作用。",
  "Spin: watch all three reel strips slow down and stop.": "旋转：观察所有三个卷轴带减慢并停止。",
  "Spingi e attira": "斯宾吉·阿提拉",
  "Spingi lo spirito spettrale di Panko tra portali rotanti con emblemi e ripristina 30 torri dell'aurora progettate.": "Spingi lo Spirito spettrale di Panko tra Portali rotanti con emblemi e ripristina 30 torri dell'aurora progettate。",
  "Spingi, attira e instrada carichi runici in 30 magazzini celesti con ghiaccio, segnali, magneti e casse collegate.": "Spingi、attira 和 instrada carichi runici 在 30 杂志 celesti con ghiaccio、segnali、magneti 和 casse 大学中。",
  "Spiral Grip": "螺旋握把",
  "Spirit orb is flying. Watch the bounce route and prepare the next aim.": "灵珠飞舞。观察弹跳路线并准备下一个目标。",
