  "Spotlight, bell, mirror, clockwork, shadow, and seal rules overlap. Triple Lock relocates extraction after the relic. Eclipse Curator combines the full vocabulary, reverses patrol direction after the mission object, and moves the final exit.": "聚光灯、钟、镜子、发条、阴影和印章规则重叠。三重锁定将提取重新定位在遗物之后。 Eclipse Curator 结合了完整的词汇，在任务对象之后反转巡逻方向，并移动最后的出口。",
  "Sprache": "语言",
  "Spread links across two materials to resist overload.": "将链接分布在两种材料上以抵抗过载。",
  "Spring restored": "春天恢复了",
  "Spring Restored!": "春天恢复了！",
  "Spring stage selector": "弹簧级选择器",
  "Squad Action": "小队行动",
  "Squad HP {playerHp}/{playerMax} | Enemy HP {enemyHp}/{enemyMax}": "小队 HP {playerHp}/{playerMax} |敌方生命值 {enemyHp}/{enemyMax}",
  "Squad Level, XP, Runes, best mission, unlocked mission, hero levels, Training Slot, saved attack, health and Energy bonuses, and Revive Tokens are stored locally in this browser. No login is required for basic play. Clearing site storage or using another browser may create a separate save. Diamonds are optional platform currency used only for a reward reroll or the confirmed Training Slot; all 30 missions, seven terrain systems, special enemies and six Bosses remain playable without them. Skill Reports describe the completed play session and are not a formal ability test.": "小队等级、XP、符文、最佳任务、解锁任务、英雄等级、训练槽、保存的攻击、生命值和能量奖励以及复活令牌都存储在该浏览器本地。基本游戏无需登录。清除站点存储或使用其他浏览器可能会创建单独的保存。钻石是可选的平台货币，仅用于奖励重新滚动或确认的训练位置；所有 30 个任务、七个地形系统、特殊敌人和六个 Boss 在没有它们的情况下仍然可以玩。技能报告描述了已完成的比赛，并不是正式的能力测试。",
  "Squad Lv.{level} · {xp}/100 XP · {runes} Runes · Best Mission {best}": "小队Lv.{level}·{xp}/100 XP·{runes}符文·最佳任务{best}",
  "Squad Lv.{level} / {xp} XP to next level": "小队 Lv.{level} / {xp} XP 提升至下一等级",
