  "Stage {stage}": "阶段{stage}",
  "Stage {stage} - Wave {round}/5": "阶段 {stage} - 波 {round}/5",
  "Stage {stage} cleared! Stage {next} is now unlocked.": "阶段 {stage} 已清除！阶段 {next} 现已解锁。",
  "Stage {stage} cleared. Routes, blockers, upgrades, and hero timing worked together.": "阶段 {stage} 已清除。路线、障碍物、升级和英雄时机一起发挥作用。",
  "Stage {stage} cleared. The next trail is unlocked, and this stage remains available for replay.": "阶段 {stage} 已清除。下一条线索已解锁，并且此阶段仍可重玩。",
  "Stage {stage} remains uncleared. Read its hazard warning, adjust your attribute choices, and try again.": "阶段 {stage} 仍未清除。阅读其危险警告，调整您的属性选择，然后重试。",
  "Stage {stage} unlocked": "阶段{stage}已解锁",
  "Stage {stage}, Wave {round}/5, Hearts {hearts}/4, Supplies {supplies}. Leaving loses this run's temporary squad, relic, and unsettled progress; permanent training and unlocked stages stay safe.": "阶段 {stage}，波浪 {round}/5，红心 {hearts}/4，补给 {supplies}。离开会失去本次运行的临时小队、遗迹和不稳定的进度；永久训练和解锁阶段保持安全。",
  "Stage {stage}/{stageCount}. Time {time}. Golden keys {keys}/{target}. HP {hp}/{maxHp}. Level {level}. Move with WASD or arrow keys, or click, tap, and drag. The ranger automatically attacks the nearest enemy in range. Stage rule: {rule}": "阶段{stage}/{stageCount}。时间 {time}。金钥匙{keys}/{target}。 HP {hp}/{maxHp}。级别 {level}。使用 WASD 或箭头键移动，或单击、点击并拖动。游侠会自动攻击范围内最近的敌人。阶段规则：{rule}",
  "Stage {value}": "阶段{value}",
  "Stage {value} / 30": "阶段{value} / 30",
  "Stage {value} has no Boss wave.": "阶段{value}没有Boss波。",
  "Stage {value} repeats an edge.": "阶段{value}重复一条边。",
  "Stage 1": "第一阶段",
  "Stage 1 · 1/10": "第一阶段·1/10",
  "Stage 1 / 30": "第一阶段 / 30",
  "Stage clear after this wave.": "这一波过后，舞台就清空了。",
  "Stage Clear!": "舞台清零！",
  "Stage Complete": "阶段完成",
  "Stage list": "舞台列表",
  "Stage locked": "舞台已锁定",
  "Stage locked.": "舞台锁定。",
  "Stage Map": "舞台地图",
  "Stage modes": "舞台模式",
  "Stage pages": "舞台页面",
  "Stage progress": "阶段进展",
