  "Steam Toads increase corrosion, while Furnace Boars turn occupied cells in the top row into incoming heat damage. Leaving ventilation space can be more valuable than filling every cell. The Furnace Leviathan combines heat and corrosion, so its stage rewards healing, burst damage, and a deliberately open top row.": "蒸汽蟾蜍会增加腐蚀，而熔炉野猪会将顶排中被占用的细胞转化为传入的热损伤。留下通风空间比填满每个细胞更有价值。熔炉利维坦结合了热量和腐蚀，因此它的阶段奖励治疗、爆发伤害和故意开放的顶排。",
