  "Strength": "实力",
  "Strength shortens encounters, Constitution forgives hazard mistakes, Agility improves positioning, and Luck creates less predictable burst. The best choice depends on the stage rule, not a universal upgrade order.": "力量可以缩短遭遇时间，体质可以避免危险错误，敏捷可以改善定位，而运气则可以产生更难以预测的爆发。最佳选择取决于阶段规则，而不是通用的升级顺序。",
  "Strength shortens fights, Constitution forgives mistakes, Agility improves positioning, and Luck creates variable burst; choose for the current stage rule.": "力量缩短战斗时间，体质原谅错误，敏捷提高定位，运气创造可变爆发；选择当前阶段的规则。",
