  "Submit the completed word path and continue.": "提交完整的单词路径并继续。",
  "Success is not measured only by survival. Stage cards retain the best score and show cleared and Perfect states. Five, fifteen, and thirty Garden Medals grant one-time coin rewards, so replaying an early stage with a cleaner layout still advances training. Coins improve guard health, damage, and attack timing locally in this browser. Diamonds are only used for the optional Fox unlock; every stage can be completed with the three starting guards.": "成功不仅仅以生存来衡量。舞台卡保留最佳分数并显示已清除和完美状态。五枚、十五枚和三十枚花园奖章会授予一次性硬币奖励，因此以更清晰的布局重玩早期阶段仍然可以促进训练。硬币可以改善此浏览器中的本地守卫健康状况、损害和攻击时机。钻石仅用于可选的福克斯解锁；每个阶段都可以由三名首发后卫完成。",
