  "Three-Room Hero Action Trials": "三室英雄动作试炼",
  "Three-room runs:": "三房运行：",
  "Three-room runs: Rooms 1 and 2 contain authored enemy combinations. Clearing each opens a mandatory free choice of Power, Cooldown, or Recovery. Room 3 is an elite captain on ordinary trials and a named Boss on checkpoint trials.": "三房间运行：房间 1 和 2 包含编写的敌人组合。清除每个选项都会打开强制自由选择能量、冷却时间或恢复时间。 3号房间在普通试炼中是精英队长，在关卡试炼中是指定Boss。",
  "Three-Step Practice": "三步练习",
  "Three-wave route: Waves 1 and 2 establish the route's enemy rule. Wave 3 uses an authored elite formation, except Routes 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30, which end with a named regional Boss. A cleared wave pauses inside Battle for one blessing choice, then resumes the same route with surviving core HP and current upgrades.": "三波路线：第一波和第二波确立了该路线的敌人统治。第 3 波使用精心设计的精英阵型，但 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 号路线除外，这些路线以指定的区域 Boss 结尾。一波清除的浪潮会在战斗中暂停以获得一个祝福选择，然后以剩余的核心生命值和当前的升级恢复相同的路线。",
  "Three-wave route: Waves 1 and 2 establish the route&#39;s enemy rule. Wave 3 uses an authored elite formation, except Routes 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30, which end with a named regional Boss. A cleared wave pauses inside Battle for one blessing choice, then resumes the same route with surviving core HP and current upgrades.": "三波路线：第一波和第二波确立了该路线的敌人统治。第 3 波使用精心设计的精英阵型，但 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 号路线除外，这些路线以指定的区域 Boss 结尾。一波清除的浪潮会在战斗中暂停以获得一个祝福选择，然后以剩余的核心生命值和当前的升级恢复相同的路线。",
