  "Tidy Habitat raises happiness, while Enrichment Time awards tickets. Both share a short care cooldown, so the current goal should guide the choice.": "整洁的栖息地提升幸福感，丰富的时光则奖励门票。两者都有较短的护理冷却时间，因此当前的目标应该指导选择。",
