  "Tortuga Escudo": "托尔图加埃斯库多",
  "Total {n}": "总计{n}",
  "Total Games": "总比赛数",
  "Total guardado: {points} puntos de mejora · {diamonds} diamantes": "总保护量：{points} puntos de mejora · {diamonds} diamantes",
  "Total guardado: {points} puntos de mejora · {diamonds} diamantes · Se necesitan 3 / Tienes {diamonds}.": "总防护：{points} puntos de mejora · {diamonds} diamantes · Se necesitan 3 / Tienes {diamonds}。",
  "Total team DEF × count protects the summoner; a line doubles it.": "全队总防御力×保护召唤者数量；一条线使它加倍。",
  "Total team HEAL × count restores the summoner; a line doubles it.": "团队总治疗量×恢复召唤者的数量；一条线使它加倍。",
  "Touch and mouse players may tap or drag through the same care transaction; keyboard players use the same native buttons and focus sequence. Stage, Battle, and Result keep one logical composition that scales uniformly on phones, tablets, desktop, and short landscape screens. Unlike Animal Quiz, this game asks what kind of care tool fits the moment rather than which animal matches a fact. The Kids route has no account, purchase, leaderboard, advertising request, or ad reserve.": "触摸和鼠标玩家可以通过点击或拖动来完成相同的护理交易；键盘演奏者使用相同的本机按钮和焦点顺序。舞台、战斗和结果保持一种逻辑组合，在手机、平板电脑、台式机和短横向屏幕上统一缩放。与动物测验不同，该游戏询问哪种护理工具适合当前情况，而不是哪种动物符合事实。儿童路线没有帐户、购买、排行榜、广告请求或广告储备。",
  "Touch friendly": "触摸友好",
  "Touch or click the arena, press the Pulse button, Space, Enter, or Arrow Up once for one identical vertical impulse. Holding never repeats the action; release before the next pulse.": "触摸或单击区域，按脉冲按钮、空格键、Enter 键或向上箭头一次可获得相同的垂直脉冲。保持从不重复该动作；在下一个脉冲之前释放。",
  "Touch the golden key star before crossing the rose gate.": "在穿过玫瑰门之前触摸金钥匙星。",
  "Touch-first games for quick sessions.": "触摸优先游戏可实现快速会话。",
  "Touch, mouse, and keyboard use one simulation. Movement, collision, score, timer, rivals, and rewards never change with screen size.": "触摸、鼠标和键盘使用一种模拟。移动、碰撞、得分、计时器、对手和奖励永远不会随着屏幕尺寸的变化而改变。",
  "Touching a matching Aurora tile adds it to the carried stack up to the current capacity. Entering the marked area around any bridge dock automatically submits one or more carried tiles; no exact pixel alignment or extra strength condition is required.": "触摸匹配的极光图块会将其添加到携带的堆栈中，直至达到当前容量。进入任何桥码头周围的标记区域会自动提交一张或多张携带的图块；不需要精确的像素对齐或额外的强度条件。",
  "Tour {n}": "游览{n}",
  "Tourner et chuter": "图纳和楚特",
  "Tournez les miroirs": "图尔内兹·莱斯·米鲁瓦",
  "Tournez les tuyaux": "图尔内兹·莱斯·图亚克斯",
  "Tournez les tuyaux de Panko, alimentez chaque segment et faites refleurir le bosquet.": "Tournez les tuyaux de Panko、alimentez chaque 部分和 faites refleurir le bosquet。",
  "Towel": "毛巾",
  "Tower {n}": "塔{n}",
  "Tower {n} answered Panko's pulse in {time}s.": "塔{n}在{time}秒内回应了Panko的脉搏。",
  "Tower 30 remains replayable and Result returns to Towers without offering a nonexistent Tower 31.": "塔 30 仍然可重玩，结果返回到塔，而不会提供不存在的塔 31。",
  "Tower Defense": "塔防",
  "Tower Map": "塔楼地图",
  "TOWER RESTORED": "塔楼已修复",
  "Tower unlocks, medals, times, notes, upgrades, and the cosmetic trail are stored only in the current browser.": "塔楼解锁、奖牌、时间、注释、升级和装饰痕迹仅存储在当前浏览器中。",
  "Tower, pyramid, and sanctuary layouts combine seals, rescues, and alternating patrol routes. Board 30 contains twelve pairs over three layers and ends the campaign without creating a Board 31.": "塔楼、金字塔和圣所布局结合了海豹突击队、救援队和交替巡逻路线。 Board 30 在三层中包含 12 对，并在不创建 Board 31 的情况下结束活动。",
  "Towers": "塔楼",
  "Toy": "玩具",
  "Traccia rotte sicure": "特拉西亚·罗特·西库尔",
  "Trace a complete fruit-to-home route before moving.": "搬家前追踪完整的水果到家的路线。",
  "Trace backward from the destination and forward from the spring before rotating crowded junctions.": "在旋转拥挤的路口之前，从目的地向后追溯，从泉源向前追溯。",
  "Trace backward from the plant and forward from the source.": "从工厂向后追溯，从源头向前追溯。",
  "Trace every constellation trail exactly once across 30 original puzzles with start seals, comet arrows, numbered stars, keys, and gates.": "在 30 个带有起始印章、彗星箭头、编号星星、钥匙和门的原创谜题中准确追踪每个星座轨迹一次。",
  "Trace every trail exactly once and relight the Animal Star Map.": "准确地追踪每条踪迹一次并重新点亮动物星图。",
  "Trace inside the turquoise trail without touching its edge.": "沿着绿松石色的小道内部追踪，但不要触及其边缘。",
  "Trace rotas seguras": "跟踪路线",
  "Trace the covering stack above each starred rescue family.": "追踪每个带星号的救援家庭上方的覆盖物。",
  "Tracing started. Move the mouse, or keep holding and drag.": "追踪开始了。移动鼠标，或按住并拖动。",
  "Track blinking bats between marked perches": "追踪标记栖息地之间眨眼的蝙蝠",
  "Track every active orb after a split and clear all breakable crystals before the final orb falls.": "跟踪分裂后的每个活动球体，并在最后一个球体掉落之前清除所有易碎晶体。",
  "Track moving gears and conveyor drift.": "跟踪移动齿轮和传送带漂移。",
  "Track pairs already in the tray before adding a new singleton type.": "在添加新的单例类型之前，跟踪托盘中已有的对。",
  "Track the returning light, move early, and strike with the paddle edge to reach protected lanes. Catch prism powers without abandoning the next return.": "跟踪返回的光线，尽早移动，并用桨边缘撞击以到达受保护的车道。抓住棱镜的力量而不放弃下一次的回报。",
  "Track the Salamander's previous cell before advancing.": "在前进之前追踪火蜥蜴之前的牢房。",
  "Track two chargers alternating lane marks.": "跟踪两个充电器交替的车道标记。",
  "Track two wisps phasing on alternating rhythms.": "追踪两股交替节奏的小精灵。",
