  "Trail Seal boards hold marked inner tiles until the glowing diamond pair clears. Family Rescue boards track two starred matching families. Ranger Trial combines seal and rescue; Grand Reserve adds the alternating patrol route.": "Trail Seal 板固定有标记的内部瓷砖，直到发光的钻石对清除。家庭救援委员会追踪两个加星标的匹配家庭。游侠审判结合了海豹和救援；大保护区增加了交替巡逻路线。",
  "Trail Seal: clear the diamond key pair to open sealed tiles.": "踪迹封印：清除钻石钥匙对即可打开封印的方块。",
