  "Train and position a six-animal squad across 30 five-wave stages, six regions, varied enemy formations, and six unique bosses.": "在 30 个五波阶段、六个区域、不同的敌人阵型和六个独特的 Boss 中训练和部署一支六动物小队。",
  "Train and position ten animal heroes across 30 five-wave stages, six regions, and six unique boss battles.": "在 30 个五波阶段、六个区域和六场独特的 Boss 战斗中训练和部署 10 名动物英雄。",
