  "Trascina e scegli un livello sbloccato.": "Trascina e scegli un livello sbloccato。",
  "Tray": "托盘",
  "Tray {current}/{total}": "托盘 {current}/{total}",
  "Tray {current}/{total} is ready!": "托盘 {current}/{total} 已准备就绪！",
  "Tray full": "托盘已满",
  "Traza 30 misiones y captura seis peces Guardianes.": "Traza 30 任务和捕获守护者。",
  "Tre oggetti uguali scompaiono.": "Tre oggetti uguali scompaiono。",
  "Tre uguali scompaiono dal vassoio.": "Tre uguali scompaiono dal vassoio。",
  "Treasure +2 / O2 -16": "宝藏 +2 / O2 -16",
  "Treasure becomes the first of two seals, changing collection order. Crossed paths, shadow shelters, and changing patrol speed are combined before Vault Sealkeeper guards the central route at the checkpoint.": "宝藏成为两个封印中的第一个，改变了收集顺序。在避难所封印守卫在检查站守卫中央路线之前，交叉路径、阴影庇护所和不断变化的巡逻速度结合在一起。",
  "Treasure cache: +2 salvage, -16 oxygen.": "宝藏：+2 打捞，-16 氧气。",
  "Treasure first, then the relic; extraction relocates after pickup.": "先有宝藏，后有遗物；提取后拾取后重新定位。",
  "Treasure insurance is active for the next mission.": "宝藏保险正在为下一个任务而活跃。",
  "Treasure is the first seal; the relic unlocks second.": "宝物是第一印；遗物第二次解锁。",
  "Treasure pile": "宝藏堆",
  "Treasure secured": "宝藏安全",
  "Treasure sorting puzzle": "宝藏分类谜题",
  "Treat a mismatch as useful location information on classic boards.": "将不匹配视为经典棋盘上的有用位置信息。",
  "Treat a retry as a calm chance to compare the four pictures again.": "将重试视为再次比较四张图片的冷静机会。",
  "Treat arrows, numbers, keys, and gates as route constraints rather than decoration.": "将箭头、数字、钥匙和门视为路线约束而不是装饰。",
  "Treat bell and guardian glow warnings as decisions. Enter shadow before the pulse or pursuit begins, then plan the next route from cover.": "将铃声和守护者发光警告视为决定。在脉冲或追击开始之前进入阴影，然后从掩体中计划下一条路线。",
  "Treat Cooling, Seal and Orbit cells as resources; permanent stats do not replace positioning.": "将冷却、密封和轨道细胞视为资源；永久统计数据不会取代定位。",
  "Treat each holding space as a scarce resource, not free storage.": "将每个存储空间视为稀缺资源，而不是免费存储。",
  "Treat moss stones as temporary obstacles that can leave with a completed line.": "将苔藓石头视为临时障碍物，可以在完成线路后离开。",
  "Treat oxygen as a route budget. A high-loot cache is useful only if the remaining zones and possible escape still fit that budget.": "将氧气视为路线预算。仅当剩余区域和可能的逃生仍然符合预算时，高战利品缓存才有用。",
  "Treat the pale attack ring as a spacing guide and stay near its outer edge.": "将苍白的攻击环作为间距引导并保持在其外边缘附近。",
  "Treats mix light, dark, and warm colors.": "混合浅色、深色和暖色。",
