  "Trial Marks, unlocked trials, selected hero, and permanent mastery are saved locally.": "试炼标记、解锁的试炼、选定的英雄和永久掌握都保存在本地。",
  "Trial unlocks, Marks, Heart Mastery, and selected hero are saved locally; temporary blessings reset.": "试炼解锁、印记、心术、所选英雄均保存在本地；暂时的祝福重置。",
  "Trial unlocks, Marks, Heart Mastery, and selected hero are saved locally. Temporary blessings reset each run.": "试炼解锁、标记、心术掌握和所选英雄均保存在本地。每次运行都会重置临时祝福。",
  "Trials 1-5 teach direct Scout pursuit and end with Shadow Prowler's warned shockwave.": "试炼 1-5 教导侦察兵直接追击，并以暗影徘徊者的警告冲击波结束。",
  "Trials 1-5, Rootwood:": "试验 1-5，根伍德：",
  "Trials 11-15 add warned Boar charges. Magma Tusk Colossus resists damage until a charge creates an opening.": "试验 11-15 添加警告野猪指控。岩浆獠牙巨像可以抵抗伤害，直到冲锋造成开口。",
  "Trials 11-15, Ember Forge:": "试炼 11-15，灰烬熔炉：",
  "Trials 16-20 add distance-keeping Hunters and mixed approach angles. Eclipse Archowl fires timed volleys.": "试验 16-20 添加了保持距离的猎人和混合接近角度。日蚀弓箭手发射定时齐射。",
  "Trials 16-20, Moon Range:": "试炼 16-20，月球范围：",
  "Trials 21-25 overlap armor, charges, and range. Abyss Shell Leviathan summons two reinforcements below roughly half health.": "试验 21-25 重叠装甲、装药和射程。深渊贝壳利维坦召唤两名生命值低于一半的援军。",
  "Trials 21-25, Abyss Shell:": "试炼 21-25，深渊贝壳：",
  "Trials 26-30 combine all five families. Void Crown Emperor gains a guarded middle phase and calls Raven plus armored support in its final phase.": "试验 26-30 结合了所有五个家庭。虚空王冠获得了中间阶段的防守，并在最后阶段召唤乌鸦和装甲支援。",
  "Trials 26-30, Void Crown:": "试炼 26-30，虚空王冠：",
  "Trials 6-10 add curved Ravens and armor. Prism Basilisk alternates protected and open windows.": "试验 6-10 添加了弯曲的乌鸦和盔甲。棱镜蛇怪交替受保护和打开的窗口。",
