  "Try contrasting nearby colors to keep shapes easy to read.": "尝试对比附近的颜色以使形状易于阅读。",
  "Try placing guards earlier and collect every sun.": "尝试更早地放置守卫并收集每个太阳。",
  "Try spring {from} → {to}.": "尝试春天{from}→{to}。",
  "Try that bounce again!": "再次尝试弹跳！",
  "Try the glowing screw and hole.": "尝试发光螺丝和孔。",
  "Try the matching car.": "尝试匹配的汽车。",
  "Try the spiral again": "再次尝试螺旋",
  "Try this order again.": "再次尝试此命令。",
  "Tu mochila y el encuentro actual se conservan mientras decides.": "Tu mochila y el encuentro real se conservan mientras 决定。",
  "Tune · {n} ♪": "调·{n}♪",
  "Tune · {n} ⚙": "调·{n}⚙",
  "Tuning the spectrum drum…": "调音谱鼓...",
  "Tunnel Canopy": "隧道雨棚",
  "Turbulent echo": "湍急的回声",
  "Turn": "转",
  "Turn flow: select a living hero, then choose one action. Move to an adjacent legal cell, attack within range, Guard to reduce the next hit, or spend one Energy on a Skill. Lion strikes harder, Owl reaches two cells, and Turtle guards the group while healing one HP. After all living heroes act, or End Turn is pressed, enemies resolve and Energy returns by one up to three.": "回合流程：选择一名活着的英雄，然后选择一个动作。移动到相邻的合法单元格，在范围内攻击，防御以减少下一次攻击，或在技能上花费一个能量。狮子攻击更加猛烈，猫头鹰到达两个格子，乌龟守护队伍，同时恢复一生命值。在所有活着的英雄行动后，或按下结束回合后，敌人会结算，能量会恢复一到三。",
  "Turn flow: select a living hero, then choose one action. Moving uses an adjacent legal cell. Attack requires the hero's range. Guard reduces the next enemy hit by one. A Skill spends one Energy: Lion strikes harder, Owl reaches a distant target, and Turtle guards every living hero while healing one HP. A hero is marked Done after acting. When every living hero has acted, or End Turn is pressed, all living enemies resolve their behavior and Energy returns by one up to three.": "回合流程：选择一名活着的英雄，然后选择一个动作。移动使用相邻的合法单元格。攻击需要英雄的射程。守卫使下一个被击中的敌人减一。技能消耗 1 点能量：狮子攻击更猛烈，猫头鹰到达远处目标，海龟守护每一个活着的英雄，同时恢复 1 点生命值。英雄在表演后被标记为“完成”。当每个活着的英雄都行动起来，或者按下结束回合时，所有活着的敌人都会解决他们的行为，并且能量会恢复一到三。",
  "Turn mirrors so warm sunlight reaches every sleeping plant.": "转动镜子，让温暖的阳光照射到每一棵沉睡的植物上。",
  "Turn over a second tile. Identical pictures become a completed pair; different pictures close after a short visible pause.": "翻转第二块瓷砖。相同的图片成为完整的一对；不同的图片在短暂可见的停顿后关闭。",
  "Turn over one tile and remember its picture and position.": "翻转一块瓷砖并记住它的图片和位置。",
  "Turn over two cards and match identical garden pictures.": "翻开两张卡片并匹配相同的花园图片。",
  "Turn Panko's bamboo pipes, carry water through every segment, and bring the flowering grove back to life.": "转动 Panko 的竹管，将水输送到各个部分，让花林恢复生机。",
  "Turn sound on": "打开声音",
  "Turn structure: a player turn restores Energy, clears temporary Block and draws three cards. Played or leftover cards enter the discard pile; when the draw pile empties, the discard pile is shuffled back. Visible intent identifies the enemy's next action unless fog is active.": "回合结构：玩家回合恢复能量，清除临时障碍并抓三张牌。已打出的牌或剩余的牌进入弃牌堆；当抽牌堆空时，弃牌堆被洗回。除非有雾，否则可见的意图可以识别敌人的下一步行动。",
  "Turn structure: a player turn restores Energy, clears temporary Block and draws three cards. Played or leftover cards enter the discard pile; when the draw pile empties, the discard pile is shuffled back. Visible intent identifies the enemy&#39;s next action unless fog is active.": "回合结构：玩家回合恢复能量，清除临时障碍并抓三张牌。已打出的牌或剩余的牌进入弃牌堆；当抽牌堆空时，弃牌堆被洗回。除非有雾，否则可见的意图可以识别敌人的下一步行动。",
  "Turn the bamboo. Let every drop reach the flowering grove.": "转动竹子。让每一滴水都到达花丛。",
  "Turn the tower. Read the landing. Keep the fall alive.": "转塔。阅读着陆。让秋天保持活力。",
  "Turn-Based Roguelike Deckbuilder": "回合制 Roguelike 牌组构建者",
