  "Victories award four to nine Trial Marks and unlock exactly the next trial. Heart Mastery costs five Marks for the first level and four more for each later level; every level gives all heroes 12 additional maximum health.": "胜利会奖励四到九个试炼标记，并解锁下一次试炼。掌握心灵，第一级需要花费 5 马克，后面每级需要花费 4 马克；每个级别都会为所有英雄提供 12 点额外的最大生命值。",
  "Victory": "胜利",
  "Victory grants XP and Runes. XP raises Squad Level; Runes upgrade the three heroes to Level 6. A saved Rune Reward adds attack, health, 35 XP, starting Energy or a future half-health revive. Optional three-Diamond rerolls and the 18-Diamond Training Slot never unlock missions or Bosses.": "胜利可获得经验值和符文。 XP 提高小队等级；符文将三位英雄升级到 6 级。保存的符文奖励会增加攻击力、生命值、35 XP、起始能量或未来的半生命值复活。可选的 3 钻石重新滚动和 18 钻石训练槽永远不会解锁任务或 Boss。",
