  "Visible search time has no failure limit. It records only time when the habitat is active; switching apps or hiding the page pauses the measurement. A completed result compares the run with the same habitat's local best.": "可见搜索时间没有失败限制。它只记录栖息地活跃的时间；切换应用程序或隐藏页面会暂停测量。完整的结果将跑步与相同栖息地的当地最佳成绩进行比较。",
