  "Watch cleared snacks disappear together, then use the falling refill to prepare cascades.": "看着清除的零食一起消失，然后使用掉落的补充装备瀑布。",
  "Watch closely. The cards will hide soon!": "仔细观察。卡片很快就会隐藏起来！",
  "Watch Done markers and the selected hero panel. End Turn early only when preserving position is safer than using every action.": "观看“完成”标记和选定的英雄面板。仅当保持位置比使用每个动作更安全时才尽早结束转弯。",
  "Watch Done markers. End Turn early only when preserving position is safer than another action.": "观看“完成”标记。仅当保持位置比其他行动更安全时才提前结束转弯。",
  "Watch for quick direction changes and slide back gently.": "注意方向的快速变化并轻轻向后滑动。",
  "Watch four pairs before every card turns over.": "在每张牌翻开之前观察四对。",
  "Watch NEXT INTENT. Rabbit heals; claw empowers the enemy.": "观看下一个意图。兔子痊愈；利爪赋予敌人力量。",
  "Watch patrol sight circles and the Alert meter. Enter a cyan shadow circle when a bell, spotlight, or crossing patrol makes open movement unsafe.": "观察巡逻视线和警报计。当铃声、聚光灯或路口巡逻使开放移动不安全时，进入青色阴影圈。",
  "Watch rival routes in later chapters because they can remove the easy objects you intended to use.": "在后面的章节中观察竞争对手的路线，因为它们可以删除您打算使用的简单对象。",
  "Watch the downward path rather than chasing the orb after it has already reached the paddle.": "观察向下的路径，而不是在球体已经到达桨后追逐球体。",
  "Watch the ground and the enemies together. Dashed hazard outlines are warnings; filled bright lanes are active. A Boss shield ring means ordinary slashes are strongly reduced until its counter window opens.": "一起观察地面和敌人。虚线危险轮廓是警告；充满的明亮车道处于活动状态。 Boss 护盾环意味着普通的斩击会被强烈减少，直到它的柜台窗口打开。",
  "Watch the lane warning and prepare before fast beasts enter.": "留意车道警告并在快速野兽进入之前做好准备。",
  "Watch the moving sight circles and Alert meter. A patrol that remains close to Fia raises Alert; reaching clear space or entering a cyan shadow shelter lets the meter fall.": "观察移动的瞄准圈和警报计。靠近国际汽联的巡逻队发出警报；到达空旷空间或进入青色阴影庇护所会使仪表下降。",
  "Watch the nearest scan marker approach the spirit's action line.": "观察最近的扫描标记接近灵魂的行动线。",
  "Watch the wheel rotate and compare the vehicle's response with the terrain cue.": "观察车轮旋转并将车辆的响应与地形提示进行比较。",
  "Watch the wind; flying bubbles drift sideways": "观察风向；飞行的气泡向侧面漂移",
  "Watch three reel strips stop in sequence: lions multiply attack, turtles multiply defense, rabbit gems heal, and dormant stones are blank while one to three monsters fight back across 30 battles.": "观看三个卷轴条按顺序停止：狮子增加攻击力，海龟增加防御力，兔子宝石治愈，休眠宝石空白，而一到三个怪物在 30 场战斗中反击。",
  "Watch which bubbles will fall into the cleared cells and use non-order groups only when they create a stronger route.": "观察哪些气泡会落入已清除的单元格中，并且仅当它们创建更强的路线时才使用无序组。",
  "Watch wind direction before committing to a narrow landing.": "在进行狭窄着陆之前观察风向。",
