  "When a fish is hooked, drag in the tension lane and keep the red marker inside the safe band.": "当鱼上钩时，将其拖入张力线并将红色标记保持在安全带内。",
  "When a fish is hooked, drag left or right and keep the red marker inside the green safe band.": "当鱼上钩时，向左或向右拖动并将红色标记保持在绿色安全带内。",
  "When a gate is visible, locate its key first and make sure the route from key to gate is not cut off by water.": "当门可见时，首先找到门的钥匙，并确保从钥匙到门的路线没有被水切断。",
  "When a loop appears, change the first mirror that sends light back into an earlier cell.": "当出现环路时，更改将光发送回较早单元的第一个镜子。",
  "When a rescue objective reads 0/1 or 0/2, locate the core before filling the last quota points.": "当救援目标显示为 0/1 或 0/2 时，在填充最后一个配额点之前找到核心。",
  "When a species appears twice, remember which side still has its unfinished partner.": "当一个物种出现两次时，记住哪一边还有未完成的伙伴。",
  "When an extra box has no matching food, treat it as a looking clue rather than guessing quickly.": "当多余的盒子没有匹配的食物时，将其视为一个寻找线索，而不是快速猜测。",
  "When does a triple clear?": "三重什么时候清除？",
  "When is a move legal?": "什么时候搬家合法？",
  "When is Fia safe?": "国际汽联什么时候安全？",
  "When rows shift, re-read the board after every shot instead of repeating the same angle.": "当行移动时，每次射击后重新阅读棋盘，而不是重复相同的角度。",
  "When the active bus fills, it departs and the next bus becomes active. Matching passengers at the front of the holding lane board automatically.": "当活动巴士满员后，它就会离开，下一辆巴士就会开始活动。自动匹配等待车道板前方的乘客。",
  "When the fish appears, follow the green band with the red marker instead of forcing every fight back to the center.": "当鱼出现时，沿着带有红色标记的绿色带移动，而不是强迫每次战斗都回到中心。",
  "When the line breaks, cast again immediately. On Guardian missions, read the boss cue before making a large correction.": "当线断时，立即重新投掷。在守护者任务中，在做出大的修正之前先阅读老板的提示。",
  "When three minutes expire, the stage clears only if its key and Boss objectives are complete. Losing all HP or missing an objective leaves the stage available for another attempt.": "三分钟结束后，只有完成其关键目标和 Boss 目标后，该阶段才会被清除。失去所有生命值或错过目标后，舞台就可以进行另一次尝试。",
  "When tools change places after a mistake, scan the whole tray instead of tapping the previous position.": "当工具在错误后更换位置时，请扫描整个托盘，而不是点击之前的位置。",
  "When two icons appear, decide which need must be handled first rather than choosing an item for only the first icon.": "当出现两个图标时，决定必须首先处理哪个需求，而不是仅为第一个图标选择一个项目。",
  "When water stops, inspect the first dry joint rather than rotating pieces far downstream.": "当停水时，检查第一个干燥接头，而不是下游远处的旋转部件。",
