  "Winning moves directly to the next wave. Preparation reopens after a loss or draw while the run still has Hearts, so the initial formation should be able to handle more than one enemy pattern.": "获胜直接进入下一波。输球或平局后，当跑动仍有红心时，准备工作会重新开始，因此初始阵型应该能够应对多种敌人模式。",
  "Wird geladen": "野生凝胶",
