  "With four choices, remove animals that cannot live in the stated habitat or eat the named food.": "有四种选择，移除不能生活在指定栖息地或吃指定食物的动物。",
  "With two clues, decide which need has immediate priority.": "通过两条线索，确定哪个需求具有直接优先级。",
