  "Workshop levels add a modest Health benefit. Replaying a cleared stage can provide practice and XP without changing its authored enemy rule.": "研讨会级别增加了适度的健康益处。重玩已通关的关卡可以提供练习和经验值，而无需改变其制定的敌人规则。",
  "Workshop progress saved.": "研讨会进度已保存。",
  "Workshop puzzle selection": "工作坊拼图选择",
  "Workshop report": "研讨会报告",
  "Workshop restored!": "工坊恢复了！",
  "Workshop Trail": "工作坊路线",
  "Workshop upgrades provide modest speed, tolerance, or control support. They do not turn one universal wheel into the correct answer for every terrain.": "车间升级提供适度的速度、容差或控制支持。他们不会将一个万向轮变成针对每种地形的正确答案。",
  "Workshop XP, discovered items, and best-room progress are stored locally in the browser.": "创意工坊 XP、发现的物品和最佳房间进度都存储在本地浏览器中。",
  "Workshop XP, discoveries, completed stages, and the next unlocked stage are stored locally. Workshop levels provide a modest Health benefit. Diamonds are optional shared currency used only for one separately confirmed replacement of Orla's three shop offers; free progression does not require them.": "创意工坊 XP、发现、已完成的阶段和下一个解锁的阶段都存储在本地。研讨会级别提供适度的健康益处。钻石是可选的共享货币，仅用于单独确认的 Orla 三个商店优惠的替代品；自由进展不需要它们。",
  "World and Mission": "世界与使命",
  "Worldshell Aegis": "世界贝壳神盾",
  "Wounded enemies enter a speed surge.": "受伤的敌人进入速度激增状态。",
  "Wrong dock: follow the target shown above.": "错误的停靠点：按照上面显示的目标进行操作。",
