  "Your board is waiting. Resume when you are ready.": "您的董事会正在等待。准备好后继续。",
  "Your board, moves, score, and combo will be lost.": "你的棋盘、动作、得分和连击将会丢失。",
  "Your care progress in this mission will reset.": "您在此任务中的护理进度将重置。",
