  "Your completed progress is safe. This attempt will restart.": "您已完成的进度是安全的。此尝试将重新开始。",
  "Your current infinite run will be discarded. Saved best score and highest animal stay safe.": "您当前的无限运行将被放弃。保存最好的分数和最高的动物安全。",
  "Your current Mission {stage} board will be discarded. Saved clears and stars stay safe.": "您当前的任务{stage}板将被丢弃。保存的清除和星星保持安全。",
  "Your current pack and encounter are preserved while you decide.": "当您决定时，您当前的包和遭遇会被保留。",
