  "Your habitat is waiting. Resume when you are ready.": "你的栖息地正在等待。准备好后继续。",
  "Your Hearts reached 0. Spend 5 Diamonds to revive with 2 Hearts and continue your expedition?": "你的心已经达到0了。花费5颗钻石来复活2颗心并继续你的探险？",
  "Your latest games": "您最新的游戏",
  "Your line becomes both rune wheels. Its measured shape changes the cart's speed, height, grip, and clearance.": "你的线变成了两个符文轮。它的测量形状会改变小车的速度、高度、抓地力和间隙。",
