  "Zero retries awards three stars, a small number awards two, and additional retries award one. The Result Skill Report uses actual matches, first tries, retries and boarded passengers.": "零重试奖励三颗星，少量重试奖励两颗星，额外重试奖励一星。结果技能报告使用实际比赛、首次尝试、重试和登机的乘客。",
  "Zero retries awards three stars, a small number of retries awards two, and additional retries award one. Stars and the highest unlocked route are stored only in this browser.": "零次重试奖励三颗星，少量重试奖励两颗星，额外重试奖励一星。星星和最高的解锁路线仅存储在此浏览器中。",
  "Zero retries earns three stars, one or two earns two, and more retries earns one.": "零次重试获得三颗星，一两次重试获得两颗星，更多重试获得一颗星。",
  "Zero retries earns three stars, one or two retries earns two, and more retries earns one.": "零次重试将获得三颗星，一两次重试将获得两颗星，更多次重试将获得一颗星。",
