  "Zone {zone}/{total}, salvage {salvage}/{target}, and oxygen {oxygen}/{max} will be discarded.": "区域 {zone}/{total}、抢救物 {salvage}/{target} 和氧气 {oxygen}/{max} 将被丢弃。",
