  "Zoo Care Report": "动物园护理报告",
  "Zoo Growth Report": "动物园成长报告",
  "Zoo Helper Day": "动物园助手日",
  "Zoo Helper Day - How to Play": "动物园助手日 - 如何玩",
  "Zoo Helper Day - WeightPlay": "动物园助手日 - WeightPlay",
  "Zoo Helper Day game guide": "动物园助手日游戏指南",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a free bilingual Kids care game with 30 saved shifts across six animal zones. Children help a lion, panda, elephant, penguin, giraffe and koala with fruit, leaves, fish, water, brushes, showers, toys and balls. Early shifts name one exact item. Later chapters remove visible labels, accept a matching care category, briefly hide a request that can be shown again, or require two steps in order. Every fifth shift is a Keeper Check. There is no countdown, and a wrong item keeps the request open.": "Zoo Helper Day 是一款免费的双语儿童护理游戏，已保存 6 个动物区域的 30 个班次。孩子们用水果、树叶、鱼、水、刷子、淋浴、玩具和球帮助狮子、熊猫、大象、企鹅、长颈鹿和考拉。早班会说出一件具体的事情。后面的章节会删除可见标签，接受匹配的护理类别，短暂隐藏​​可以再次显示的请求，或者需要按顺序执行两个步骤。每第五次轮班进行一次保管员检查。没有倒计时，错误的项目会使请求保持打开状态。",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a free bilingual Kids care game with 30 saved shifts across six animal zones. Children help a lion, panda, elephant, penguin, giraffe, and koala by choosing or dragging pictures of fruit, leaves, fish, water, brushes, showers, toys, and balls. Early shifts name one exact item. Later chapters remove visible item labels, ask for a care category with more than one valid answer, briefly hide a request that can be shown again, or require two care steps in the correct order. Every fifth shift is a friendly Keeper Check. There is no countdown, and a wrong item keeps the same request open for another try.": "Zoo Helper Day 是一款免费的双语儿童护理游戏，已保存 6 个动物区域的 30 个班次。孩子们通过选择或拖动水果、树叶、鱼、水、刷子、淋浴、玩具和球的图片来帮助狮子、熊猫、大象、企鹅、长颈鹿和考拉。早班会说出一件具体的事情。后面的章节会删除可见的项目标签，询问具有多个有效答案的护理类别，短暂隐藏​​可以再次显示的请求，或者要求按正确顺序执行两个护理步骤。每第五次轮班都会有一次友好的守护者检查。没有倒计时，错误的项目会保留相同的请求以供再次尝试。",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a gentle zoo workday game where children help different animal zones earn tickets and keep visitors happy. Each stage is framed like a small zoo shift, with simple picture-based care actions, large touch targets, and friendly feedback so young players can understand the goal without heavy reading. It is designed to feel more like running a tiny zoo than only picking a helper item.": "《动物园助手日》是一款温和的动物园工作日游戏，孩子们可以帮助不同的动物区赚取门票，让游客开心。每个阶段的框架就像一个小型动物园轮班，具有简单的基于图片的护理动作、大型触摸目标和友好的反馈，因此年轻玩家无需大量阅读即可理解目标。它的设计感觉更像是经营一个小动物园，而不仅仅是挑选一个辅助物品。",
  "Zoo Helper Day may support picture recognition, broad care categories, short working memory, sequencing, focus and hand-eye coordination. Adults can explain that real animals need trained keepers, suitable diets, habitats, enrichment and veterinary support beyond this simplified game. Stars and Skill Report are play feedback, not a grade, diagnosis or child comparison. Progress stays in this browser. No child profile is required, and the Kids route requests no advertising.": "动物园助手日可能支持图片识别、广泛的护理类别、短工作记忆、排序、焦点和手眼协调。成年人可以解释说，除了这个简化的游戏之外，真正的动物还需要训练有素的饲养员、合适的饮食、栖息地、丰富的环境和兽医支持。星级和技能报告是游戏反馈，而不是成绩、诊断或儿童比较。进度保留在此浏览器中。不需要儿童资料，并且儿童路线不需要广告。",
  "Zoo Helper Day may support picture recognition, broad care categories, short working memory, simple sequencing, focus, and hand-eye coordination. An adult can name each picture and talk about how real animals need trained keepers, suitable diets, clean habitats, enrichment, and veterinary support beyond this simplified game. Stars and the Skill Report describe only the current play session; they are not a school grade, health claim, developmental diagnosis, or comparison with other children. Progress remains in the current browser and can disappear when local storage is cleared. No child profile is required, and the Kids route requests no advertising.": "动物园助手日可能支持图片识别、广泛的护理类别、短工作记忆、简单的排序、专注和手眼协调。成年人可以为每张图片命名，并谈论除了这个简化的游戏之外，真实的动物如何需要训练有素的饲养员、合适的饮食、清洁的栖息地、丰富的环境和兽医的支持。星星和技能报告仅描述当前的游戏会话；它们不是学校成绩、健康声明、发育诊断或与其他儿童的比较。进度保留在当前浏览器中，并且在清除本地存储后可能会消失。不需要儿童资料，并且儿童路线不需要广告。",
